<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">- Mbembe Osopong [MFNOs]</book>
  <para style="h">Nnwẹr s'Osenga</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nnwẹr s'Osenga</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nnwẹr s'Osenga</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nnwẹr s'Osenga</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EXO 1" />
  <para style="s">Ache p'iva p'Jekọb kw'ọbạra okpena Israẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 1:1" />Maa wọ ode ache p'ajunungva p'Israẹl, kw'ọbạra okpena Jekọb, p'uwa afon k'Ijip, ọnạng-ọnạng ọttạra ẹchọhmfhạr chẹ phyibh. <verse eid="EXO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 1:2" />Wa abẹ ade: Reubẹn, ọttạra Simeọn, ọttạra Lẹvi, ọttạra Juda, <verse eid="EXO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 1:3" />ọttạra Isaka, ọttạra Zẹbulun, ọttạra Bẹnjamin, <verse eid="EXO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 1:4" />ọttạra Dan, ọttạra Naphtali, ọttạra Gad, ọttạra Ashẹr. <verse eid="EXO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 1:5" />Josẹph ẹma wa, uchi eden uruk k'Ijip. Phyi-phyibh wa efonamma ch'Jekọb ede anạng-nạbh attaan ukuma jobh p'uwa utim ofona k'Ijip.<verse eid="EXO 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 1:6" />Wa Josẹph ọttạra efonamma chẹ phyibh, ọttạra ọgbọ mvọ phyibh akwu ape. <verse eid="EXO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 1:7" />Okhenka, efonamma ch'Jekọb n'ẹbhạkhẹ efhon ayok tạrr achẹ ẹsaabh, ẹbạra ikwu ẹbạr, ẹnyaamẹ ifu isisek nnọ <char style="it">bẹ ttạbh</char>.<verse eid="EXO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phero ọnạng anạng p'Israẹl irem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 1:8" />Wa ọvaarnạng ọbhakwẹ kw'nạn Josẹph osong ọdạbhẹ Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 1:9" />Wa obeni anạng pẹ bẹ́, “Akker o! Anạng mba p'Israẹl kk'asaabha kidaam-kidaam, abạra akhaama ẹfa ayọhnga mạna. <verse eid="EXO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 1:10" />Akwu antima ekkoji ankuma bẹ ọsaabh mva o, deja, de ekpong ebe ma etto, abẹ m'attạra awawunanạng pamạna arima mạna abẹ, bạrasẹ abẹ arạbh arik mạna isek.”<verse eid="EXO 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 1:11" />Ma wọ anạng p'Ijip arengi akker-atọhmnạng p'abin Ijip, ọfha abẹ anạng efhonfhạr ch'Israẹl ọtọhm f'irem abe asi. Anạng p'Israẹl asi ifhon-diden s'Pitọm, ọttạra Rameses masẹ ọkhaanga-chọhm anạng ọvaar Phero. <verse eid="EXO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 1:12" />Okhenka, oche ngwọ kw'anạng p'Ijip ado anạng p'Israẹl irem nạnạng, mạnna wọ kw'anạng p'Israẹl n'asaabh afona, abạra ado anyaam-ọnyaamẹ tạrr ojora ọnwa anạng p'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 1:13" />Ma wọ anạng p'Ijip n'ado anạng p'Israẹl irem sisi. <verse eid="EXO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 1:14" />Abẹ akwu asi akpen agbẹrẹ anạng p'Israẹl, ukwuru itọhm-kpọhkha s'idọhngọ bhạbhạkhẹ, ọttạra f'ata bạbạnga, ọttạra iwonu-tọhm k'ukhira-k'ukhira. Chibhi s'anạng p'Israẹl asi itọhm-kpọhkha anạng bẹ, anạng p'Ijip bẹ ikwosi násia.<verse eid="EXO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 1:15" />Ma wọ ọvaarnạng kw'Ijip obeni ipanạng p'n'atik aHiburu-panạng ọmaan, p'akpen Shiphra, ọttạra Pua bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 1:16" />“Okpe kw'abạnga m'atik aHiburu-panạng ọmaan, abạnga atạkha okpe akkeri k'ọmaanpa, de ode ujunungnwa, afhẹ-ẹ. Okhenka, de ode ọkwanạng-nwa, attẹ-ẹ ọbọhk uruk akpen.” <verse eid="EXO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 1:17" />Okhenka, s'atik-ipanạng-ọmaan mbọ akhaam ojora f'Ubinọkpaabyi, abẹ ntọhna s'ọvaarnạng kw'Ijip nátạkha. Abẹ atte ajunungva ọbọhk aruk akpen. <verse eid="EXO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 1:18" />Ma wọ ọvaarnạng kw'Ijip oyeri atik-ipanạng-ọmaan mbọ ọbạbh bẹ bẹ́, “Ukwuru yạn kw'abạnga asi udik demakwẹ ngwa? Oseng yạn kw'abạnga n'atte ajunungva ọbọhk arukh o?” <verse eid="EXO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 1:19" />Atik-ipanạng-ọmaan mbọ abhina Phero bẹ́, “AHiburu-panạng masẹ ipanạng p'Ijip nádia e. Abẹ bạra abạr ettem k'ọmaan. Ọmaan fabẹ ofor oseng eden, bạrasẹ atik-ipanạng-ọmaan ata akpira, abẹ kk'amaana.” <verse eid="EXO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 1:20" />Ma wọ Ubinọkpaabyi usi ọphyaam ọnạng ipanạng mbọ p'n'atik anạng ọmaan, anạng p'Israẹl afona ororo asaabh, abạra akhaama ẹfa. <verse eid="EXO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 1:21" />Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạngẹ atik-ipanạng-ọmaan mbọ ichọhmfhạr s'ide sabẹ, ukwuru sabẹ akhaam ojora f'Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 1:22" />Ma wọ, Phero ọnạngẹ anạng pẹ phyibh ẹfa bẹ́, “Ujunungnwa kw'uHiburu-kwanạng kwidede m'ọmaan, atạkh-ẹ abhạrẹ k'ọraanga kw'Nile, akhenka, atte ọkwanạng-nwa kwidede ọbọhk uruk akpen.”<verse eid="EXO 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EXO 2" />
  <para style="s">Ẹmmaana ch'Mosẹs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 2:1" />Wa ujunung wạnọ kw'efona ch'Lẹvi, ọta ọtạkha ikwanạng k'efona ch'Lẹvi k'ọbada. <verse eid="EXO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 2:2" />Wa ikwanạng nwọ utim ifhạr ọmaan ujunung. Masẹ ose bẹ́, nnwa nwọ ujibh-ujibh, udubh-ẹ k'aphye attaan. <verse eid="EXO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 2:3" />Masẹ nạn adạkhẹ khẹ nókke udubh o, n'ọtạk nnwa nwọ oge k'ikhạrạbaang s'utim aganttima oyok. Utima ẹbaantum ọkpa abhaang p'ikhạrạbaang nnọ. Ọtạkha ikhạrạbaang nnọ, ọttạra nnwa kha ẹtaanga, ọnạna k'asạsaarẹ p'ameni k'asi, k'ẹraanga-kha ch'ọraanga kw'Nile. <verse eid="EXO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 2:4" />Nnwọkka kwẹ kw'ikwanạng ọyẹrẹ obe, ọfha ose ọttọhk f'm'usi nnwa nwọ.<verse eid="EXO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 2:5" />Wa nnwa kw'Phero kw'ikwanạng utim aminava p'ade atọhmnạng pẹ ọta isi-kpobha k'ọraanga kw'Nile. Masẹ aminava mbọ n'asenga ma ẹraangakha, nnwa kw'Phero n'ose ikhạrạbaang k'ottemkwẹ kw'asạsaarẹ p'ameni k'ẹraangakha, ọtọhm ọtọhmnạng kwẹ wạnọ bẹ́, ọta ọtạkha sẹ utima ukwu. <verse eid="EXO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 2:6" />Masẹ owong sẹ, ose nnwa k'ẹtaanga s'n'ọgạma ẹmạng. Ọkhaama abẹ ikwosi. Oben bẹ́, “Nnwa nwa m'ode oHibru-nwa wạnọ e .”<verse eid="EXO 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 2:7" />Ma wọ nwọkka kw'nnwa nwọ ọbạbhọ nnwa kw'Phero bẹ́, “Ma, n'nta nyeri oHibru-kwanạng wạnọ, kw'm'okke ọrạk nnwa nwa ọnạng-ọ?”<verse eid="EXO 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 2:8" />Nnwa kw'Phero ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọbaan ma, sọhng!” Ma wọ, ọta utima ọkka kw'nnwa nwọ ukwu. <verse eid="EXO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 2:9" />Nnwa kw'Phero oben ọkka kw'nnwa nwọ bẹ́, “Tạkha nnwa nwa, rạkh-ẹ nạng-m, amma m'nnạng-ọ akpokha k'ọtọhm pfọ.” Ma wọ ọkka kwa nnwa nwọ ọtạkh-ẹ ọta ọrạk. <verse eid="EXO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 2:10" />K'okpe kw'nnwa nwọ n'ọbạrẹ, ọtạkh-ẹ okkena nnwa kw'Phero kw'node ọkka kw'nnwa nwọ. Ukpẹ-ẹ Mosẹs<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mosẹs, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">k'eHiburu, iyini ọttọhk masẹ ewonga k'asi.</char></note>, oben bẹ́, “Nnwong nwa k'asi.”<verse eid="EXO 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mosẹs ọrạbhọ ofona Midiyan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 2:11" />Wa k'iwu jạnẹ k'okpe kw'uwa Mosẹs kk'ọbạra, wa ofon ọta udibh anạng pẹ p'Israẹl. Ose itọhm-kpọhkha s'irem s'anạng pẹ n'asi, ọbạra ose s'uJip-nạng wạnọ n'uvun oHiburu-nạng, kw'ode oyok-ofhon kw'ẹma Mosẹs. <verse eid="EXO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 2:12" />Masẹ Mosẹs ophyebh, ọnạng núsia, ọfhọ ujunung nwọ kw'ubin Ijip, ọtạkha apfura pẹ ọnnọhnga k'uyiyeng. <verse eid="EXO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 2:13" />Masẹ iwu echobh ma, Mosẹs n'uyini k'iyaan, ọta ose aHiburu-junung afa p'n'arima irima, ọbạbh oyok kw'iponga ipyibhi bẹ́, “Aseng mbạng apfẹ n'avun oyok-oyokh o?”<verse eid="EXO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 2:14" />Ujunung nwọ ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Anẹ wọ usi-ọ ochonạng, ọttạra ọkpaar-aponga kwamạna? Ma n'attọhnọ bẹ́, abạra afhọ-m oche kw'afhọ uJip-nạng sa?” Ma wọ Mosẹs ojor-ẹ, ukwu ọkkẹ bẹ́, “K'udik'okka, udik ngwọ kk'ọyaakha.”<verse eid="EXO 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 2:15" />Masẹ Phero ọbhaang udik ngwọ, oror nden s'm'utima ọfhọ Mosẹs. Osenga ma, Mosẹs ọrạbh k'Phero k'ititikha, ọta uruk k'Midiyan, ọta uninga ẹyạr ọbaanga isipe jạnẹ. <verse eid="EXO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 2:16" />Wa ọkhaam ọfọhnẹja wạnọ kw'Midiyan, kw'ofhonu aminava asenọfa. Iwu jạnẹ, aminava mbọ asenọfa akwu atwạr asi age k'nkkora, ọfha abẹ anạng itirakpo py'otte kwabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 2:17" />Okhenka, akker-arạkhạmaan bạnọ akwu akhubh aminava mbọ, ma wọ, Mosẹs ubin <char style="it">bẹ bik</char> ọta ọkkaana bẹ, ọnạng itirakpo pyabẹ asi.<verse eid="EXO 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 2:18" />Masẹ aminava mbọ abhạn, otte kwabẹ, kw'okpen Reuẹl ọbạbh bẹ bẹ́, “Asong bẹ́ abạnga k'ẹbhạr-ẹbhạr akwuna chemma. Ode yạn?”<verse eid="EXO 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 2:19" />Abẹ abhin-ẹ bẹ́, “UJip-nạng wạnọ wọ ọkkaan mạna k'mbọhk s'akker-arakhạmaan, ọbạra ọkkaana ọnạng itirakpo pyamạna asi.”<verse eid="EXO 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 2:20" />Reuẹl ọbạbh aminava pẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga asi yạn akwuna arikh-ẹ? Asọhng ata ayer-ẹ ukwu uchi ọttọhk.”<verse eid="EXO 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 2:21" />Ma o Mosẹs ukwu ochera bẹ́, m'uruk Ruẹl abẹ. Wa Ruẹl ọtạk uminanwa wạnọ kwẹ kw'okpen Zipọra ọnạng Mosẹs k'ọbada. <verse eid="EXO 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 2:22" />Zipọra ọmaanẹ Mosẹs ujunungnwa, Mosẹs ukpẹ-ẹ Gẹrshọm, ọbẹ́, “Amma n'nde ukhikhennạng k'anạng k'isek.”<verse eid="EXO 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubinọkpaabyi ọbhaang ẹmạng ch'anạng p'Israẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 2:23" />Ma okpe-bhirada ngwọ, ọvaarnạng kw'Ijip ukwu ope. Anạng p'Israẹl agạma ẹmạng ch'ẹkkaana anạng Ubinọkpaabyi, ukwuru ibira ch'abẹ aning k'Ijip. Ubinọkpaabyi ọbhaang ẹmạng chabẹ, ch'abẹ agạm k'irem. <verse eid="EXO 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 2:24" />Wa Ubinọkpaabyi ọbhaang ẹmạng chabẹ, ọbạra ujima echekha ch'ọkhaam ọttạra Abraham, ọttạra Isaak, ọttạra Jekọb. <verse eid="EXO 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 2:25" />Wa Ubinọkpaabyi ose bẹ́, anạng p'Israẹl aning k'irem, ukwu ọkhaama ẹkka bẹ́ m'ọkkaana bẹ.<verse eid="EXO 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EXO 3" />
  <para style="s">Ubinọkpaabyi oyeri Mosẹs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 3:1" />K'iwu mạnna jạnẹ, Mosẹs n'okkeri arạkhạmaan p'ọnyẹ kwẹ, Jẹtro. Jẹtro wọ wa ode ọfọhnẹja k'ẹkhạma ch'Midiyan. Mosẹs utim arạkhạmaan mbọ osenga ma ibyi s'owor, tạrr ukwu ukpira k'okpecho kw'Horẹb, kw'ode okpecho kw'Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 3:2" />Ma wọ oseng-eden kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oseng k'akpondaak p'n'ayạma k'ichi, uyin Mosẹs abẹ. Wa Mosẹs odo okkeri, ose bẹ́, chibhi s'ekpon n'ẹyạma, ichi njọ nẹ́kkạma. <verse eid="EXO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 3:3" />Mosẹs oben k'ettem bẹ́, “Tte ntwạkhọ mgbaara khanse, ọfha nse ọttọhk f'usi bạra ekpon n'ẹyạma ma ichi njọ, bạra achẹ n'nẹ́kkạma.”<verse eid="EXO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 3:4" />Masẹ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi n'ose bẹ́, Mosẹs kk'osenga ọgbaara ma ọfha odo okkeri, n'oyer-ẹ k'ottemkwẹ kw'ichi njọ bẹ́, “Mosẹs! Mosẹs o!” Mosẹs ọbẹ́, “Aro, kkeri amma ma e.”<verse eid="EXO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 3:5" />Ubinọkpaabyi oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Dạk kásenga abaanga ma, wạra akpafhok pọ, khiri ibyi nnọ sabẹ ma, ide isisek s'awurada.” <verse eid="EXO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 3:6" />Ọbạra oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Amma wọ nde Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ab'atte, Abraham, ọttạra kw'Isaak, ọttạra kw'Jekọb.” Ma wọ ojora ọvạk Mosẹs, udubh ititikha sẹ, s'n'nórora bẹ́, ose Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 3:7" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni bẹ́, “K'udik ọkka, amma kk'irem s'anạng paam n'adọhbh k'Ijip nsia e. Amma kk'ẹmạng ch'ẹkkaana mmaanga ch'abẹ n'agạma, ukwuru irem s'akker-atọhmnạng n'anạng bẹ́. Irem sabẹ n'adọhbh kk'aam itwua e. <verse eid="EXO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 3:8" />Ma o, amma kk'nkwua bẹ́, nkwu nkkaana, nnạbha bẹ k'mbọhk s'anạng p'Ijip, mbạra mbina bẹ abẹ ma isisek nnọma, ntima bẹ mfona k'isisek ikkasẹ s'abasi, ọttạra ana p'ọkhọhn asaabh-ọsaabh, ofhon kw'aKenaan, ọttạra aHet, ọttạra abAmọr, ọttạra aPẹriz, ọttạra aHiv, ọttạra aJẹbus. <verse eid="EXO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 3:9" />K'udik ọkka, amma kk'ẹmạng ch'anạng p'Israẹl agạm mmaanga e, mbạra nse irem-demasẹ s'anạng p'Ijip n'anạng bẹ. <verse eid="EXO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 3:10" />Mantọhmma, ọma sọhng. Amma n'ntọhm-ọ k'Phero bẹ́, ata atạkha anạng paam, p'Israẹl abina k'Ijip.”<verse eid="EXO 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 3:11" />Okhenka, Mosẹs n'obeni Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Amma nde anẹ, kw'm'nta mbe Phero k'ititikha, mbạra ntima anạng p'Israẹl mbina k'Ijip?”<verse eid="EXO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 3:12" />Ubinọkpaabyi n'oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Amma m'nninga abọ. Ma wọ m'ode ẹkhọhkha ẹnạng-ọ bẹ́, amma wọ ntọhm-ọ: De kk'anạng p'Israẹl atima abina k'Ijip, abạnga m'akpobha Ubinọkpaabyi maa okpecho nwa.”<verse eid="EXO 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 3:13" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs ubhin Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Ode n'nta k'anạng p'Israẹl, mkpaak bẹ bẹ́, ‘Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ab'atte wọ ọtọhm-m k'abạnga e,’ abẹ n'abạbh-m bẹ́, ‘Ubinọkpaabyi nwọ okpen yạn?’ M'mkpaak bẹ yạn o?”<verse eid="EXO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 3:14" />Ubinọkpaabyi n'ubhin Mosẹs bẹ́, “AMMA WỌ NDE NWỌ KW'NDE.” Ọbạra oben bẹ́, “Kpaak anạng p'Israẹl bẹ́, AMMA WỌ NDE, wọ ọtọhm-m k'abạnga.”<verse eid="EXO 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 3:15" />Ubinọkpaabyi ọbạra oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Ọma m'akpaak anạng p'Israẹl bẹ́, ‘Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ab'atte Abraham, ọttạra Isaak, ọttạra Jekọb akpobh, wọ ọtọhm-m k'abạnga.’ Ma wọ ode eche chaam, eche ch'igbọ phyibh m'iyer-m tạrr ipimmanitor.<verse eid="EXO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 3:16" />“Sọhng ata ayeri adecho p'Israẹl atobha, akpaak bẹ bẹ́, ‘Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ab'atte Abraham, ọttạra Isaak, ọttạra Jekọb akpobh uyini okhebh-m, ọbẹ́, kk'okpe ntạkha nkkeri, nse oche kw'abẹ n'asi bạnga k'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 3:17" />Amma kk'nchekha bẹ́, m'nnạbha bạnga k'irem s'Ijip, ntima bạnga mfona k'isisek ikkasẹ s'abasi, ọttạra ana p'ọkhọhn asaabh-ọsaabh s'aKenaan, ọttạra aHet, ọttạra abAmọr, ọttạra aPẹriz, ọttạra aHiv, ọttạra aJẹbus.’<verse eid="EXO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 3:18" />“Adecho mbọ p'Israẹl m'akhọhmọ-ọ itọhng ọkhọmọ. Ma wọ, ọma ọttạra bẹ m'atwạn afona k'ọvaarnạng kw'Ijip ata aben-ẹ bẹ́, ‘Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'aHiburu kk'uyina okhebha mạna e. M'atte mạna ọbọhk ansi osenga kw'iwu ittaan amfona k'ibyi s'owor, ọfha anta anfọhnọ nja annạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwamạna.’ <verse eid="EXO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 3:19" />Okhenka, amma nsong ma bẹ́, ọvaarnạng kw'Ijip bạnga ọbọhk motte abạnga afona, oyonga ẹfa chididen m'ẹkwẹ-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 3:20" />Ma wọ, m'ntima ẹfa chaam nnạng anạng p'Ijip irem, m'nsi idik s'm'ipe anạng ifor ma ikhana nnọ sabẹ. K'ekpongannạm-kpe, m'otte bạnga ọbọhk otte, abạnga afona.<verse eid="EXO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 3:21" />“Amma m'mbạra nsi anạng p'Ijip asi ọphyaam anạng bạnga, ọfha masẹ abạnga m'abina osenga, abạnga nạng mbọhk-mbọhk afon. <verse eid="EXO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 3:22" />Ikwanạng kwidede m'ofona k'uJip-kwanạng kw'urukhu ọbaang-ẹ, ọttạra k'uJip-kwanạng kw'urukhu k'ọchọhm kwẹ, ọbạbh-ẹ ekpo masẹ asilva ọttạra agol, ọttạra ọvạra f'ifor, f'abạnga m'age ajunungva ọttạra apanạngva pabạnga. Abạnga m'asenga ma eden njọ achi anạng p'Ijip ekpo.”<verse eid="EXO 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EXO 4" />
  <para style="s">Nkhọhkha s'Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạngẹ Mosẹs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 4:1" />Ma wọ Mosẹs ọpọhn Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “M'nsi yạn, de abẹ nạn khaam itọhng nákhọhma, abẹ udik kwaam nábạra achera, aben bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi khọ núyina okhebha?”<verse eid="EXO 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 4:2" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọbạbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Mbạng vọ atim ma ọbọhk?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 4:2">Mosẹs ubhina bẹ́, “Uchikwura.”<verse eid="EXO 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 4:3" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Bhạrẹ chẹ ma isisek.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 4:3">Mosẹs ọbhạrẹ uchikwura nwọ k'isisek, awẹ ọbhạkhẹ ijọhk, Mosẹs ọrạbh urik. <verse eid="EXO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 4:4" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Nemi ọbọhk kwọ vạkha ijọhk nnọ k'ẹsạra.” Ma o, Mosẹs onemi ọbọhk ọvạkha ijọhk nnọ k'ẹsạra, ijọhk n'ibhạkhẹ adạkhẹ uchikwura kakhẹ k'ọbọhk. <verse eid="EXO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 4:5" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben bẹ́, “Si oche ngwọ, ọfha abẹ achera bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ab'otte pabẹ, Abraham, ọttạra Isaak, ọttạra Jekọb akpobh, kk'abẹ uyina.”<verse eid="EXO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 4:6" />Ma o, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben bẹ́, “Ge ọbọhk kwọ k'mkpamma k'ọnọhma-baba kwọ ẹtaanga.” Mosẹs usi oche ngwọ. Masẹ n'ọrạbh ọbọhk, ọbọhk n'usi okpokhora, n'uwuru <char style="it">bẹ gwaaang</char>, masẹ arạngta. <verse eid="EXO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 4:7" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben bẹ́, “Bạra kpa dạkhẹ nnạm ge ọbọhk kwọ k'mkpamma k'ọnọhma-baba kwọ ẹtaanga.” Mosẹs usi oche ngwọ. Masẹ n'ọrạbh ọbọhk o, ọbọhk n'ọkpa nnạm ode adạkhẹ obengana.<verse eid="EXO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 4:8" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni bẹ́, “De abẹ nạn khọ itọhng nákhọhma, abẹ abạra akhaanga ẹkhọhkha njọ ch'ichi eden, nudusi abẹ akk-okke achera njọ ch'ettong mfa. <verse eid="EXO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 4:9" />Okhenka, de abẹ nạn khọ itọhng náchera akhọhmọ, abẹ abạra akhaanga nkhọhkha nnọ mfa, sọhng ata akhaabha asi k'ọraanga kw'Nile, kwu abyenga k'igbin. Asi mbọ p'akhaabh k'ọraanga m'ẹbhạkhẹ isẹ ma isisek.”<verse eid="EXO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 4:10" />Mosẹs oben Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “O Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ọma asong ma bẹ́, tạma k'ẹtạma, tạrr ukpira s'n'akpaak ọtọhmnạng kwọ idik nna, amma idik-kpakha kạ́nkke, amma n'nyek ẹbang.”<verse eid="EXO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 4:11" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi n'oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Anẹ wọ ọnạngẹ oyokhanạng ẹmma ch'n'utima ọkpaak udik? Anẹ wọ n'usi oyokhanạng ọkpa itọhng, ọbạra usi-ẹ ọkpa ẹmma? Anẹ wọ n'usi oyokhanạng ose iyaan, ọbạra usi-ẹ ọkpa achen? Amma Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi sạng o? <verse eid="EXO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 4:12" />Nemeden sọhng mantọmma; amma m'nkkaan-ọ k'ọkpaakhadik, mbạra mkpebh-ọ ukhira kw'm'akpaak atena.”<verse eid="EXO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 4:13" />Okhenka, Mosẹs oben bẹ́, “O Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, totokhạn, wạra m'atọhm ọnạng ọdwạkh-ọdwạk.”<verse eid="EXO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 4:14" />Ma o, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọdwạkh-ẹ Mosẹs abẹ, n'obeni bẹ́, “Nnwakka Aarọn kw'ubin k'ẹnạmma ch'Lẹvi sạng uning ma? Amma nsong ma bẹ́, okke ọkpaakhadik mororo. Ẹma oyeni ukwuma kha eden bẹ́, ukwu okhebh-ọ, ettem m'erebh-ẹ k'okpe kw'm'usiọ-ọ. <verse eid="EXO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 4:15" />M'atekh-ẹ udik kw'm'ọkpaak. M'ntor bạnga anạng afa k'idik-kpaakha, mbạra ntọhn-ọ bạnga oche kw'abạnga m'asi. <verse eid="EXO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 4:16" />Aarọn wọ m'ọkpaak anạng mbọ idik kakhọ k'echo. Ẹma m'ode ọkpaakh-ọtọhnga kwọ, ọma n'abạra ade masẹ Ubinọkpaabyi anạng-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 4:17" />M'akhenka atạkha uchikwura kwọ atima k'ọbọhk, ọfha n'atima chẹ asi nkhọhkha s'm'ipe anạng ifor.”<verse eid="EXO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mosẹs ọkpa nnạm k'Ijip</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 4:18" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs ọkpa nnạm k'Jẹtro, kw'ode ọnyẹ kwẹ oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Aro, totokhạn, tte mkpa nnạm k'anạng paam k'Ijip, nta nse de abẹ atim akkeri ẹmma kha o.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 4:18">Jẹtro ọbẹ́, “Phyaa, do senga.”<verse eid="EXO 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 4:19" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs obena k'Midiyan bẹ́, “Kpa nnạm k'Ijip, khiri anạng p'uwa n'aben bẹ́ afhọ-ọ, kk'apua. <verse eid="EXO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 4:20" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs ọtạk ikwanạng kwẹ, ọttạra ajunungva pẹ ọnạna k'ẹnyạnyaang, ọbạra ọtạkha uchikwura kw'Ubinọkpaabyi obeni bẹ́, utima k'ọbọhk, ubina osenga ọkpa nnạm k'Ijip.<verse eid="EXO 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 4:21" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Masẹ m'akpa nnạm k'Ijip, m'asi ikkukkona-dik nnọ phyibh s'kk'ọ ẹfa nnạnga bẹ́, asi k'ititikha s'Phero. Okhenka, amma m'nsi Phero ọbạr ettem, ufhum bẹ́, otte anạng paam ọbọhk abẹ afona. <verse eid="EXO 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 4:22" />Ma wọ, ben Phero bẹ́, ‘Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni bẹ́, Israẹl wọ ode ocheden-junungnwa kwaam. <verse eid="EXO 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 4:23" />Amma mben-ọ bẹ́, “Tte nnwa kwaam ọbọhk ofona, ọta okpobh-m.” Okhenka, ọma afhumu bẹ́, attẹ-ẹ ọbọhk ofona, ma o, m'mfhọ ochedennwa kwọ.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 4:24" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi uyini Mosẹs abẹ k'ibyi s'utim anạng pẹ ubhing, n'ọkhạmọ bẹ́, ọfhẹ-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 4:25" />Okhenka, Zipọra kw'ode ikwanạng kw'Mosẹs, ọtạk ẹta ch'ẹjaabhẹ masẹ imaana, usi nnwa kwẹ ọkpọkkrọkkọ, ọtạkha ẹkpakpa ch'kk'ọkpaara utwu Mosẹs k'mfhokpatwạkhọ, oben bẹ́, “K'udik ọkka, asengi isẹ nna asẹ ade udim kwaam.” <verse eid="EXO 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 4:26" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi otte Mosẹs ọbọhk uruk akpen. Ma okpe ngwọ wọ kw'Zipora obeni bẹ́, “Udim kwaam kw'oseng k'isẹ, ukwuru ọkpọkkrọkkọ.”<verse eid="EXO 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 4:27" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Aarọn bẹ́, “Sọhng ata akhebha Mosẹs k'ibyi s'owor.” Ma wọ ofon okhebha Mosẹs k'okpecho kw'Ubinọkpaabyi uning, ọbaakh-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 4:28" />Ma o, Mosẹs ọkpaak Aarọn udik kwidede kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ẹ ọkpaakha bẹ́, ọkpaakh-ẹ. Wa ọbạra ọkpaakh-ẹ udik kwidede otena k'nkhọhkha s'ipe anạng ifor s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhn-ẹ bẹ́, usi.<verse eid="EXO 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 4:29" />Ma wọ wa Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn ata ayeri adennạng p'anạng p'Israẹl phyibh atobha. <verse eid="EXO 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 4:30" />Wa Aarọn ọtạk udik kwidede kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs ọkpaakha, ọkpaak anạng p'Israẹl, ọbạra usi nkhọhkha s'ipe anạng ifor k'anạng mbọ k'ititikha. <verse eid="EXO 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 4:31" />Wa adennạng mbọ kk'achera. Masẹ anạng mbọ abhaang bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'irem-khira s'anạng p'Israẹl aning usia, ọttạra bẹ́, n'ọkhaama ẹkka otena bẹ abẹ, abẹ atwunga ncho anạng-ẹ ikpukpobha.<verse eid="EXO 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EXO 5" />
  <para style="s">Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn ata akhebha Phero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 5:1" />Masẹ idik nnọ kk'ittia iseng, Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn ata akhebha Phero aben bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl obeni bẹ́, ‘Tte anạng paam ọbọhk abẹ afona, ọfha abẹ ata asi erobha ch'ikpukpobha kha ibyi s'anạng nạnạ́rukha, anạng-m.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 5:2" />Ma wọ Phero ọbạbhọ bẹ bẹ́, “Anẹ wọ ode Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi nwọ kw'amma m'nnạbh k'ichen ntte anạng p'Israẹl ọbọhk abẹ afona? Amma Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kạ́nsong, anạng p'Israẹl ọbọhk mạ́mbạra ntte abẹ afona.”<verse eid="EXO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 5:3" />Ma wọ Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ubinọkpaabyi kw'aHiburu kk'mạna okhebha. Totokhạn, tte mạna ọbọhk ambina osenga kw'iwu ittaan, amfona k'ibyi s'anạngn'nárukha, ọfha anta amfọhnọ nja annạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwamạna, deja m'ọnạngẹ mạna ikhạmana k'ukhira-k'ukhira, oyongu ma, m'ọbạra utima ọkkangkkang-kkro ọfhọ mạna.”<verse eid="EXO 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 5:4" />Okhenka, ọvaarnạng kw'Ijip n'ọbạbhọ Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn bẹ́, “Ode yạn kw'abạnga awọhkhọ anạng mbọ akuma ọtọhm fabẹ sisi o? Abạnga akpa nnạm k'itọhm sabạnga ẹbhạr-ẹbhạrẹ!” <verse eid="EXO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 5:5" />Ma wọ Phero obeni bẹ́, “Akker o, anạng p'isek nna kk'asaabha aseng eden, bạra abạnga akkeri ma, akuma bẹ ọtọhm sisi.”<verse eid="EXO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 5:6" />Ma iwu njọ jạnẹ, Phero ọnạngẹ akker-atọhmnạng, ọttạra akker-itọhm ẹfa, ọbẹ: <verse eid="EXO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 5:7" />Abạnga dạkhẹ anạng mbọ asạsaarẹ-bukhu p'abẹ n'atima abạnga ata kánạng, tte abẹma oyeni asenga mfhok ata aror asạsaarẹ-bukhu p'abẹ m'atima abạnga ata. <verse eid="EXO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 5:8" />Okhenka, abạnga asi bẹ abạnga ọta-bhik kw'abẹ atạm-ọtạma abạnga, kayekhi. Abẹ agọhbh-ọgọhbhọ e, ẹgwọ usi abẹ n'agạma bẹ, ‘Tte amfona, anta anfọhnọ ẹja annạng Ubinọkpaabyi kwamạna.’ <verse eid="EXO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 5:9" />Abạnga akhaankẹ asi ọtọhm mvọ apfẹ odo ọkpọhkh-ọkpọkhọ anạng ajunung mbọ, ọfha abẹ nạngẹ okpe akhaam kw'abẹ m'akhọhmọ itọhng k'idik-kpaakha ch'afhạra.”<verse eid="EXO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 5:10" />Ma o, akker-atọhmnạng ọttạra akker-itọhm p'Israẹl, afon ata akpaak anạng mbọ bẹ́, “Maa wọ ode udik kw'Phero ọkpaakhẹ: ‘Amma dạkhẹ bạnga asạsaarẹ p'abẹ n'atima abạnga ata mạ́nnạng. <verse eid="EXO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 5:11" />Asọhng ata aror asạsaarẹ p'abẹ n'atima abạnga ata k'ibyi s'abạnga m'aror, okhenka, ọtọhm fabạnga mesese móyekhi.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 5:12" />Mạnna wọ anạng n'asenga akpaanga Ijip, n'aror asạsaarẹ-bukhu p'abẹ m'atima abạnga ata. <verse eid="EXO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 5:13" />Akker-atọhmnạng mbọ afon ororo n'annunu bẹ k'ẹfa, aben bẹ́, “Khiri kha, abạnga asi ọtọhm fabạnga f'iwu, oche kw'abạnga n'acheden asi k'okpe kw'abẹ n'anạng bạnga asạsaarẹ o.” <verse eid="EXO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 5:14" />Akker-atọhmnạng mbọ p'Phero otek, avạk akhebh-itọhm p'Israẹl avun nkwur, abạra abạbh bẹ bẹ́, “Ode yạn kw'ọta-bhik kw'abạnga abạngẹ chạnachẹ ọttạra chemma nạnúkpira k'ubhik kw'abạnga n'acheden abạnga?”<verse eid="EXO 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 5:15" />Ma wọ akker-itọhm p'Israẹl, ata agạma akpẹkhẹ Phero, aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Attitte, ode yạn kw'n'asi atọhmnạng pọ oche ngwọ o? <verse eid="EXO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 5:16" />Abẹ atọhmnạng pọ asạsaarẹ-bukhu p'abẹ n'atima abạnga ata dạk kạnánạng. Okhenka, abẹ n'aben mạna bẹ́, ‘Abạnga abạnga ata!’ Abẹ n'avun atọhmnạng pọ nkwur, abhaang, ipyima ede ch'anạng pọ oyeni o.”<verse eid="EXO 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 5:17" />Ma wọ, Phero ubhin bẹ bẹ́, “Agọhbhọdọ bọ e, abạnga agọhbhọ aseng eden! Akwẹma gwọ usi abạnga n'achona bẹ́, ‘Tte mạna ọbọhk anta amfọhnọ ẹja annạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.’ <verse eid="EXO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 5:18" />Abạnga akpa nnạm k'ọtọhm. Abẹ dạkhẹ bạnga asạsaarẹ p'abẹ n'atima abạnga ata m'anạng, okhenka, oyonga abạnga m'abạnga ubhik f'ata, f'abạnga n'acheden abạnga.”<verse eid="EXO 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 5:19" />Akker-itọhm p'Israẹl akwu atin bẹ́, abẹ n'aning k'ọmaphyaangẹ kwididen, sabẹ abeni bẹ́, “Abạnga nạngẹ ọta-bhik kw'iwu ayekhi o.” <verse eid="EXO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 5:20" />Masẹ abẹ abin arik Phero, abẹ ata akhebha Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn sabẹ n'abe atik bẹ. <verse eid="EXO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 5:21" />Abẹ aben bẹ bẹ́, “Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọkpaara iponga otor k'usisi kwabạnga. Abạnga kk'mạna asia ampyibh k'ititikha s'Phero ọttạra atọhmnạng pẹ, abạnga abạra age bẹ ọkkangkkang-kkro k'mbọhk bẹ, abẹ afhọ mạna.”<verse eid="EXO 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubinọkpaabyi ochekhi bẹ́, m'ọrạbha anạng p'Israẹl k'ibira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 5:22" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs ọkpa nnạm k'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben bẹ́, “O Aro, ukwuru yạn kw'age anạng pọ k'udik kw'obeng maa o? Ẹgwọ usi attọhm-m o? <verse eid="EXO 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 5:23" />S'mbobe mkpaak Phero udik k'akhọ k'eche, kk'anạng mbama ugia k'irem, ọma anạng pọ oyeni kákke akkaana mesese.”<verse eid="EXO 5:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EXO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 6:1" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “M'ase ọttọhk f'm'nsi Phero. Amma m'ntima ẹfa chaam nsi-ẹ otte anạng paam ọbọhk abẹ afona. Ẹfa njọ chaam m'isi-ẹ ukhubh bẹ k'ẹkhạma chẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 6:2" />Ubinọkpaabyi ọbạra oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Amma wọ nde Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 6:3" />Amma wọ wa nyini Abraham, ọttạra Isaak, ọttạra Jekọb abẹ, masẹ Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa phyibh. Okhenka, amma eche chaam ch'ede Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi nạ́nyaakha nnạng bẹ. <verse eid="EXO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 6:4" />Wa mbạra nchekhi bẹ́ m'nnạng bẹ isek s'Kenaan, nnọ s'uwa abẹ arukhu masẹ akhikhennạng. <verse eid="EXO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 6:5" />Amma kk'ẹmạng ch'anạng p'Israẹl n'agạma k'ibira ch'abẹ aning k'Ijip mmaanga, amma kk'echekha chaam mbạra njima.<verse eid="EXO 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 6:6" />“Osenga ma, kpaak anạng p'Israẹl bẹ́, ‘Amma wọ nde Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Amma wọ m'nnạbha bạnga k'ọkpak-k'ẹdwạngọ kw'anạng p'Ijip. M'mbạra nnạbha bạnga k'ibira ch'abẹ age bạnga. M'ntima ẹfa chaam mmekhi bạnga, mbạra ntima chẹ nsi iponga ijibh bạnga. <verse eid="EXO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 6:7" />M'ntạkha bạnga masẹ anạng paam, m'mbạra nde Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga. Abạnga m'asenga ma, atin bẹ́, amma wọ nde Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga, kw'ọrạbh bạnga k'ọkpak-k'ẹdwạngọ kw'anạng p'Ijip age bạnga. <verse eid="EXO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 6:8" />Amma m'mbạra ntima bạnga tạrr mkpira k'isisek nnọ s'uwa nchekhi k'ọmmakkarẹ bẹ, m'nnạng Abraham, ọttạra Isaak, ọttạra Jekọb. Amma m'nnạng bạnga isisek nnọ asẹ ide sabạnga. Amma wọ nde Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 6:9" />Okhenka, masẹ Mosẹs ọtạk idik nnọ ọkpaak anạng p'Israẹl, abẹ khẹ itọhng nakhọma, ukwuru s'ẹfa kk'bẹ ẹsa, ọttạra k'itọhm-kpọhkha sabẹ n'asi.<verse eid="EXO 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 6:10" />Osenga ma, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 6:11" />“Sọhng ata akpaak Phero, kw'ode ọvaarnạng kw'Ijip bẹ́, tte otte anạng p'Israẹl ọbọhk abẹ abina arik isisek sẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 6:12" />Okhenka, Mosẹs ọbạbhọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “De anạng p'Israẹl nạn khaam itọhng nákhọma, Phero wọ m'otera ọkhọhm-m itọhng s'amma n'nyekhi ẹbang o?”<verse eid="EXO 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 6:13" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn bẹ́, “Abạnga akpaak ọvaar Phero kw'Ijip ọttạra anạng p'Israẹl bẹ́, amma wọ ntọhmọ bạnga bẹ́, abạnga atima anạng p'Israẹl abina k'Ijip.”<verse eid="EXO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efonamma ch'Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 6:14" />Maa wọ ode acho p'mfonamma sabẹ:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 6:14">Ajunungva p'Reubẹn, kw'ode ochedennwa kw'Jekọb ofonu ade, Hanọk, ọttạra Palu, ọttạra Hẹzrọn, ọttạra Karmi, ẹbọ wa ade efonamma ch'Reubẹn.<verse eid="EXO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 6:15" />Ajunungva p'Simeọn ofhonu ade, Jemuyẹl, ọttạra Jamin, ọttạra Ọhad, ọttạra Jakin, ọttạra Zoha, ọttạra Shaul kw'ode nnwa kw'oKenaan-kwanạng ọmaanẹ ọnạng-ẹ. Ma wọ wa ode efona ch'Simeọn.<verse eid="EXO 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 6:16" />Ajunungva p'Lẹvi ofhonu k'itoru ade, Gẹrshọn, ọttạra Kohat, ọttạra Mẹrari. Phyi-phyibh wa Lẹvi urukhu icho arạbh asajạnẹ ukuma chikhamfa.<verse eid="EXO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 6:17" />Ajunungva p'Gẹrshọn ofhonu k'inạmma-k'inạmma ade, Libni, ọttạra Shimei.<verse eid="EXO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 6:18" />Ajunungva p'Kohat ofhonu ade, Amram, ọttạra Izha, ọttạra Hẹbrọn, ọttạra Uziyẹl. Phyi-pyibh wa Kohat urukhu acho arạbh isajạnẹ ukuma jobhkantaan.<verse eid="EXO 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 6:19" />Wa Mẹrari ofhonu ajunungva p'ade, Mali, ọttạra Mushi. Abẹma mbọ abin k'ẹnạmma ch'Lẹvi.<verse eid="EXO 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 6:20" />Wa Amram ọtạk Jokẹbẹd kw'ode nnwọkka kw'otte kwẹ k'ọbada, kw'ọmaan-ẹ Aarọn ọttạra Mosẹs. Phyi-phyibh wa Amram urukhu icho arạbh asajạnẹ ukuma chikhamfa, brasẹ n'ope.<verse eid="EXO 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 6:21" />Wa Izha ofhonu ajunungva p'ade, Kọra, ọttạra Nẹphẹg, ọttạra Zikiri.<verse eid="EXO 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 6:22" />Wa Uziyẹl ofhonu ajunungva p'ade Mishayẹl, ọttạra Ẹlzaphan, ọttạra Sitri.<verse eid="EXO 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 6:23" />Wa Aarọn ọtạk Ẹlisheba kw'ode uminanwa kw'Aminadab k'ọbada, kw'ọbạra ode nnwọkka kw'Nashọn, ọmaan-ẹ Nadab, ọttạra Abihu, ọttạra Ẹleyaza, ọttạra Itamar.<verse eid="EXO 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 6:24" />Ajunungva p'Kọra ade, Asir, ọttạra Ẹlkana, ọttạra Abiyasaph, abẹma bọ ade nnạmma s'Kọra.<verse eid="EXO 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 6:25" />Wa Ẹleyaza kw'Aarọn ofhonu, ọtạk uminanwa wạnọ kw'Putiyẹl k'ọbada, ọmaan-ẹ Phinẹhas.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EXO 6:25" />
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 6:25">Abẹma bọ wa ade acho p'ichọhmfhạr s'Lẹvi k'ẹnạmma k'ẹnạmma.<verse eid="EXO 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 6:26" />Aarọn nwa ọttạra Mosẹs bọ kw'uwa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni bẹ́, “Abạnga atima anạng p'Israẹl abina arik isek s'Ijip, oche kw'abẹ ade k'ọsaabh pfabẹ.” <verse eid="EXO 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 6:27" />Abẹma anạng afa, Aarọn ọttạra Mosẹs bọ wa akpaakhẹ udik atena k'ibina ch'anạng p'Israẹl, anạng Phero kw'ọdạbhẹ k'Ijip.<verse eid="EXO 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aarọn ọkpaakhẹ udik k'echo ch'Mosẹs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 6:28" />Masẹ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọkpaakhẹ Mosẹs udik k'Ijip, <verse eid="EXO 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 6:29" />otekh Mosẹs bẹ́, “Amma wọ nde Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Kpaak ọvaar Phero kw'ode ọvaarnạng kw'Ijip idik nnọ phyibh s'mkpaakh-ọ.”<verse eid="EXO 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 6:30" />Okhenka, Mosẹs ubhin Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Masẹ amma n'nyekhi ẹbang, m'mkpaak Phero yạn brasẹ ọkhọhm-m itọhng o?”<verse eid="EXO 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EXO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 7:1" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kker e, amma khọ nsia bẹ́ ade masẹ Ubinọkpaabyi k'ititikha s'Phero, nnwakka Aarọn wọ m'ode usi-ẹyaakha kwọ. <verse eid="EXO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 7:2" />Kpaak nnwakka Aarọn udik kwidede kw'mkpaakh-ọ, ọfha ẹma oben Phero otte anạng p'Israẹl ọbọhk, abẹ abina arik ẹkhạma chẹ. <verse eid="EXO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 7:3" />Okhenka, amma m'nsi Phero ọbạr ettem. Chibhi s'm'nsi nkhọhkha saabhada, ọttạra ikkukkona-dik k'ọsaabh, ọttạra idik s'm'ipe anạng ifor k'Ijip, <verse eid="EXO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 7:4" />Phero khọ itọhng mọ́khọhmọ. Ma wọ m'nsi ijoradik k'Ijip, mbạra ntima ẹfa chaam nnạng aJip-nạng irem sididen, ntima ikhaana s'anạng paam p'ade Israẹl mbina k'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 7:5" />Anạng p'Ijip m'asonga bẹ́ amma wọ nde Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, k'okpe kw'm'nsi ijoradik k'Ijip, mbạra ntima anạng p'Israẹl mbina.”<verse eid="EXO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 7:6" />Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn asi oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhnọ bẹ. <verse eid="EXO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 7:7" />Wa Mosẹs ode acho arạbh annebung, Aarọn ode acho arạbh annebung ukuma ittaan k'okpe kw'abẹ akpaakhẹ Phero idik nnọ.<verse eid="EXO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uchikwura kw'Aarọn ọbhạkhẹ ijọhk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 7:8" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 7:9" />“De Phero obeni bạnga bẹ́ abạnga asi ikkukkonadik, ben Aarọn ọtạkha uchikwura kwẹ ọbhạrẹ k'isisek, ma ititikha s'Phero, uchikwura nwọ m'ọbhạkhẹ ijọhk.”<verse eid="EXO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 7:10" />Ma wọ Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn afon akhebha Phero, abẹ asi oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhnọ bẹ. Aarọn ọtạkha uchikwura kwẹ ọbhạrẹ k'isisek, ma ititikha s'Phero ọttạra ajukwa pẹ, uchikwura nwọ ọbhạkhẹ ijọhk. <verse eid="EXO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 7:11" />Osenga ma, Phero oyeri adiksonga-nạng, ọttạra abọhnganạng p'Ijip, anạng mbọ p'n'asi nkkari o akwu atima ọtaanga kwabẹ, asi ukhira ngwọ gwạnọ. <verse eid="EXO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 7:12" />Ọnạng-ọnạng ọbhạrẹ uchikwura kwẹ, achikwura mbọ abạkhẹ ọjọhk. Okhenka, uchikwura kw'Aarọn umyi pabẹ phyibh. <verse eid="EXO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 7:13" />Oseng ma, Phero ofon ororo ọbạr ettem, bẹ itọhng nọ́khọma, otor k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ọkpaakha bạra.<verse eid="EXO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkwuru s'isẹ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 7:14" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Phero ettem tạm nófhona e; utim ufhum-ufhum bẹ́, otte anạng paam ọbọhk abẹ afona. <verse eid="EXO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 7:15" />Sọhng ata akhebha Phero s'm'ọta k'ọraanga k'ekpebha. Ninga ma ẹraangakha atikh-ẹ, atạkha uchikwura nwọ kw'wạra ọbhạkhẹ ijọhk atima k'akhọ k'ọbọhk. <verse eid="EXO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 7:16" />Kpaakhẹ bẹ́ “Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'aHiburu, ọtọhm-m bẹ́ mkpaakh-ọ bẹ́, atte anạng pẹ ọbọhk abẹ afona, ọfha abẹ ata akpobh-ẹ k'ibyi s'anạngn'nárukha. Okhenka, tạrr ukpira mantọmma, itọhng náchera akhọhmọ. <verse eid="EXO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 7:17" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni bẹ́, maa wọ m'atima asonga bẹ́, ẹma wọ ode Ubinọkpaabyi: Amma m'ntima uchikwura nwa kw'ntim k'ọbọhk mvun maa ọraanga kw'Nile, awẹ m'ọbhạkẹ ode isisẹ. <verse eid="EXO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 7:18" />Nten s'ining k'Nile m'ipope, ọraanga kw'Nile m'osom iruk ukpira k'oche kw'anạng p'Ijip nạn adạkhẹ mákke agwo.”<verse eid="EXO 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 7:19" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Ben Aarọn bẹ́, Tima uchikwura nwọ kw'atim k'akhọ k'ọbọhk tena k'ọraanga kw'Ijip, ọttạra k'mfhobh, ọttạra k'mmen, ọttạra k'apesi, ọttạra k'ibyi sidede s'asi aber, ọfha apyẹ ẹbhạkhẹ ede isisẹ. Isẹ n'ining k'ibyi sidede k'Ijip tạrr oseng k'nnakpa ọttạra k'atagbagba.”<verse eid="EXO 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 7:20" />Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn asi obengana k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhnọ bẹ. Ma ititikha s'Phero ọttạra ajukwa pẹ, Aarọn udira uchikwura kwẹ uvun ma ọraanga kw'Nile. Asi mbọ phyi-phyibh n'akwu ade isisẹ. <verse eid="EXO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 7:21" />Nten s'ọraanga kw'Nile ipe, asi n'asom iruk tạrr anạng p'Ijip dạk kákke agwo. Ijip phyi-phyibh n'ode isisẹ.<verse eid="EXO 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 7:22" />Okhenka, abọhnganạng p'Ijip atim ọtaanga kwabẹ asi idik nnọ oche ngwọ. Ma wọ Phero ofon ororo ọbạr ettem, itọhng nóchera ọkhọmọ ọnạng Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn, k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ọkpaakha bạra. <verse eid="EXO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 7:23" />Phero oter ọkpa nnạm ofona k'udimpa kwẹ, idik nnọ k'ettem gigia núgia bạra. <verse eid="EXO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 7:24" />Ma wọ anạng p'Ijip phyibh ata atum ape k'ọkhanọkhaan kw'Nile, ọfha abẹ ase asi p'abẹ m'agwo, ukwuru sabẹ nạn adạkhẹ asi p'Nile nákke agwo.<verse eid="EXO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkwuru s'ayạrạbọhk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 7:25" />Wa iwu isenọfa ikwu iseng s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọbhạkhẹ asi p'Nile ade isisẹ.<verse eid="EXO 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EXO 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 8:1" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Sọhng ata akpaak Phero bẹ́, ‘Amma Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi mbeni bẹ́, otte anạng paam ọbọhk abẹ afona ọfha abẹ akwu akpobh-m. <verse eid="EXO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 8:2" />De afhumu bẹ́, bẹ ọbọhk mátte abẹ afona, m'ntọhm ayạrạbọhk k'ọsaabh abaabha ẹkhạma chọ kubungu. <verse eid="EXO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 8:3" />Ayạrạbọhk m'afu k'ọraanga kw'Nile bẹ́ ttạbh. Apyẹ m'ẹnyaamẹ k'ọvaarter kwọ tạrr ukpira kakhọ-ọ k'ẹmangọ, oseng k'ibyiyimasẹ sọ, ọttạra k'ichọhm s'ajukwa pọ, tạrr oseng k'anạng pọ k'ichọhm, tạrr ukpira k'ibyi sabẹ n'asi uchiattọhk pfọ. <verse eid="EXO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 8:4" />Ayạrạbọhk mbọ m'agbe araakh-ọ ọttạra anạng pọ, ọttạra ajukwa pọ.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 8:5" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Ben Aarọn onemi ọbọhk ngwọ kw'utim uchikwura otena k'ọraanga, ọttạra k'mmen, ọttạra k'ape, ọfha ayạrạbọhk ayin abaabha isek s'Ijip.”<verse eid="EXO 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 8:6" />Ma wọ Aarọn onemi ọbọhk kwẹ otena k'asi p'Ijip phyi-phyibh, ayạrạbọhk ayin abaabha Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 8:7" />Okhenka, anạng mbọ p'n'asi nkkari k'Ijip abạra akwu asi ọtaanga kwabẹ, ayạrạbọhk ayin abaabha Ijip.<verse eid="EXO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 8:8" />Ma wọ Phero oyeri Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn, oben bẹ́, “Abạnga ase njọhm achini Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ọfha ọrạbha ayạrạbọhk mbọ k'ọchọhm kwaam, ọttạra k'ichọhm s'anạng paam, amma m'ntte anạng mbọ ọbọhk otte abẹ afona ata afọhnọ ẹja anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kwabẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 8:9" />Mosẹs ọpọhna Phero bẹ́, “Amma m'ntte udik kwidede ọbọhk nnạng-ọ bẹ́, age okpe kw'm'nse njọhm k'echo chọ, ọttạra atọhmnạng pọ, ọttạra ẹchọhmfhạr chọ, ọfha ayạrạbọhk atte ẹchọhmfhạr chọ, ọttạra efhonfhạr chọ ọbọhk, arik mbyọ py'ining k'ọraanga kw'Nile.”<verse eid="EXO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 8:10" />Ma wọ, Phero ubhin bẹ́, “Uphyini e.” Mosẹs ọbẹ́, “Tte akwẹ ode oche kw'abeni, ọfha asenga ma asonga bẹ́, ọnạng kòde kw'ode masẹ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kwamạna. <verse eid="EXO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 8:11" />Ayạrạbọhk m'atte ọma ọttạra efhonfhạr chọ ọbọhk otte, m'ekhenka irik mbyọ p'ọraanga kw'Nile.”<verse eid="EXO 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 8:12" />Masẹ Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn abin arik Phero, Mosẹs ose njọhm, ọkpaak Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi udik otena k'ayạrạbọhk p'kk'ọtọhma ọnạng Phero. <verse eid="EXO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 8:13" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọbhaang njọhm s'Mosẹs, ayạrạbọhk mbọ ape k'ichọhm sabẹ, ọttạra k'eterttem, ọttạra k'iwonu sabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 8:14" />Wa abẹ atobh ayạrạbọhk mbọ k'akwung-k'akwung tạrr, iruk ch'ayạrạbọhk mbọ n'esomu ẹkhạng-ọkhạngẹ ẹbaabha ofhon phyibh. <verse eid="EXO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 8:15" />Okhenka, masẹ Phero ose bẹ, ayạrạbọhk dạk kade, odo ettem ọbạr, itọhng dạk nọkhọma ọnạng Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn, oche kw'uwa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ọkpaakha bạra.<verse eid="EXO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkwuru s'abumbunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 8:16" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Ben Aarọn bẹ́, onemi uchikwura kwẹ uvun k'ububuma kw'isisek s'Ijip, ọfha ububuma nwọ ọbhạkhẹ abumbunu p'm'afhu abaabha isisek s'Ijip.” <verse eid="EXO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 8:17" />Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn, asi oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhnọ bẹ. Masẹ Aarọn onemi ọbọhk ọttạra uchikwura kwẹ uvun k'ububuma kw'isisek, abumbunu ayin anạna anạng k'ifor, ọttạra k'nten. Ma wọ, isisek s'Ijip phyi-phyibh ifu ọttạra abumbunu. <verse eid="EXO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 8:18" />Chibhi s'abọnganạng p'Ijip akhong bẹ asi ọtaanga kwabẹ, ọfha abumbunu abạra ayin, abẹ khakke. Ma wọ, abumbunu mbọ afon ororo abubha ayokhanạng ọttạra nten.<verse eid="EXO 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 8:19" />Anạng mbọ p'n'asi nkkari n'abeni Phero bẹ́, “Udik ngwa k'ajaakha sạng o, ọbọhk kw'Ubinọkpaabyi ọttạr ma.” Okhenka, Phero ofona ororo ọkpọhkhọ echo, itọhng nóchera bẹ́ ọkhọmọ ma idik nnọ, otor k'oche kw'uwa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ọkpaakha bạra.<verse eid="EXO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkwuru s'asạsạng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 8:20" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Sọhng ata agwunga Phero ukhubh k'ekpekpebha bạrasẹ ọta k'ọraanga, akpaakh-ẹ bẹ́, ‘Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni bẹ́: Tte anạng paam ọbọhk abẹ afona, ọfha abẹ akwu akpobh-m. <verse eid="EXO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 8:21" />De nạn anạng paam ọbọhk nattia abẹ afona, amma m'ntọhm asạsạng k'ọsaabh nnạng ọma, ọttạra atọhmnạng pọ, ọttạra anạng pọ, ọttạra k'ichọhm sabạnga. Ichọhm s'anạng ọttạra isisek phyi-phyibh s'Ijip m'ifhu ọttạra asạsạng.<verse eid="EXO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 8:22" />“ ‘Okhenka, ma iwu njọ, amma m'nsi nkhạmo k'ẹkhạma ch'Goshẹn ch'anạng paam arukhu, nchok asạsạng ma m'aninga, ọfha asonga bẹ́ amma, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi nning ma isisek nna. <verse eid="EXO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 8:23" />Amma m'nge erem k'anạng paam ọttạra pọ. Ẹkhọhkha nja m'iyin uphyini.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 8:24" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi oche kw'ọkpaakhẹ, ọtọhm asạsạng k'ọsaabh anwa k'ọvaarter kw'Phero, ọttạra k'ichọhm s'ajukwa pẹ. Isek s'Ijip phyi-phyibh n'ide asạsạng-asạsạng.<verse eid="EXO 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 8:25" />Osenga ma, Phero oyeri Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn, oben bẹ́, “Abạnga asọhng ata afọhnọ nja anạng Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga ma isisek nna.”<verse eid="EXO 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 8:26" />Okhenka, Mosẹs oben bẹ́, “Mmaro, oche ngwọ nọ́baana a. Nja s'm'amfọhnọ annạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwamạna, anạng p'Ijip mídaak. De amfọhnọ nja s'nạn bẹ nídaakha, abẹ mạna ata mátọhbh o? <verse eid="EXO 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 8:27" />Oyonga m'ambina osenga kw'iwu ittaan amfona k'ibyi s'anạng nạnárukha, ọfha anta amfọhnọ nja annạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwamạna, k'oche kw'ọtọhnọ mạna.”<verse eid="EXO 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 8:28" />Ma wọ Phero obeni bẹ́, “Amma m'ntte bạnga ọbọhk otte abạnga ata afọhnọ nja anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga k'ibyi s'anạngn'nárukha. Okhenka, nọ́baana bẹ́, abạnga afona k'ibyi s'ibhir-ubhir. Abạnga ase njọhm anạng-m.”<verse eid="EXO 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 8:29" />Mosẹs ubhin bẹ́, “De mbin maa, m'nse njọhm ose nnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, uphyini, asạsạng mbọ m'atte ọma Phero, ọttạra ajukwa pọ, ọttạra anạng pọ ọbọhk otte. Nạngẹ ode bẹ́, ọma Phero m'abọhra dạkhẹ mạna, akpa anạng mbọ eden bẹ́, abẹ nạngẹ nja ata afọhnọ anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi o.”<verse eid="EXO 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 8:30" />Ma wọ Mosẹs ubin urik Phero, ọta ose njọhm ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 8:31" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọbhaanga njọhm nnọ s'Mosẹs ophyemi bẹ́, asạsạng mbọ atte Phero ọttạra ajukwa pẹ, ọttạra anạng pẹ ọbọhk. Ẹsạsạng jạnẹ-jạnẹ ch'ẹbạra irik kède. <verse eid="EXO 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 8:32" />Okhenka, Phero oyongu ma ọkpọhkhọ echo, anạng mbọ ọbọhk nóchera otte abẹ afona.<verse eid="EXO 8:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EXO 9" />
  <para style="s">Nkwuru s'itirakpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 9:1" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Sọhng ata akpaak Phero bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'aHiburu obeni bẹ́, ‘Tte anạng paam ọbọhk abẹ afona, ọfha abẹ ata akpobh-m. <verse eid="EXO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 9:2" />De afhumu bẹ́, bẹ ọbọhk mátte, afona ororo avạkha bẹ achok, <verse eid="EXO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 9:3" />amma Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'nkọhkha bạnga nkwuru sididen k'itirakpo py'ining k'iwonu, py'ede: nnyạnyaang, ọttạra mmaam, ọttạra akamẹl, ọttạra adamagbudu, ọttạra arạkhạmaan, ọttạra mvu. <verse eid="EXO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 9:4" />Okhenka, amma Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'nkhạmọ itirakpo p'anạng p'Israẹl ininga, k'itirakpo py'anạng p'Ijip. Utirattọhk vạnọ-vạnọ f'anang p'Israẹl mópe.”<verse eid="EXO 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 9:5" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oge okpe, oben bẹ́, “Uphyini wọ kw'amma Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'nsi udik ngwa maa isisek nna.” <verse eid="EXO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 9:6" />Iwu echobh ma, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi oche kw'obeni. Itirakpo p'anạng p'Ijip epe <char style="it">bẹ́ phyibh,</char> okhenka, utirattọhk vạnọ-vạnọ f'anạng p'Israẹl f'ope kòde. <verse eid="EXO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 9:7" />Ma wọ Phero ọtọhmọ ajunung bạnọ bẹ́, abẹ ata adwạn udik ngwọ. Abẹ akwu ase bẹ́ akwẹ ode udik ọkka bẹ́ utirattọhk vạnọ-vạnọ f'anang p'Israẹl f'kk'upua, kòde. Okhenka, tạrr oseng ma, Phero ofon ororo ọkpọhkhọ echo, nóchera bẹ́ otte anạng p'Israẹl ọbọhk abẹ afona.<verse eid="EXO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkwuru s'aphyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 9:8" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn bẹ́, “Akpokhu itạtọhng-khạma k'ikwukwuru, s'm'ifu ẹbọhkpattem, tte Mosẹs ọbhạrẹ sẹ k'iyokhu, tte Phero obe ma ose. <verse eid="EXO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 9:9" />Itạtọhng nnọ m'inyaamẹ, ide masẹ ebona ibubha efhonfhạr ch'Ijip phyi-phyibh, asẹ m'itima aphyi py'm'anwa abhạn ikwu. Apyẹ m'ẹmma ayokhanạng ọttạra itirakpo.” <verse eid="EXO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 9:10" />Ma wọ abẹ akpokhu itạtọhng-khạma k'ikwukwuru, akwu abe Phero k'ititikha. Mosẹs ọtạkha sẹ ọbhạrẹ k'iyokhu, osenga ma, ọkhạnkhạmọ kw'aphyi, abhạn apyẹ, ammun ayokhanạng ọttạra itirakpo. <verse eid="EXO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 9:11" />Wa asi-nkona k'ititikha s'Mosẹs dạk kákke abe, ukwuru aphyi p'asi bẹ, ọttạra anạng p'Ijip phyibh.<verse eid="EXO 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 9:12" />Okhenka, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi Phero odo ettem ọbạr-ọbạr, Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn itọhng nọ́khọma, oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs ọkpaakha bạra.<verse eid="EXO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkwuru s'arạngta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 9:13" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Sọhng ata agwunga Phero ukhubh, aben-ẹ bẹ́, ‘Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'aHiburu obeni bẹ́, atte anạng pẹ ọbọhk abẹ afona, ọfha abẹ ata akpobh-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 9:14" />Nạn mạnna núdia, ẹkpa nja, m'ọtọhm ọkhạnkhạmọ khira kw'ọyọhng nwọkha ọnạng ọma, ọttạra ajukwa pọ, ọttạra anạng pọ, ọfha asonga bẹ, ọnạng kòde kw'ode masẹ akhẹ ma ọyagbin phyi-phyibh. <verse eid="EXO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 9:15" />Njanna wạra kk'ọma ọttạra anạng pọ nkwuru nkhọhkha s'wạra kk'bạnga ifha, ibạra idimi bạnga ma ọyagbin. <verse eid="EXO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 9:16" />Okhenka, khọ ọbọhk uttia bẹ́, aninga akpen, ọfha ase ẹfa chẹ, ọttạra bẹ́, eche chẹ efona ororo ẹnyaamẹ ẹbaabha ọyagbin. <verse eid="EXO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 9:17" />Tạrr ukpira ma, atim age nkkaang bẹ́, anạng pẹ ọbọhk mátte abẹ afona. <verse eid="EXO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 9:18" />Ma wo, uphyini k'okpe-demakwẹ ngwa, m'otebh arạngtava p'apyibhi ọtạm, ayọhnga arạngta p'kk'attia tạma s'Ijip obobe ọmmaana, tạrr ukpira maa. <verse eid="EXO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 9:19" />Tọhm ẹkkaabha abẹ atima itirakpo pyọ, ọttạra ọttọhk fidede f'ode pfọ f'uning k'owonu, atima anwa k'ukkira, ukwuru bẹ, de arạngta mbọ atebhi, ayokhanạng ọttạra itirakpo p'nạn k'ukkira náninga, m'epe-ope.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 9:20" />Ma wọ, ajukwa p'Phero p'akhaam ojora f'ọtọhnga kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, adwuk-udwukha ata atạkha atọhmnạng pabẹ, ọttạra itirakpo pyabẹ atima anwa k'ẹtaanga. <verse eid="EXO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 9:21" />Okhenka, ayok mbọ p'akhaang ọtọhnga kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, atte abira pabẹ, ọttạra itirakpo pyabẹ ọbọhk k'owonu.<verse eid="EXO 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 9:22" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi n'obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Nemi ọbọhk kwọ tena k'ẹrạng, ọfha arạngtava atebh ayokhanạng ọttạra itirakpo, ọttạra ọtọhk fidede f'omeni k'iwonu s'anạng p'Ijip.” <verse eid="EXO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 9:23" />Masẹ Mosẹs onemi uchikwura kwẹ otena k'ẹrạng, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhm ẹbhaamkpon, ọttạra arạngtava, ẹbhaamkpon ẹnnaarẹ k'isek. Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi otebhi arạngtava k'ofhon kw'Ijip; <verse eid="EXO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 9:24" />arạngtava atebh, ẹbhaamkpon ẹnnaarẹ, idimi, ẹnnaarẹ, idimi, arạngtava mbọ bọ wa, ipyibhi ọtạm ẹyọhnga p'kk'attia tạma s'IJip obobe ọmmaana tạrr, ukwu usi ofhon. <verse eid="EXO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 9:25" />Arạngtava mbọ afhọ ayokhanạng ọttạra nten k'Ijip, ọttạra nchi, ọttạra ọttọhk fidede f'omeni k'iwonu. <verse eid="EXO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 9:26" />Ibyi ibungusẹ s'uwa arạngtava mbọ nạnátebha ide k'Goshẹn, s'uwa anạng p'Israẹl arukhu.<verse eid="EXO 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 9:27" />Ma wọ Phero oyeri Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn ọkpaak bẹ bẹ́, “Ẹkpa nja kk'ipyibha nsia, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi wọ otor-otor, ipyima ede chaam ọttạra anạng paam. <verse eid="EXO 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 9:28" />Ase njọhm anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ukuma mmaamkpon nna, ọttạra arạngtava mba, khiri asẹ kk'isaabha iseng eden. Amma m'ntte bạnga ọbọhk otte abạnga afona, dạk nọ́baana bẹ́, abạnga aninga maa afona ororo.”<verse eid="EXO 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 9:29" />Mosẹs ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “De kk'mbina nnik ofhon ngwa mfona, amma m'mmaama mbọhk saam nse njọhm nnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Mmaamkpon m'ikumma ttạtta, arạngta m'abạra akkuma tạtebh, ma wọ, m'asonga bẹ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi wọ ọkhaam ọyagbin. <verse eid="EXO 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 9:30" />Okhenka, amma nsong ma bẹ́, ọma ọttạra ajukwa pọ, abạnga ojora f'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi tạm nákhaama.”<verse eid="EXO 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 9:31" />(Wa afhufhu ọttạra abarli agba ikhibhi, s'uwa abarli kk'akhora, afhufhu abạra ayạm. <verse eid="EXO 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 9:32" />Okhenka, awit nákhibha, ukwuru s'uwa apyẹ nạn igima ekhor). <verse eid="EXO 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 9:33" />Ma wọ Mosẹs ubin urik Phero, otte ofhon ọbọhk, ọta ọmmaama mbọhk otena Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ose njọhm, mmaamkpon ikuma ttạtta, arạngtava akuma ttạtto, ọrạngkpaang ọbạra ukuma tạtebh. <verse eid="EXO 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 9:34" />Masẹ Phero ose bẹ́, ọrạngkpaang, ọttạra arạngtava, ọttạra mmaamkpon kk'ikuma, ẹma ọttạra ajukwa pẹ abạra afona ororo akpọhkhọ echo. <verse eid="EXO 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 9:35" />Ma wọ Phero ofon ororo ọbạr ette. Anạng p'Israẹl ọbọhk nóchera otte abẹ afona, oche kw'uwa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs utima ọkpaak.<verse eid="EXO 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EXO 10" />
  <para style="s">Nkwuru S'agwurubhebhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 10:1" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Sọhng khebha Phero, khiri kk'ettem chẹ, ọttạra nttem s'ajukwa pẹ nsia bẹ, asẹ ibạr mororo. Ọfha osenga ma, nsi ikkukkonadik saam ma abẹ ukwung, <verse eid="EXO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 10:2" />ọfha kwạna atek iva pọ, ọttạra iva p'iva pọ, oche kw'nsi anạng p'Ijip irem, ọttạra ikkukkonadik s'nsi kabẹ k'ititikha, ọfha abạnga abạra asonga bẹ, amma wọ nde Ovaar Ubinọkpaabyi.”<verse eid="EXO 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 10:3" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn afon akhebha Phero, akpaakh-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'aHiburu, obeni bẹ́, ‘M'ubhir ukpira yạn, brasẹ asạkha ifor sọ anạng-m o? Tte anạng paam ọbọhk abẹ afona, ọfha abẹ ata akpobh-m khadẹ. <verse eid="EXO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 10:4" />Ode afhumu bẹ́, anạng paam ọbọhk mátte abẹ afona, uphyini, m'ntọhm agwurub hebhe kakhọ k'ofhon. <verse eid="EXO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 10:5" />Agwurubhebhe mbọ m'abubha isisek phyibh tạrr ọnạng dạkhẹ isisek móse. Apyẹ m'ẹbạra ikhibhi ekpo py'uwa arạngtava akhibhi arik, ọttạra ichi chidede ch'emeni k'iwonu sabạnga. <verse eid="EXO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 10:6" />Apyẹ m'ẹbạra ifu k'ichọhm sọ, ọttạra k'ichọhm s'ajukwa pọ, ọttạra k'ichọhm s'anạng p'Ijip phyibh. Akwẹ m'ode udik kw'ab'atte, ọttạra ab'atte p'ab'atte pọ, nạn tạm násia, tạma s'ofhon kw'Ijip obobe ọmmaana, tạrr ukpira mantọmma.’ ” Ma wọ, Mosẹs ubin urik Phero.<verse eid="EXO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 10:7" />Ajukwa mbọ n'abạbh Phero bẹ́, “M'ubhir ukpira yạn brasẹ ujunung nwa ukuma mạna k'ọmaphyaangẹ gige o? Tte bẹ ọbọhk abẹ afona, ọfha abẹ at'akpobha Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kwabẹ khadẹ o. Node bẹ́, ọma tạm násia bẹ́, Ijip n'uning k'irem o?” <verse eid="EXO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 10:8" />Ma wọ, Phero ọtọhmọ abẹ ayeri Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn akpa nnạm, oben bẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga asọhng ata akpobha Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga. Ma, bạng anạng bọ m'afona?”<verse eid="EXO 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 10:9" />Mosẹs ubhina bẹ́, “Amạna mba phyibh m'anfon-ofona, asạk-ọsạkha abạr-ọbạr, oseng ajunungva ọttạra apanạngva, ọttạra itirakpo py'amạna, ukwuru bẹ́, m'ansi erobha ch'ikpukpobha annạng Ọvaar Ubinokpaabyi kwamạna.”<verse eid="EXO 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 10:10" />Okhenka, Phero n'obeni bẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga akkẹ bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'uninga bạnga abẹ, de ntte bạnga ọbọhk abạnga afona, ipanạng ọttạra iva pabạnga abẹ? Kk'aam ọttaana bẹ́, abạnga akhạm iphyibha. <verse eid="EXO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 10:11" />Mesese! Tte ajunung mạnkkeni afona ata akpobha Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ọgba udik kw'abạnga n'aphyem kẹnạma gwọ ma.” Ma o, abẹ akhubh Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn k'ititikha s'Phero.<verse eid="EXO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 10:12" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Dira ọbọhk kwọ tena k'Ijip, ọfha agwurubhebhe atạkha ibyi sidede, ẹbạra ikhibhi ọttọhk fidede f'omeni k'iwonu, ọttạra ọttọhk fidede f'arạngtava akhibhi arik.”<verse eid="EXO 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 10:13" />Mạnna wọ, Mosẹs udir uchikwura kwẹ otena k'Ijip, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi ọbhẹrẹ ọtạma k'ukhubha kw'okpebhadudon n'uyin, uguma ọbaabha ofhon ma iwu njọ k'ubungu. Masẹ iwu n'echobh o, ọbhẹrẹ nwọ kk'agwurubhebhe utima ukwu, <verse eid="EXO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 10:14" />apyẹ ẹnyaamẹ ẹbaabha Ijip k'ọsaabh. S'akwẹ obeb'ode, nkwuru s'agwurubhebhe tạmạnuttia k'Ijip, akwẹ dạk m'ọbạra otto tạrr ọyagbin ọvọhkhọ. <verse eid="EXO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 10:15" />Agwurubhebhe mbọ ibubh isisek phyibh tạrr asẹ ipy'irungu <char style="it">bẹ́ kkạạng.</char> Apyẹ ichi ọtọhk fidede f'arạngtava akhibhi arik: tạma k'ekpo py'n'emen k'iwonu, tạrr ukpira k'achidwuk. Wa ichi jạnẹ-jạnẹ, ọttạra isạsaarẹ rạnẹ-rạnẹ, s'isen-oseni dạk kíde k'isek s'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 10:16" />Phero udwukh-udwukha oyeri Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn, oben bẹ bẹ́, “Amma kk'ipyibha nsia k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwọ, ọttạra k'ititikha sọ. <verse eid="EXO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 10:17" />Totokhạn, bina ma nạng-m mpyibha saam eden nja, abạra ase njọhm anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwọ, ọfha ọrạbh mạna ma nkwuru nna.”<verse eid="EXO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 10:18" />Mosẹs ubina urik Phero ọta ose njọhm ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 10:19" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọbhạkhe ọbhẹrẹ nwọ otena k'ukhubha kw'ọchọhkha-dudon n'udimi, uguma agwurubhebhe mbọ phyibh ọbhạrẹ k'Ẹraanga-khora. Ugwurubhebhe wạnọ-wạnọ dạk núrikha k'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 10:20" />Okhenka, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi Phero ofona ororo ọbạr ettem, ufhum bẹ́, otte anạng p'Israẹl ọbọhk abẹ afona.<verse eid="EXO 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkwuru s'urungubạnga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 10:21" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Dira ọbọhk kwọ tena k'ọrạngkpankpa, ọfha urungubạnga uyin ubhubha Ijip phyibh.” <verse eid="EXO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 10:22" />Mosẹs udira ọbọhk kwẹ otena k'ọrạngkpakpa, urungubạnga nwa kw'upyi bẹ, kkạng, ububha Ijip phyibh k'iwu mạnna itaan. <verse eid="EXO 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 10:23" />Ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ kw'ose oyok, brasẹ n'ubin urik ibyi sẹ ma iwu nnọ ittaan, kode. Chibhi s'ode oche ngwọ, anạng p'Israẹl akhaam ọyaanttaana k'ibyi sidede sabẹ arukhu.<verse eid="EXO 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 10:24" />Ma wọ, Phero oyeri Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn oben bẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga asọhng ata akpobha Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Ipanạng ọttạra iva pabạnga akke-okke atwạn bạnga abẹ, akhenka atte itirakpo p'abạnga ọbọhk ininga ma.”<verse eid="EXO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 10:25" />Okhenka, Mosẹs ọbẹ, “Oyonga m'atte mạna ọbọhk anta anfọhnọ nja, ambạra anta ansi nnạnga ikkạmasẹ annạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwamạna. <verse eid="EXO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 10:26" />Oseng itirakpo pyamạna m'ẹgba ẹtwạn mạna abẹ efona, vạnọ-vạnọ mámbina annik, ukwuru bẹ́, m'antima byạnọ annạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwamạna ikpukpobha. Oyonga de kk'amkpira kha brasẹ n'ansong ọttọhk f'm'antima annạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ikpukpobha.”<verse eid="EXO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 10:27" />Okhenka ode bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ofon ororo usi Phero odo ettem ọbạr-ọbạr, ifor núdia bẹ, otte anạng p'Israẹl ọbọhk abẹ afona. <verse eid="EXO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 10:28" />Ma wọ, Phero n'obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Bin-m k'ititikha! Dạk káyoma bẹ́, abe-m k'ititikha o! Iwu ch'abạra ase adạkhẹ ititikha saam, m'ape-ope.” <verse eid="EXO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 10:29" />Mosẹs ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “A o! Tte akwẹ ode oche kw'abeni, amma k'ititikha sọ dạk mạ́mbe e.”<verse eid="EXO 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EXO 11" />
  <para style="s">Nkwuru s'obo kw'acheden-junungva p'Ijip</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 11:1" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Amma m'mbạra ntte nkwuru rạnẹ ọbọhk itto okhebha Phero ọttạra anạng p'Ijip. De k'oche ngwọ nsia, m'otte bạnga ọbọhk otte abạnga afona. Masẹ m'otte bạnga ọbọhk, m'ukhubh bạnga, abạnga abina w'owong. <verse eid="EXO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 11:2" />Kpaak anạng p'Israẹl, ajunung ọttạra ipanạng bẹ́, abẹ ata aben anạng p'Ijip anạng bẹ ekpo py'abẹ atim gol ọttạra silva asi.” <verse eid="EXO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 11:3" />(Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi anạng p'Ijip asi ọphyaam anạng bẹ, ọttạra bẹ́, ajukwa p'Phero, ọttạra anạng p'Ijip phyibh n'anạng Mosẹs ikpukpobha sididen).<verse eid="EXO 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 11:4" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs obeni bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ubinokpaabyi obeni bẹ́, ‘K'urunguttem, amma m'nsenga mbaabha ofhon kw'Ijip phyi-phyibh. <verse eid="EXO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 11:5" />Ocheden-junungnwa kwidede k'Ijip m'ope-ope, tạma k'ocheden-junungnwa kw'Phero kw'ọdạbhẹ ẹvaar, tạrr ukpira k'ocheden-junungnwa kw'ubira-kwanạng kw'n'okhok bẹ ekpo, tạrr oseng k'achedenva p'mmaam. <verse eid="EXO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 11:6" />Ẹgạma ch'm'ininga k'Ijip m'ẹbạr ẹyọhnga ch'abẹ kk'agạma, ọttạra ch'kwạna abẹ m'agạma. <verse eid="EXO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 11:7" />Okhenka, ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ kw'm'okpekhi ẹnọhna k'anạng p'Israẹl kòde, ọbạra ẹpfa jọ, ayokhanạng ọttạra nten mẹ́gbọ.’ Ma wọ, abạnga m'asonga bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'usia bẹ́, anạng p'Israẹl abhạm aninga k'anạng p'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 11:8" />Atọhmnạng mba pọ phyibh m'akpa nnạm akwu asạkha echo anạng-m, aben-m bẹ́, ‘Totokhạn, ọma ọttạra anạng phyibh p'atwạnọ abọ, abạnga asọhng!’ Okpe ngwọ sạng, amma m'mfon-ofona e.” Ma wọ, Mosẹs ubin k'idwạdwạkhọ urik Phero.<verse eid="EXO 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 11:9" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs ugima otek bẹ́, “Phero bạnga itọhng mọ́khọmọ e, ọfha ikkukkonadik saam inyaamẹ k'Ijip.” <verse eid="EXO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 11:10" />Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn asi ikkukkonadik nnọ phyi-phyibh ma ititikha s'Phero. Okhenka, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi Phero odo ettem ọbạr-ọbạr, nóchera bẹ́, otte anạng p'Israẹl ọbọhk, abẹ abina arik ẹkhạma chẹ.<verse eid="EXO 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EXO 12" />
  <para style="s">Erobha ch'Pasova</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 12:1" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs, ọttạra Aarọn k'Ijip bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 12:2" />“Ophye nwa m'ode ocheden-phye, ocheden-phye kwabạnga kw'icho. <verse eid="EXO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 12:3" />Tek anạng p'Israẹl phyi-phyibh bẹ́, k'iwu jobh s'ophye nwa, ujunung kwidede m'utima ọrạkhạmaan-nwa wạnọ ukwu k'echo ch'ẹchọhmfhạr chẹ, ẹchọhmfhạr chidede m'ẹkhaama ọrạkhạmaan-nwa wạnọ. <verse eid="EXO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 12:4" />De ẹchọhmfhạr nạnẹ́bạra ebenga k'oche kw'abẹ m'akke ọrạkhạmaan-nwa k'ubungu achi, tte ichọhmfhạr ifa ifhunu, itor k'ubhik kw'anạng ade, itor k'okhebh f'ọnạng-ọnạng m'uchi. <verse eid="EXO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 12:5" />Nten s'abạnga m'atekha, ibaan bẹ́ ide adimpẹ p'ade cho gwạnọ, s'nạ́n ekhem ẹkhaam. Atekha sẹ k'arạkhạmaan, de ọbạra ọdaakhẹ bạnga k'avukpokha o, abạnga atekha. <verse eid="EXO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 12:6" />Ado arạkhạmaan mbọ akkeri tạrr ukpira k'ẹchọhkha ch'ettong iwu sọnachi ch'ophye nwa, kw'ọnạng kwidede kw'ubin ẹkhạma ch'Israẹl m'ọyẹk ọrạkhạmaan kwẹ ẹdwạngọ. <verse eid="EXO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 12:7" />Ma wọ abẹ m'atạkha isẹ rạnẹ afokha k'ọkhaan-ọkhaan, ọttạra k'ẹrạng-ẹrạng kw'mkpọmmachi s'ammakhubh p'ichọhm sabẹ m'aninga achi nten oyeni. <verse eid="EXO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 12:8" />Ma irungu njọ, abẹ m'atima akwongutọhng p'ajobh-ojobhu achi nten nnọ sabẹ abhaabh-ọbhaabh. Abẹ m'achi sẹ ọttạra brẹd kw'abẹ nạn yist nágia. <verse eid="EXO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 12:9" />Abạnga chẹ ikhikhebhi káchi, abạnga asi kátima awọhn chẹ. Okhenka, abhaabh chẹ tạma k'echo kpira k'mfhok, tạrr oseng k'afhạrọ. <verse eid="EXO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 12:10" />Abạnga achi chẹ phyibh bạrasẹ iwu echobha, chidede ch'irikhi, de iwu echobh, ọbaan bẹ́ abạnga akạmọ chẹ ọkkạmọ. <verse eid="EXO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 12:11" />Oche kw'abạnga m'achi chẹ ode bẹ́, abạnga m'akpa adikhikpa k'nwuru sabạnga, age akpafhok, atima achikwura pabạnga k'mbọhk. Abạnga achi chẹ k'ẹbhạr-k'ẹbhạr, ukwuru bẹ́, ma wọ ode erobha ch'Pasova ẹnạng amma Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 12:12" />“Ma irungu njọ, m'nsenga k'Ijip mfhọ achedenva p'ayokhanạng <char style="it">bẹ́ phyibh,</char> ọttạra acheden-dim p'nten sidede. M'mbạra mkpaara iponga s'm'ipyibh akha p'Ijip phyi-phyibh. Amma wọ nde Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 12:13" />Isẹ nnọ m'ide ẹkhọhkha inạng bạnga k'ichọhm s'abạnga aning. Okpe kw'm'nse isẹ nnọ, m'njekha bạnga ojekha. Nkwuru nnọ s'obo bạnga mítwu k'okpe kw'm'nkhibhi Ijip.<verse eid="EXO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 12:14" />“Maa wọ m'ode iwu ch'ijima, ch'igbọ s'iwu oro m'itima isi erobha inạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ikpukpobha. Erobhawu nja m'ininga k'cho kwidede tạrr ipimmanitor. <verse eid="EXO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 12:15" />K'iwu isenọfa, abạnga m'achi brẹd kw'abẹ nạ́n yist nágia. Abạnga arạbha yist k'abạnga k'ichọhm ma echedenwu, ukwuru bẹ́, ọnạng kwidede kw'uchi uchiattọhk f'abẹ age yist, tạma ma echedenwu njọ tạrr ukpira iwu nnọ isenọfa, oyonga abẹ m'akhubh-ẹ k'efhonfhạr ch'Israẹl. <verse eid="EXO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 12:16" />Ma echedenwu, ọttạra iwu ch'ettong isenọfa, abạnga m'akhaama etobha ch'ikpukpobha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Abạnga ọtọhm vạnọ-vạnọ ma iwu nnọ kási, oyonga abạnga m'akhenka awọhn uchiattọhk f'ọnạng kwidede m'uchi.<verse eid="EXO 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 12:17" />“Abạnga m'asi Erobha ch'Brẹd kw'abẹ nạn yist nágia, ukwuru bẹ́, ma iwu njọ jọ ntim bạnga k'ikhaana sabạnga mbina k'Ijip. Abạnga m'asi erobha njọ ede erobha ch'm'ininga ẹnạng igbọ s'iwu oro. <verse eid="EXO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 12:18" />Tạma k'ẹchọhkha ch'iwu sọnachi ch'ocheden-phye, abạnga m'achi brẹd kw'abẹ nạn yist nágia, tạrr ukpira k'ẹchọhkha ch'iwu ch'ettong iwu ẹrạbh ukuma jạnẹ. <verse eid="EXO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 12:19" />K'iwu mạnna isenọfa, abạnga yist k'ichọhm sabạnga káchok. Ọnạng kwidede kw'uchi uchiattọhk f'abẹ age yist, ode ọmmaana, ọbạra ode ukhikhennạng, ọbaan bẹ́ abạnga akhubh-ẹ k'efhonfhạr ch'Israẹl. <verse eid="EXO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 12:20" />Abạnga ọttọhk f'abẹ age yist káchi. K'ibyi sidede s'abạnga arukhu, ọbaan bẹ́ abạnga achi brẹd kw'abẹ nạn yist nágia.”<verse eid="EXO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 12:21" />Ma o, Mosẹs oyeri adennạng p'Israẹl phyibh otobha oben bẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga annemi eden ata atekha arạkhạmaan-va, anạng ichọhmfhạr sabạnga, abạnga afhọ atima asi erobha ch'Pasova. <verse eid="EXO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 12:22" />Abạnga atạkha ẹsạsaarẹ-khe ch'hisobh, arạna k'isẹ s'abạnga age k'ọgbangbang. Atạkha isẹ rạnẹ afokha k'ẹrạng-ẹrạng ọttạra k'ọkhaan-ọkhaan kw'mkpọmmachi s'ammakhubh. Tte ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ nạngẹ k'iyaan uyini tạrr iwu echobha. <verse eid="EXO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 12:23" />Masẹ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'osenga ma isek nnọ ọfhọ anạng p'Ijip, ọchọhm kw'ose isẹ k'mkpọmmachi ẹrạng-ẹrạng, ọttạra k'udimbọhk, ọttạra k'ọkwabọhk, m'ojekha kwẹ ojekha. Itọhmọ sẹ ọbọhk mótte bẹ́, inwa k'ichọhm sabạnga, ifhọ bạnga.<verse eid="EXO 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 12:24" />“Abạngama, ọttạra iva pabạnga m'achok erobhawu nja k'cho kwidede tạrr ipimmanitor. <verse eid="EXO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 12:25" />De abạnga akpir k'isisek nnọ s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ochekhi bẹ́, ọnạng bạnga, abạnga asi erobha njọ. <verse eid="EXO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 12:26" />De kwạna iva pabạnga abạbhọ bạnga bẹ́, ‘Erobha nja iyini yạn o?’ <verse eid="EXO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 12:27" />Abạnga akpaak bẹ bẹ́, ‘Achẹ ede erobha ch'ẹjafọhna ch'Pasova ẹnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, s'uwa ojek ichọhm s'anạng p'Israẹl k'Ijip, bạra ọkkaana ichọhmfhạr samạna k'okpe kw'uwa ọfhọ anạng p'Ijip.’ ” Ma o, anạng mbọ atwunga echo anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ikpukpobha. <verse eid="EXO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 12:28" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl asi oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhnọ Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn.<verse eid="EXO 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 12:29" />Ma urunguttem, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọfhọ achedenva p'Ijip bẹ́, phyibh tạma k'ochedennwa kw'Phero kw'ọdạbhẹ ẹvaar, tạrr ukpira k'achedenva p'agbakkọhbhọ p'aning k'ọgbakkọhbhọ-ter, tạrr oseng k'achedenva p'itirakpo. <verse eid="EXO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 12:30" />Masẹ Phero ọttạra attọhmnạng pẹ, ọttạra anạng p'Ijip aphyạbh ma irungu, wa, ẹgạma ẹbạrẹ eseng eden, ukwuru bẹ́ ẹchọhmfhạr nbekha ch'ọnạng nạn núpua.<verse eid="EXO 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Osenga kw'anạng p'Israẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 12:31" />Ma irungu, Phero oyeri Mosẹs, ọttạra Aarọn, oben bẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga abina! Atima anạng p'Israẹl abina arik anạng paam! Asọhng, ata akpobha Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oche kw'abạnga aroru. <verse eid="EXO 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 12:32" />Atạkha mmaam sabạnga, ọttạra arạkhạmaan, ọttạra mvu sabạnga, atima asọhng, oche kw'abạnga abeni. Abạnga m'abạra ayọhbh-m ita.”<verse eid="EXO 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 12:33" />Ma wọ, anạng p'Ijip n'ayạk anạng p'Israẹl bẹ́, “Abạnga asi ẹbhạr-ẹbhạrẹ abina arik ẹkhạma chamạna, deja, m'ankker-okkera ampe.” <verse eid="EXO 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 12:34" />Osenga ma, anạng p'Israẹl abina, atạkha brẹd kw'abẹ nạ́n yist tạm nágia, age k'agbangbang pabẹ n'atima asi brẹd, atạkha afhạrọ k'ọvạra fabẹ, atạkha atọhkha k'nkkang. <verse eid="EXO 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 12:35" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl asi oche kw'Mosẹs ọtọhna bẹ, abẹ ata abạbh anạng p'Ijip silva, ọttạra gol, ọttạra ọvạra. <verse eid="EXO 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 12:36" />N'ode s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'anạng p'Israẹl usia bẹ́, abẹ akhaama ọphyaam k'anạng p'Ijip. Abẹ anạng anạng p'Israẹl fidede f'abẹ abạbhọ bẹ. Ma wọ anạng p'Israẹl acha ẹkhaama ch'anạng p'Ijip atima afona.<verse eid="EXO 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 12:37" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl abin osenga k'Rameses akpira k'Sukọt. Anạng p'uwa asi osenga ngwọ akpir nnọhna ẹnọhna ukuma arạbh jobh, de akpẹrẹ ipanạng ọttạra ọgbọsẹkhẹ achok ọkhaan-ọkhaan. <verse eid="EXO 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 12:38" />Wa anạng adwạkh-ọdwạk k'ọsaabh, agba atwạn bẹ abẹ ma osenga ngwọ, ọttạra itirakpo k'ọsaabh, oseng k'arạkhạmaan, ọttạra mvu. <verse eid="EXO 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 12:39" />Wa, abẹ atim abubuma p'abẹ atim abina k'Ijip, atima asi brẹd kwa nạn bibir k'nubir. Abẹ ọttọhk f'n'usi brẹd ubir, ma abubuma mbọ nagia, ukwuru s'uwa abẹ n'akhubh bẹ ukhubh k'Ijip, wa, abẹ dạkhẹ okpe nakhaama kw'abẹ atim awọhn uchiattọhk fabẹ.<verse eid="EXO 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 12:40" />Phyi-phyibh, wa anạng p'Israẹl arukhu icho ẹnọhna ukuma icho ẹrạbh ukuma jobh k'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 12:41" />Ma iwu njọ ch'ettong icho ẹnọhna ukuma icho ẹrạbh ukuma jobh, wa, anạng p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi abin k'nkạma sabẹ arik k'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 12:42" />S'uwa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi utikhi irungu njọ, ọfha utima bẹ ubina k'Ijip, ma irunguwu nja jọ ch'anạng p'Israẹl m'n'atik irungu n'atima anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ikpukpobha tạrr ipimmanitor.<verse eid="EXO 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyina ch'erobha ch'Passova</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 12:43" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn bẹ́, “Maa wọ ode nnyina s'iten k'uchiattọhk f'erobha ch'Passova.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 12:43">‘Tte ukhikhennạng wạnọ-wạnọ nạngẹ pfẹ uchi. <verse eid="EXO 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 12:44" />Ubira kwidede kw'abạnga atim akpokha adebh okkokke uchi pfẹ, s'abạnga kk'ẹ ọnạm akpaara. <verse eid="EXO 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 12:45" />Okhenka, ukhikhennạng kw'urukhu bạnga abẹ, ọbạra ode ọtọhmnạng kw'abẹ abher-ẹ ọtọhm, nọ́baana bẹ́ uchi pfẹ.<verse eid="EXO 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 12:46" />“Ọbaan bẹ́ abạnga achi pfẹ k'ọchọhm ẹtaanga, abạnga eten jạnẹ-jạnẹ kátima ayin k'iyaan. Abạnga ọkhạbhọ wạnọ-wạnọ kávọkhọ. <verse eid="EXO 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EXO 12:47" />Efhonfhạr ch'Israẹl phyi-phyibh ẹbaan bẹ́ isi erobha nja.<verse eid="EXO 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EXO 12:48" />“De ukhikhennạng kw'urukhu bạnga abẹ, ọdaakhẹ bẹ́, usi Erobha nja ch'pasova ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ọbaan bẹ́ ajunung p'ọchọhm kwẹ phyibh akpaara ọnạm. Ma wọ, ẹma nwọ n'abạra usi chẹ masẹ ọmmaana wạnọ kwabạnga. Tte ọkpatwạr-nạng nạngẹ uchi o. <verse eid="EXO 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EXO 12:49" />Inyina nja ede ch'ammaana ọttạra akhikhennạng p'arukhu bạnga abẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 12:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="EXO 12:50" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl phyibh asi oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn ọtọhna. <verse eid="EXO 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EXO 12:51" />Ma iwu njọ jạnẹ-jạnẹ, wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi utim anạng p'Israẹl k'nkhạma sabẹ, abina arik Ijip.<verse eid="EXO 12:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EXO 13" />
  <para style="s">Idibha ch'achedenva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 13:1" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 13:2" />“Tte ujunung-nwa kwidede kw'uchi eden ọmmaana ọbọhk, anạng-m. Ocheden-nwa kw'ifhạr sidede k'ikhaana s'anạng p'Israẹl, ode oyokhanạng o, ọbạra ode eten o, ode kwaam.”<verse eid="EXO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 13:3" />Ma wọ Mosẹs obeni anạng mbọ bẹ́, “Abạnga ajima iwu nja, iwu ch'uwa abạnga abin k'Ijip, k'ofhon kw'ibira, ukwuru bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi utim ẹfa chẹ ọrạbha bạnga ma. Abạnga ọttọhk f'abẹ age yist káchi o. <verse eid="EXO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 13:4" />Chemma, ma ophye kw'Abib ẹwọ kw'abạnga n'abina. <verse eid="EXO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 13:5" />Okpe kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'utima bạnga ukpira k'isek s'aKenaan, ọttạra s'aHet, ọttara s'aAmọr, ọttạra s'aHiv, ọttạra s'aJẹbus, isek s'uwa ochekhi ọnạng ab'atte pabạnga bẹ, m'ọnạng bạnga, isek ikkasẹ s'abasi ọttạra ana p'ọkhọhn, ọttạra ekpo tutubh, abạnga m'asi erobha nja ma ophye nwa. <verse eid="EXO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 13:6" />K'iwu isenọfa, abạnga m'achi brẹd kw'abẹ nạn yist nágia. Ottong iwu isenọfa, abạnga asi erobha anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 13:7" />Abạnga achi brẹd kw'abẹ nạn yist nágia ma iwu nnọ isenọfa. Tte ọttọhk fidede f'abẹ age yist nạngẹ bạnga fạfor ofor. Tte abẹ nạngẹ yist sise ase k'nnem sabạnga. <verse eid="EXO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 13:8" />Ma iwu njọ, akpaak iva p'abạnga bẹ́, ‘Nsi oche ngwọ ukwuru udik kw'uwa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi ọnạng-m masẹ mbin k'Ijip.’ <verse eid="EXO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 13:9" />Erobha nja ede masẹ ẹkhọhkha ch'age k'ọbọhk, abạra abbẹ k'ititikhattem sọ, atima ajima bẹ, inyina ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'ininga k'ẹmma chọ, ukwuru s'uwa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi utim-ọ ubina k'Ijip k'ẹfa chẹ chididen. <verse eid="EXO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 13:10" />Abạnga m'achok erobha nja k'okpe kwẹ, k'cho kwidede.<verse eid="EXO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 13:11" />“Masẹ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'utima bạnga ukpira k'isisek s'aKenaan, oche kw'uwa ọtạk echekha ọnạng bạnga ọttạra ab'atte pabạnga. <verse eid="EXO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 13:12" />Abạnga atạkha achedenva k'ifhạr sidede anạng masẹ ẹnạnga anang, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Achedenva p'adim py'itirakpo pyabạnga ade p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 13:13" />Abạnga atima ọrạkhạmaan-nwa abhek ocheden-nwa kw'ẹnyạnyaang chabạnga, okhenka, ode nạm abhek, bhạnga chẹ ikhukhora. Abạnga abhek acheden-junungva pabạnga phyibh.<verse eid="EXO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 13:14" />“De kwạna iva pabạnga abạbh bạnga bẹ́, ‘Erobha nja iyini yạn o?’ Abạnga atek bẹ bẹ́, ‘Wa Ubinọkpaabyi utim ẹfa chẹ chididen ọrạbha mạna k'ibira ch'ofhon kw'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 13:15" />Ukwuru ottembạr kw'ọvaar Phero wa nạn ochera bẹ́, otte mạna ọbọhk amfona, wa Ubinọkpaabyi ọfhọ acheden-junungva p'anạng p'Ijip, ọttạra p'itirakpo pyabẹ phyip. Ẹgwọ usi ntim achedendim p'nten samạna, nfọhnọ ẹja nnạng Ubinọkpaabyi, ọfha mmek acheden-junungva paam phyibh. <verse eid="EXO 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 13:16" />Ma wọ m'ode masẹ ẹkhọhkha ch'akpa k'ọbọhk ọttạra k'ititikhattem sọ bẹ, wa Ubinọkpaabyi utim ẹfa chẹ ch'ididen ọrạbha mạna k'ibira ch'anạng p'Ijip.”<verse eid="EXO 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ejekha ch'Ẹraanga-khora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 13:17" />Masẹ wa Phero n'otte anạng p'Israẹl ọbọhk abẹ afona, wa Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ nútima osenga k'ẹkhạma ch'aPhilistiya, kw'eden ikhum-ukhuma, s'uwa Ubinọkpaabyi ọkkẹ bẹ́, “De abẹ attạm ekpong achẹ k'eden, abẹ akkokke afhona nttem sabẹ, arạbh akpa nnạm k'Ijip.” <verse eid="EXO 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 13:18" />Osenga ma, wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi utima bẹ osenga k'ibyi s'anạngn'nárukha, s'ikkeri ititikha k'Ẹraanga-khora. Wa anạng p'Israẹl ado ifor s'ekpong atima abina k'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 13:19" />Wa Mosẹs okpokhu akhạbhọ p'Josẹph, ukwuru s'uwa Josẹph kk'iva p'Jekọb usia abẹ atạkha echekha. Ẹma Josẹph wa kk'obena bẹ́, “K'udik ọkka, Ubinọkpaabyi m'ọkkaana bạnga ọkkaana e. De kk'obenga, oyonga abạnga atima akhạbhọ paam abina ma ibyi nna.” <verse eid="EXO 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 13:20" />Masẹ abẹ abin k'Sukọt, abẹ ata abhing k'Ẹtam, k'ọkhaan-ọkhaan kw'ibyi s'anạngn'nárukha. <verse eid="EXO 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 13:21" />Wa Ubinọkpaabyi utim ebona ch'ebe udumudum uchi bẹ eden k'ẹya, ọbạra utima ekpon ch'ebe udumudum ọnạng bẹ ọyanttaana k'irungu, ọfha abẹ akkokke asi osenga ngwọ k'ẹya ọttạra k'irungu. <verse eid="EXO 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 13:22" />Wa ebona njọ ch'ebe udumudum k'ẹya, ọttạra ekpon njọ ch'ebe udumudum k'irungu, apyẹ ibyi sabẹ abe k'ititikha s'anạng p'Israẹl, nábina arik.<verse eid="EXO 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EXO 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 14:1" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 14:2" />“Kpaak anạng p'Israẹl bẹ́, abẹ akpa nnạm ata abhing abaanga Pi-Hahirọt, kw'uning k'ngekha s'Migdol, ọttạra ẹraanga-diden. Tte abẹ abhing k'ẹraanga-kha, akkeri Baal-Zẹphọn ititikha. <verse eid="EXO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 14:3" />Phero m'ọkkẹ bẹ́ anạng p'Israẹl nạnkha awena abaabha isisek nnọ k'dạmadạma, k'ibyi s'anạng nạnárukha. <verse eid="EXO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 14:4" />Amma m'nsi Phero ọkpọhkhọ echo ukhubh bẹ k'nnạm. Okhenka, amma m'nsenga k'Phero ọttạra k'arim-ekpong pẹ ntạkha abạrada nnạng ifor saam, ọfha anạng p'Ijip atima asonga bẹ́ amma wọ nde Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.” Ma wọ anạng p'Israẹl asi oche ngwọ.<verse eid="EXO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 14:5" />Masẹ abẹ atekhi Phero kw'ode ọvaarnạng kw'Ijip bẹ́ anạng p'Israẹl kk'arạbha afona, ẹma ọttạra ajukwa pẹ afhona ẹkka chabẹ, aben bẹ́ “Mbẹ, bạng udik gwọ ansi ma o? Kk'anạng mbọ ọbọhk anttia abẹ afona. Kk'itọhm sabẹ n'asi anạng mạna angwana.” <verse eid="EXO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 14:6" />Osenga ma, Phero odo ijaar sẹ s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr, ọttạra k'akpongnạng pẹ p'atwạn abẹ. <verse eid="EXO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 14:7" />Utim ijaar ikkasẹ s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr, s'ide ẹnọhna ukuma arạbh jobh, ọttạra k'ijaar nnọkha phyibh s'Ijip s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr, ọttạra adecho phyi-phyibh p'atim bẹ eden. <verse eid="EXO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 14:8" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi Phero kw'ode ọvaarnạng kw'Ijip ọbạr ettem, ukhubh anạng p'Israẹl p'n'asenga akkemkpa-akkemkpa afona. <verse eid="EXO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 14:9" />Anạng p'Ijip, ọttạra nnyạnyaang s'Phero, ọttạra ijaar s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr, ọttạra anạng p'n'ayaar nnyạnyaang, oseng k'akpongnạng p'aseng osenga, afon ororo akhubh anạng p'Israẹl tạrr abẹ ata akhebha bẹ k'ibyi sabẹ asi uruk kwabẹ k'ẹraangakha, ọbaanga Pi-Hahirọt, kw'Baal-Zẹphọn abẹ akkeri ayok ititikha.<verse eid="EXO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 14:10" />Masẹ anạng p'Israẹl ase bẹ́, Phero ọttạra anạng p'Ijip kk'bẹ afora, ojora ọvạkha bẹ. Abẹ agạma ayeri Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 14:11" />Abẹ abhạkhẹ abạbh Mosẹs bẹ́, “Ma, s'apekwur nạ́n k'Ijip ade, ẹgwọ kw'atima mạna akwu ma k'ibyi s'owor bẹ́, ampe o? Bạng udik-khira gwọ asi mạna oche ngwa, asi yạn atima mạna abina k'Ijip o? <verse eid="EXO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 14:12" />Wa, khọ námbena bẹ́, atte mạna ọbọhk ankhenka anninga ande abira p'anạng p'Ijip? Wạra m'ujibh mạna ọtạm bẹ́, ande atọhmnạng p'aJipnạng ọyọhnga bẹ́, ankwu ampe k'ibyi-khira nna!”<verse eid="EXO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 14:13" />Mosẹs ubhina bẹ bẹ́, “Nạng bạnga ojor, abạnga ado abe, khiri chemma wọ kw'abạnga m'ase eden ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'osenga ọnạng bạnga ẹkkaana. Anạng mbọ p'Ijip p'abạnga ase ma, chemma wọ abạnga ase bẹ akpicho, abạnga dạkhẹ bẹ máse tạrr ipimmanitor. <verse eid="EXO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 14:14" />Aninga <char style="it">bẹ́ tạkkạbh,</char> khiri Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'usi irima chabạnga.” <verse eid="EXO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 14:15" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Ode yạn kw'n'agạma ayer-m? Tera ben anạng p'Israẹl afona ororo. <verse eid="EXO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 14:16" />Dira uchikwura kwọ k'ẹrạng, anemi ọbọhk atena k'ẹraanga-diden njọ, ọfha awẹ ọbhaangẹ ibyi ifa, anạng p'Israẹl asenga k'isisek ajaakha. <verse eid="EXO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 14:17" />Amma m'nsi anạng p'Ijip akpọhkhọ echo, ọfha abẹ akhubh anạng p'Israẹl k'nnạm. Amma m'nsenga Phero abẹ, ọttạra akpongnạng pẹ phyibh, ọttạra ijaar sẹ s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr, ọttạra ayaar-nnyạnyaang pẹ, ntạkha abạrada. <verse eid="EXO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 14:18" />AJipnạng m'asonga bẹ́, amma wọ nde Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, masẹ m'nsenga Phero abẹ, ọttạra ijaar sẹ s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr, ọttạra ayaar-nnyạnyaang pẹ, ntạkha abạrada.”<verse eid="EXO 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 14:19" />Ma wọ, itọhmọ s'Ubinọkpaabyi, s'kk'akpongnạng p'Israẹl eden ichia, n'ikpa nnạm ita ininga bẹ k'nnạm. Ebona ch'ebe masẹ ẹtakpa ẹbạra ibina bẹ k'ititikha, efona adạkhẹ ẹta ebe bẹ k'nnạm, <verse eid="EXO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 14:20" />kw'ode ottem-kwẹ kw'akpongnạng p'Ijip ọttạra p'Israẹl. Ma irungu njọ phyibh ebona njọ itim urungubạnga ikwu k'ukhubha gwạnọ, ọyaanttaana uninga k'ukhubha ngwọkha. Ma wọ, ọnạng kw'm'oke osenga ọbaanga oyok ma irunguwu njọ kóde.<verse eid="EXO 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 14:21" />Ma wọ Mosẹs onemi ọbọhk otena k'ẹraanga-diden ma irungu njọ phyibh. Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi utima ufhum kw'ubin k'ukhubha kw'okpebha-dudon, ọtwạnọ asi tạrr apyẹ ẹbhaangẹ, igbin iyin. <verse eid="EXO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 14:22" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl asengi k'igbin ma ẹraangattem, k'asi p'abe masẹ udimokpon k'udimbọhk kwabẹ ọttạra k'ọkwabọhk kwabẹ.<verse eid="EXO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 14:23" />Ajipnạng ọttạra nnyạnyaang s'Phero, ọttạra ijaar sẹ s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr, ọttạra ayaar-nnyạnyaang pẹ phyibh, akhubhu anạng p'Israẹl anwa ma ẹraangattem ch'ẹraanga-diden. <verse eid="EXO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 14:24" />Ma ekpebha-rungu, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oseng ma ekpon ch'ebe masẹ ẹtakpa, ọttạra k'ebona, ose akpongnạng p'Ijip, ukwu oge bẹ k'dạmadạma. <verse eid="EXO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 14:25" />Usi ntwạkhọ s'ijaar s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr irạbha, tạrr ọyaara ọkhaarẹ bẹ. Ma wọ, aJipnạng n'abeni bẹ́, “Ayok mba, tte antte anạng p'Israẹl ọbọhk abẹ afona o, khiri Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi wọ n'urima mạna abẹ k'abẹ k'echo ma e!” <verse eid="EXO 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 14:26" />Ma o, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Nemi ọbọhk tena k'ẹraanga-diden, ọfha asi akpa nnạm anwa akpora aJipnạng, ọttạra ijaar sabẹ s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr, ọttạra ayaar-nnyạnyaang pabẹ.” <verse eid="EXO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 14:27" />Ma o, Mosẹs onemi ọbọhk otena k'ẹraanga-diden. Se iwu echobh, ẹraanga-diden njọ ekpa nnạm k'ọche kw'wura ening. Masẹ anạng p'Ijip akhong bé arạbh, Ovaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọkpaanga bẹ phyibh ọbhạrẹ ma k'ẹraanga-diden njọ. <verse eid="EXO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 14:28" />Ma wọ asi afhobhu afhạrọ ijaar s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr, ọttạra ayaar-nnyạnyaang, ọttạra akpongnạng p'Phero phyi-phyibh p'kk'anạng p'Israẹl akhubha kk'nnạm, anwa k'ẹraanga-diden. Ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ kw'ọnnaang kòde. <verse eid="EXO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 14:29" />Okhenka, wa anạng p'Israẹl asengi k'igbin ma ẹraangattem, s'asi n'abe masẹ udimokpon k'udimbọhk kwabẹ, ọttạra k'ọkwabọhk kwabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 14:30" />Ma iwu njọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọkkaan anạng p'Israẹl k'mbọhk s'aJipnạng. Anạng p'Israẹl n'ase s'apfura p'aJipnạng ayim k'ẹraangapa. <verse eid="EXO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 14:31" />Ma wọ, masẹ anạng p'Israẹl ase ẹfa chididen ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi utim okhema anạng p'Ijip, abẹ n'akhaam ojora f'Ubinọkpaabyi, abẹ abạra akhaama echera kakhẹ, ọttạra k'ọtọhmnạng kwẹ Mosẹs.<verse eid="EXO 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EXO 15" />
  <para style="s">Ẹmạng ch'Mosẹs ọttạra Miriyam akkọhnọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 15:1" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs ọttạra anạng p'Israẹl akkọhnọ ẹmạng anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi aben bẹ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:1">“Amma m'nkkọhn nnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:1">ukwuru ekhema-bạrada chẹ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:1">Kk'ẹnyạnyaang ọttạra ọyaar-ẹnyạnyaang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:1">udira uribhi k'ẹraanga-diden.<verse eid="EXO 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 15:2" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi wọ ode ẹfa chaam, ọttạra ẹmạng ch'm'nkkọhn.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:2">Ẹma wọ ode ẹnnaanga chaam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:2">Ẹma wọ ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwaam. Amma m'ntọhng-ẹ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:2">M'ndira Ubinọkpaabyi kw'otte kwaam okpobh k'ẹrạng.<verse eid="EXO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 15:3" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi wọ ode okkemkpa kw'ekpong,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:3">ẹma okpen Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 15:4" />Ẹma kk'ijaar s'Phero s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr, ọttạra akpongnạng pẹ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:4">ọtạkha uribhi k'ẹraanga-diden.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:4">Ọtạkha akpongnạng p'Phero p'abạrẹ udik ọtạm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:4">uribhi k'Ẹraanga-khora.<verse eid="EXO 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 15:5" />Asi p'adong-odong afhạrọ bẹ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:5">abẹ aribhi k'isiyạr masẹ ẹta.<verse eid="EXO 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 15:6" />O Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, udimbọhk kwọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:6">ọkhaam ẹfa ch'ididen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:6">O Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, atim udimbọhk kwọ asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:6">awawunanạng araama.<verse eid="EXO 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 15:7" />K'abạrada p'ẹvaar chọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:7">akhem anạng p'awun-ọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:7">Atte ottem-khạm kwọ ọbọhk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:7">ọkkạmọ awawunanạng pọ masẹ achi-bukhu.<verse eid="EXO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 15:8" />Agum ọyọhng kwọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:8">asi atobha, abe <char style="it">bẹ gbẹng</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:8">asi p'afhobhu ikwu ittima, ẹkpọhkhọ masẹ udimokpon.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:8">Asi mbọ p'adong-odong n'abhạkhẹ akpọhkhọ-ọkpọhkhọ k'ẹraangattem.<verse eid="EXO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 15:9" />Ọwawunanạng usi ẹmma oben bẹ́,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">“Amma m'nkubh bẹ, mbạra nkạbha bẹ oro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:9">M'nkkema ẹkhaama chabẹ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">m'nchi pyẹ igwọhr-igwọhra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">M'ntima ọkkangkkang-kkro kwaam mfhọ bẹ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">m'ntima mbọhk saam ndimi bẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 15:10" />Agum ọyọhng kwọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:10">asi anwa ẹfhạra bẹ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:10">abẹ atem k'isiyạr,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:10">masẹ opo otemi k'isiyạr k'ọraanga-diden.<verse eid="EXO 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 15:11" />“O Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, k'ikhaana s'idik s'anạng n'akpobha phyibh, mbạng vọ obeng abọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:11">Anẹ wọ obeng abọ?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="EXO 15:11">K'ẹvaar, awurada pọ ayọhng bẹ phyibh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="EXO 15:11">abẹ akhaam ojora pfọ k'ikpukpobha sabẹ n'anạng-ọ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="EXO 15:11">n'asi idik s'ipe anạng ifor.<verse eid="EXO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 15:12" />Annemi ọbọhk kwọ kw'ẹfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:12">isek imyi awawunanạng pọ.<verse eid="EXO 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 15:13" />Atoru k'idạdaakha sọ s'nạ́n itwuna ikhaam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:13">atima anạng p'kk'abhekha eden,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:13">atima bẹ eden k'ẹfa chọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:13">afona k'ibyi irukhasẹ sọ s'awurada.<verse eid="EXO 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 15:14" />Idifhon ibhaang idik nnọ, itạma fạfạnọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:14">attem-fạfạnọ kk'aPhilistiya avạkha.<verse eid="EXO 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 15:15" />Ojora kk'avaar p'Edom umyia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:15">opoma kk'achonạng p'Moab ọnwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:15">Ẹfa kk'akkemkpa p'Kenaan ẹsa;<verse eid="EXO 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 15:16" />opoma ọttạra ojora f'ididen ọnwa bẹ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:16">K'ẹfa chọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">abẹ ammunu k'ibyi rạnẹ masẹ ẹtakpa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:16">tạrr anạng pọ aseng afona, O Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">tạrr anạng p'kk'abhekha aseng afona.<verse eid="EXO 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 15:17" />M'atima bẹ anwa ma, abạra attima bẹ arạnga k'okpecho kwọ oyeni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:17">O Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, k'ibyi s'atim asi ibyirukhasẹ sọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:17">k'awurada-chọhm kw'atim mbọhk sọ asi.<verse eid="EXO 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 15:18" />Ẹvaar ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'ininga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:18">tạrr ipimmanitor.”<verse eid="EXO 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 15:19" />Masẹ nnyạnyaang s'Phero ọttạra ijaar sẹ s'nnyạnyaang n'itwạr, ọttạra ayaar-nnyạnyaang pẹ anwa k'asi, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi asi p'ẹraaga-diden anwa akpora bẹ. Okhenka, usi anạng p'Israẹl aseng k'isisek ajakha k'ottemkwẹ kw'ọraanga. <verse eid="EXO 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 15:20" />Ma wọ, Miriyam kw'uwa ode usi-ẹyaakha kw'Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ọbạra ode nwọkka kw'Aarọn, ọtạk ibin ikhirachẹ, utima ipanạng p'Israẹl eden abẹ akhir mbin, abạra atubh. <verse eid="EXO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 15:21" />Miriam ọkkọhn ẹmạng ọnạng bẹ, ọbẹ́</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:21">“Akkọhn ẹmạng anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:21">ukwuru ekhema-bạrada chẹ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:21">ẹma k'ẹnyạnyaang ọttạra ọyaar-ẹnyạnyaang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:21">udira otem k'ẹraangadiden.”<verse eid="EXO 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asi p'ajobh-ojobhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 15:22" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs utim anạng p'Israẹl eden abẹ abina arik Ẹraanga-khora, afona k'ibyi s'owor k'Shur. Abẹ asi osenga k'iwu ittaan ma ibyi s'owor, abẹ asi násia. <verse eid="EXO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 15:23" />Masẹ abẹ akpir k'Mara, abẹ asi p'Mara kákke agwo, ukwuru s'apyẹ ejobh-ojobhu. Ẹgwọ usi wa abẹ ayeri ibyi nnọ Mara (kw'uyini ejobhu). <verse eid="EXO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 15:24" />Ma wọ, anạng p'Israẹl ammọhnọ anạng Mosẹs, aben bẹ́, “M'angwo mbạng o?”<verse eid="EXO 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 15:25" />Mạnna wọ Mosẹs ọgạma ọkpẹkhẹ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, Ubinọkpaabyi utibh-ẹ uchinwa, kw'Mosẹs udwung ọbhạrẹ k'asi. Asi p'ajobh-ojobhu n'abhạkhẹ arebh-orebh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 15:25">Ma Mara wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạngẹ anạng p'Israẹl inyina ọttạra ntọhna k'oche kw'abẹ m'aruk atena, ọbạra ọnạng bẹ eyoma, ọfha ose de abẹ m'akke inyina chẹ achok.<verse eid="EXO 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 15:26" />Oben bẹ́, “Ode abạnga m'atạkha okpe akhọhmọ amma Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga itọhng, abạnga asi idik s'itor-otor k'akhaam k'achen, abạnga achok nnyina saam, abạnga abạra ator nden saam phyi-phyibh, amma ọkhạnkhạmọ wạnọ-wạnọ kw'nnạng anạng p'Ijip bạnga mạ́nnạng, ukwuru bẹ́, amma wọ nde Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi nwọ kw'n'ogwengi bạnga ikhạmana.”<verse eid="EXO 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 15:27" />Ma wọ, anạng p'Israẹl abin k'Mara afona k'Ẹlim, k'ibyi s'mfhobh jobh-kamfa aning, ọttạra k'arạngji arạbh attaan ukuma jobh. Wa anạng p'Israẹl abhingi abaanga mfhobh nnọ.<verse eid="EXO 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EXO 16" />
  <para style="s">Uchiattọhk f'mana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 16:1" />Wa k'iwu chi s'ophye kw'ottong afa, s'anạng p'Israẹl kk'abina k'Ijip, abẹma phyibh abin osenga k'Ẹlim akpira k'ibyi s'owor k'Sin, s'ining k'ngekha kw'Elim ọttạra Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 16:2" />Ma ibyi nnọ s'owor rọ s'efhonfhạr ch'Israẹl ẹmmọhnọ ẹnạng Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn. <verse eid="EXO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 16:3" />Anạng p'Israẹl aben bẹ bẹ́, “Wạra ujibhi ọtạm bẹ́, ampe k'mbọhk s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'Ijip, k'ibyi s'n'anninga ẹyạr anchi nten, ọttạra ichiakpo k'ukhira-k'ukhira oche kw'ọdaakhẹ mạna. Mantọmma, abạnga kk'mạna atima akwu ma ibyi sowor bẹ́, okwo ọfhọ ayokhanạng mba phyibh.”<verse eid="EXO 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 16:4" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Amma m'ntọhm brẹd kw'm'otebh masẹ ọrạngkpang nnạng bạnga. Anạng mbọ m'ayin k'iyaan k'iwu chidede ata akpokhu f'm'obenga bẹ. M'nsenga ma eden njọ nyoma bẹ, ọfha nse de abẹ m'ator k'ntọhna saam. <verse eid="EXO 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 16:5" />Ottong iwu isajạnẹ, abẹ m'akpokhu brẹd nwọ ikpe ifa, ọyọhnga oche kw'abẹ n'attotto akpokhu k'iwu nnọkha.” <verse eid="EXO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 16:6" />Ma wọ Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn abeni anạng p'Israẹl phyi-phyibh bẹ́, “Ma k'ẹchọhkha, abạnga m'asong-osonga bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi wọ utima bạnga ubina k'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 16:7" />Abạnga m'abạra ase abạrada p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ose k'ekpebha, ukwuru bẹ́, kk'immạmmọhnọ s'abạnga ammọhnọ anạng-ẹ ọbhaanga. Amạna mba ande bạng anạng, p'abạnga mnasi immạmmọhnọ anạng?” <verse eid="EXO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 16:8" />Mosẹs ọbạra oben bẹ́, “Abạnga m'asong-osonga bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi wọ n'ọnạng bạnga nten s'abạnga n'achi k'ẹchọhkha, ọttạra brẹd kw'abạnga aroru kw'abạnga m'achi k'ekpebha, ukwuru bẹ́, kk'immạmmọhno s'abạnga ammọhnọ anạng-ẹ ọbhaanga. Amạna mba oyeni ande bạng anạng? Amạna mba sạ́ng p'abạnga n'ammọhnọ anạng ẹ, abạnga n'ammọhnọ anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.” <verse eid="EXO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 16:9" />Ma wọ Mosẹs obeni Aarọn bẹ́, “Kpaak efhonfhạr ch'Israẹl phyi-phyibh bẹ́, abẹ akwu abe k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ukwuru bẹ́, kk'immạmmọhnọ sabẹ ọbhaanga.<verse eid="EXO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 16:10" />Masẹ Aarọn n'ọkpaak efhonfhạr ch'Israẹl phyi-phybh idik nnọ, abẹ abhạkhẹ akkeri k'ibyi s'owor, abẹ ase abạrada p'Ubinọkpaabyi p'ayini k'ebona.<verse eid="EXO 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 16:11" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 16:12" />“Amma kk'immạmmọhnọ s'anạng p'Israẹl mmaanga. Kpaak bẹ bẹ́, ‘K'ẹchọhkha abạnga m'achi nten, k'ekpebha abạnga m'achi brẹd adọhbh. Ma wọ abạnga m'asonga bẹ́, amma wọ nde Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga.” <verse eid="EXO 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 16:13" />Ma k'ẹchọhkha, ọnọhn f'ẹkpa uyin k'ọsaabh tạrr ufu ibyibhingasẹ sabẹ <char style="it">bẹ́ ttạbh</char>. Ukwu ukpira k'ekpebha, ebona ẹsạkha ẹfhạrọ ibyibhingasẹ sabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 16:14" />Masẹ ebona njọ kk'idima, ekpo masẹ afhạfhọ iyin ibubha isek s'owor. <verse eid="EXO 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 16:15" />Masẹ anạng p'Israẹl ase pyẹ, apyẹ bẹ nẹ́ttaana, abẹ n'abạbhọ ayok bẹ́, “Bạng ọttọhk khira vọ ma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 16:15">Mosẹs oben bẹ bẹ́, “Uchiattọhk f'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạngẹ bạnga bẹ́, abạnga achi vọ mạma e.” <verse eid="EXO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 16:16" />Maa wọ ode ntọhna s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ọnạnga bẹ́, “Ọnạng-ọnạng m'okpokhu pyẹ oche kw'm'obeng-ẹ. Ọnạng-ọnạng m'okpokhu okpobhumbọhk otor k'ubhik f'anạng p'ukkira kwẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 16:17" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl asi oche kw'abẹ atọhnọ bẹ. Ayok bạnọ akpokhu k'ọsaabh, bạnọ akpokhu avapẹ. <verse eid="EXO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 16:18" />Masẹ abẹ n'ayom k'akpobhumbọhk, abẹ n'ase bẹ́, ayok p'akpokhu k'ọsaabh abẹ k'idaam nákpokha. Ayok p'abạra akpokhu avapẹ abẹ sạsạkhẹ nábạra akpokha. Ọnạng-ọnạng okpokhu oche kw'm'obeng-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 16:19" />Ma o, Mosẹs oben bẹ bẹ́, “Ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ nạngẹ uchiattọhk mvọ ochokhu tạrr iwu echobha.”<verse eid="EXO 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 16:20" />Okhenka, ayok bạnọ ntọhna s'Mosẹs nátạkha. Abẹ achokhu uchiattọhk mvọ tạrr iwu echobha. K'ekpebhachẹ, apfẹ ọmaang, ọnwa nsiri, ọbạra osohm. Ettem ẹkhạmọ Mosẹs otena anạng p'Israẹl k'usisi kwabẹ.<verse eid="EXO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 16:21" />K'ekpebhawu chidede, ọnạng-ọnạng okpokhu oche kw'm'obeng-ẹ; okhenka, de ekkekhạra ẹkhạmọ, f'abẹ akpokhu arik kk'osonna phyibh.<verse eid="EXO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 16:22" />Ottong iwu isajạnẹ, abẹ m'akpokhu akpobhumbọhk afa p'uchiattọhk. Adecho p'Israẹl phyibh abina ata akpaak Mosẹs. <verse eid="EXO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 16:23" />Mosẹs oben bẹ bẹ́, “Maa wọ ode ntọhna s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạngẹ bẹ́, ‘Uphyini m'ode ẹyọhngkwokhawu, ẹyọhngkwokhawu ch'awurada ẹnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Abạm uchiattọhk fidede f'abạnga ọbạm, awọhn fidede f'abạnga m'awọhn. Achok fidede f'urikhi tạrr ukpira k'ekpebha.” <verse eid="EXO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 16:24" />Mạnna wọ abẹ asi oche kw'Mosẹs ọtọhnọ bẹ, abẹ achok f'urikhi tạrr iwu echobha, apfẹ nósoma, nsiri nọ́bra ọnwa. <verse eid="EXO 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 16:25" />Mosẹs oben bẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga achi pfẹ chemma, ukwuru bẹ́, chemma ode ẹyọhngkwokhawu ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi; vạnọ-vạnọ k'isek chemma abạnga máse e. <verse eid="EXO 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 16:26" />Abạnga m'akpokhu pfẹ k'iwu isajạnẹ, okhenka, ottong iwu isenọfa, kw'ode ẹyọhngkwokhawu vạnọ-vạnọ múninga.”<verse eid="EXO 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 16:27" />Tạrr oseng ma, wa ayok bạnọ ayini k'iyaan bẹ́, abẹ ata akpokhu uchiattọhk ma iwu njọ ch'ettong isenọfa, abẹ ubuma násia.<verse eid="EXO 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 16:28" />Osenga ma, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Okpe m'ubhir utuma yạn kw'abạnga m'afhum nnyina saam, ọttạra ntọhna saam chuchokh o?” <verse eid="EXO 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 16:29" />Ajima bẹ́, Ọvaar ubinọkpaabyi kk'bạnga ẹyongkwokhawu ọnạnga, ẹgwọ usi ottong iwu isajạnẹ, n'ọnạng bạnga brẹd kw'iwu ifa. Ottong iwu isenọfa, ọnạng-ọnạng uninga k'ibyi s'uning, nạngẹ k'iyaan uyini.” <verse eid="EXO 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 16:30" />Ma o, anạng mbọ akwokha ọyọhng k'iwu ch'ettong isenọfa.<verse eid="EXO 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 16:31" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl ayeri brẹd nwọ Mana. Wa awẹ uwuru masẹ ichimạma ch'koriyanda, ọbạra orebh masẹ abukpa p'abẹ atim ana p'ọkhọhn asi. <verse eid="EXO 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 16:32" />Mosẹs oben bẹ́, “Maa wọ ode ntọhna s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ‘Akpokhu okpobhumbọhk kw'Mana achok igbọ s'kwạna m'ikwu, ọfha abẹ ase brẹd kw'uwa nnạngẹ bạnga achi k'ibyi s'owor, s'ntim bạnga mbina k'Ijip.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 16:33" />Mosẹs oben Aarọn bẹ́, “Yoma okpobhumbọhk kw'Mana ge k'isibin ẹtaanga, atạkha achok k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, uninga utik igbọ s'oro.” <verse eid="EXO 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 16:34" />Aarọn usi oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs ọtọhna, ọtạk isibin njọ obera k'ititikha s'Ikwukwur s'Echekha, ọfha ininga ma. <verse eid="EXO 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 16:35" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl achi Mana k'icho arạbh afa tạrr abẹ akpira k'ibyi s'anạng arukhu. Abẹ achi mana tạrr abẹ akpira k'erem ch'Kenaan.<verse eid="EXO 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 16:36" />Omer ode okpobhumbọhk wạnọ k'akpobhumbọhk jobh p'asi Ẹpha, kw'ode ẹgbangbangdim.<verse eid="EXO 16:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EXO 17" />
  <para style="s">Asi ayini k'ẹtakpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 17:1" />Wa efhonfhạr ch'Israẹl phyi-phyibh ibin k'ibyi s'owor s'Sin, isenga k'ifhon-k'ifhon oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhnọ bẹ. Abẹ asi ibyibhingasẹ sabẹ k'Rẹphidim, okhenka, wa asi p'anạng mbọ m'agwo káde. <verse eid="EXO 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 17:2" />Osenga ma, abẹ atima ẹkhọhr ator Mosẹs, aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Nạng mạna asi angwo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 17:2">Mosẹs ubhina bẹ bẹ́, “Ukwuru yạn kw'abạnga n'atta abamẹ o? Ode yạn kw'abạnga n'ayoma Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi o?”<verse eid="EXO 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 17:3" />Okhenka, wa asi adaakhẹ anạng mbọ tạrr abẹ ammọhnọ anạng Mosẹs, aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ukwuru yạn kw'atima mạna ọttạra iva pamạna, ọttạra itirakpo pyamạna abina k'Ijip, ankwu ampe ma k'isi-daakha o?”<verse eid="EXO 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 17:4" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs ọgạm ọkpẹkhẹ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben bẹ́, “Ma, m'nsi anạng mba yạn o? Abẹ k'ifor adia sabẹ m'atọbh-m ata e.” <verse eid="EXO 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 17:5" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ubhina Mosẹs bẹ́, “Chi anạng mbọ eden. Tima adecho bạnọ p'Israẹl, atạkha uchikwura nwọ kw'atim avun k'ọraanga kw'Nile, sọhng. <verse eid="EXO 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 17:6" />Amma m'mbọ-ọ k'ititikha k'ẹtakpa ch'Horẹb. Vun uchikwura nwọ ma ẹtakpa njọ, asi m'ayin-uyin k'oche kw'anạng mbọ m'agwo.” Ma wọ, wa Mosẹs usi oche ngwọ k'ititikha s'adecho p'Israẹl. <verse eid="EXO 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 17:7" />Wa Mosẹs oyeri ibyi nnọ Masa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Masa k'eHiburu uyini Eyoma.</char></note> ọttạra Mẹriba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mẹriba k'eHiburu uyini Ẹtta, akkaam-chichi.</char></note>, ukwuru bẹ́, ma wọ kw'anạng p'Israẹl atta Mosẹs abẹ, abạra ayoma Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, aben bẹ́, “Ma, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi uning mạna abẹ sa a, mạna abẹ núninga?”<verse eid="EXO 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anạng p'Israẹl akhem anạng p'Amalẹk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 17:8" />Wa anạng p'Amalẹk arim anạng p'Israẹl abẹ k'Rẹphidim. <verse eid="EXO 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 17:9" />Mosẹs oben Joshua bẹ́, “Tekha ajunung bạnọ p'm'atima arima anạng p'Amalẹk abẹ. Uphyini m'mbe k'okpecho k'ẹrạng, ọttạra uchikwura kw'Ubinọkpaabyi k'ọbọhk kwaam.” <verse eid="EXO 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 17:10" />Ma wọ, Joshua urim anạng p'Amalẹk abẹ, oche kw'Mosẹs kk'ẹfa ọnạnga. Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn ọttạra Hur afon ata abe k'okpecho k'ẹrạng. <verse eid="EXO 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 17:11" />Okpe kwidede kw'Mosẹs udir mbọhk k'ẹrạng, anạng p'Israẹl akhema, de ọsạk mbọhk, anạng p'Amalẹk akhema. <verse eid="EXO 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 17:12" />Okpe kw'mbọhk ikwokhu Mosẹs, abẹ adira ẹta achokh-ẹ uninga ẹyạr. Aarọn ọttạra Hur avạkha mbọhk s'Mosẹs atima k'ẹrạng, ọnạng-ọnạng ọbọhk kwẹ. Wa mbọhk nnọ itọhk oche ngwọ-ngwọ tạrr iwu ẹsa. <verse eid="EXO 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 17:13" />Ma wọ, Joshua utim ọkkangkkang-kkro okhema akpongnạng p'Amalẹk.<verse eid="EXO 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 17:14" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kkẹr idik nna k'nnwẹr, ode udik-ujimakwẹ. Ọbaan bẹ́, Joshua ọbhaanga kwẹ, ukwuru bẹ́, m'ndimi eche ch'Amalẹk k'ọyagbin phyi-phyibh.”<verse eid="EXO 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 17:15" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs usi ijabyi, oyeri sẹ, “Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi wọ ode Okhema kwaam.” <verse eid="EXO 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 17:16" />Oben bẹ́, “Ukwuru sabẹ adir mbọhk k'ẹrạng atena ẹvaarchi ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi uning, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'urima anạng p'Amalẹk abẹ k'igbọ-k'igbọ.”<verse eid="EXO 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EXO 18" />
  <para style="s">Jẹtro udibhi Mosẹs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 18:1" />Wa Jẹtro kw'ode ọfọhnẹja kw'Midiyan, kw'ọbạra ode otte-ofhon-ikwa kw'Mosẹs, ọbhaang idik phyi-phyibh s'Ubinọkpaabyi kk'usia ọnạng Mosẹs ọttạra anạng p'Israẹl, ọttạra oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'osenga ọrạbha anạng p'Israẹl k'Ijip.<verse eid="EXO 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 18:2" />Masẹ Mosẹs kk'ikwanạng kwẹ, Zipọra ọtọhma bẹ́, ọta ibhinga k'otte Jẹtro, wa otte ọtạkh-ẹ, <verse eid="EXO 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 18:3" />ọttạra iva pẹ ncho mfa. Wa okpe oyok wạnọ Gẹrshọm, oben bẹ́, “Amma kk'ukhikhennạng ndia k'anạng k'ofhon.” <verse eid="EXO 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 18:4" />Okpe oyok nwọkha Eliyeza, ukwu oben bẹ́, “Ubinọkpaabyi kw'otte kwaam okpobh, wọ wa ode ọkkaan-m. Ẹma wọ ọkkaan-m, ọrạbh-m k'ọkkangkkang-kkro kw'Phero.”<verse eid="EXO 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 18:5" />Wa Jẹtro, kw'ode otte-ofhon-ikwa kw'Mosẹs, utim iva mbọ afa, ọttạra ikwanạng kw'Mosẹs ọta okhebha Mosẹs k'ibyi s'owor, s'uwa ubhingi ọbaanga okpecho kw'Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 18:6" />N'ode s'Jẹtro kk'ẹkkaabha ọtọhma ọnạng Mosẹs bẹ́, “Amma Jẹtro, kw'ode otte-ofhon-ikwa kwọ, nkwuma ikwanạng kwọ abẹ, ọttạra ajunungva pẹ afa bẹ́, nkwu nkhebh-ọ e.”<verse eid="EXO 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 18:7" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs ukhubhu ọta okhebha bẹ kha eden, utwunga echo k'ikpukpobha, ọbaakha otte-ofhon-ikwa kwẹ. Abẹ asima ayok, brasẹ abẹ n'anwa k'ukkira. <verse eid="EXO 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 18:8" />Mosẹs ọkpaak otte-ofhon-ikwa idik phyi-phyibh s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Phero ọttạra anạng p'Ijip usia ukwuru anạng p'Israẹl. Ọbạra ọkpaakh-ẹ irem-khira sabẹ kk'asia k'eden <char style="it">bẹ́ phyibh</char>, ọttạra oche kw'Ovaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'bẹ ọkkaana.<verse eid="EXO 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 18:9" />Wa ettem erebhi Jẹtro k'idik-jibhada phyi-phyibh s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'usia, ọrạbha anạng p'Israẹl k'mbọhk s'anạng p'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 18:10" />Oben bẹ́, “Ẹtọhnga iyim ẹnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ọrạbhọ bạnga k'mbọhk s'anạng p'Ijip, ọttạra s'Phero, kw'ọbạra ọrạbha anạng mbọ k'mbọhk s'anạng p'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 18:11" />Amma kk'nsonga k'udik ọkka bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọbạrẹ ọyọhnga fidede f'ayokhanạng n'akpobha, s'usi udik ngwa utima otor anạng p'age ifor asi Israẹl igbaan.” <verse eid="EXO 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 18:12" />Ma wọ Jẹtro kw'ode otte-ofhon-ikwa kw'Mosẹs, ọtạk ẹnạnga-ẹkkạmachẹ, ọttạra nnạnga idwạkh-ọdwạk ọnạng Ubinọkpaabyi. Wa Aarọn ọbạra utima adennạng p'Israẹl phyibh, ọta uchi ọttọhk ọttạra otte-ofhon-ikwa kw'Mosẹs k'ititikha s'Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 18:13" />Masẹ iwu n'echobh, Mosẹs ọta uninga ẹyạr bẹ́, usi aponga p'anạng mbọ. Anạng mbọ abaabh-ẹ age ngekha, tạma k'ekpebha tạrr ukpira k'ẹchọhkha. <verse eid="EXO 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 18:14" />Masẹ otte-ofhon-ikwa ose idik nnọ phyibh s'Mosẹs n'usi ọnạng anạng mbọ, n'ọbạbhọ bẹ́, “Bạng ọtọhm-khira vọ n'asi anạng anạng mba ma o? Mbạng vọ usi ọma mạnkkeni n'asi aponga, s'anạng mba phyibh n'abaabh-ọ age ngekha tạma k'ekpebha kpira k'ẹchọhkha o?”<verse eid="EXO 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 18:15" />Mosẹs ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Ukwuru s'anạng n'akwu akhebh-m bẹ́, ntekhi bẹ ẹkka ch'Ubinọkpaabyi otena bẹ e. <verse eid="EXO 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 18:16" />Okpe kwidede kw'abẹ akhaam ẹkhọhr, abẹ n'atima akwu akhebh-m bẹ́, nttọhnọ nnạng bẹ, mbạra mkpaak bẹ akpebhi, ọttạra nnyina s'Ubinọkpaabyi.”<verse eid="EXO 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 18:17" />Ọnyẹ kw'Mosẹs n'ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Nọ́baana bẹ́, asi oche ngwọ. <verse eid="EXO 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 18:18" />Ọma ọttạra anạng mba p'n'akwu akhebh-ọ maa m'ugima ọkhọhn bạnga e. Ọtọhm mva ọbạrẹ ọyọhng-ọ, pfẹ mạnkkeni mákke asi e. <verse eid="EXO 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 18:19" />Khọhm-m itọhng k'ntọhna s'm'nnạng-ọ. Tte Ubinọkpaabyi uninga abọ. Ọma abaan bẹ́, atera echo ch'anạng mba, abạra atima nkhọhr sabẹ ayin Ubinọkpaabyi k'ititikha. <verse eid="EXO 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 18:20" />Kpebhi bẹ akpebhi mbọ, ọttạra nnyina nnọ, abạra atọhn bẹ oche kw'ọbaan bẹ́ abẹ aruk, ọttạra ibọhktọhm s'ibaan-ọbaana bẹ́ abẹ asi. <verse eid="EXO 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 18:21" />Okhenka, tekha ajunung p'abaan-ọbaana k'ikhaana s'anạng mbọ phyibh, ajunung p'akhaam ojora f'Ubinọkpaabyi, p'ẹmmaana chabẹ etor-otor, p'nạn itwukha nárora, asi bẹ adecho p'ayok, k'nnọhna-k'nnọhna, ọttạra arạbh k'asen-k'asen, ọttạra arạbh afa ukuma jobh, ọttạra k'ajobh-k'ajobh. <verse eid="EXO 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 18:22" />Tte abẹ n'asi aponga p'anạng mba k'okpe idede. Tte abẹ atima aponga p'idede p'akpọhkh-ọkpọhkhọ akken-ọ, tte abẹ akhenka akpaara aponga p'isạsạkhẹ kabẹ ifhor. Ma wọ, ọtọhm m'obhekh-ọ de abẹ ator-ọ ọtọhm. <verse eid="EXO 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 18:23" />Ode asi ukhira ngwọ, ọttạra oche kw'Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhn-ọ, m'akke akwẹ okke, anạng mba phyibh n'abạra abhạna k'ottennebh.”<verse eid="EXO 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 18:24" />Ma wọ Mosẹs ọkhọmọ ọnnyẹ kwẹ itọhng, usi ukhira kw'ọtọhn-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 18:25" />Mosẹs otekha ajunung p'abaan-ọbaana k'ikhaana s'anạng p'Israẹl phyibh, ukwu usi bẹ acho p'anạng mbọ k'ikhaana s'nnọhna k'nnọhna, ọttạra s'arạbh k'asen k'asen, ọttạra s'arạbh afa ukuma jobh, ọttạra s'jobh k'ajobh. <verse eid="EXO 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 18:26" />Anạng mbọ bọ n'ade asi-aponga p'ayok k'okpe kwidede. Aponga p'akpọhkh-ọkpọhkhọ abẹ atạkha akkena Mosẹs, p'amạm-ọmạm, abẹma aponga.<verse eid="EXO 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 18:27" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs ọta urik otte-ofhon-ikwa kha eden. Jẹtro ọbhạna kakhẹ ẹkhạma.<verse eid="EXO 18:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EXO 19" />
  <para style="s">K'okpecho kw'Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 19:1" />K'ophye kw'ottong attaan, s'anạng p'Israẹl kk'abina k'Ijip, abẹ akpir k'ibyi s'owor kha Sinai ma iwu njọ jạnẹ. <verse eid="EXO 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 19:2" />Masẹ abẹ abin k'Rẹphidim, abẹ asengi akpira k'ibyi s'owor kha Sinai. Wa anạng p'Israẹl abhingi ma, k'ititikha s'okpecho nwọ.<verse eid="EXO 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 19:3" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs uvura ọta okhebha Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ukwu oyer-ẹ k'okpecho oben bẹ́, “Keri udik kw'm'akpaak iva p'iva p'Jekọb, ọttạra anạng p'Israẹl: <verse eid="EXO 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 19:4" />‘Abạngama oyeni kk'idik asia s'nsi anạng p'Ijip, ọttạra oche kw'ndir bạnga mkpẹ kakhaam k'ifor, masẹ itingi idir iva pẹ k'abạbaang, ntima nkwu k'ibyi saam oyeni. <verse eid="EXO 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 19:5" />Ma wọ, de abạnga asạk echo k'ettem ibunguchẹ, abạnga abạra achok echekha chaam, abạnga m'ade anạng p'amma nchokhu ettem k'ikhaana s'idifhon phyibh, ọbạra ode bẹ́, ọyagbin phyibh ọkhaam amma. <verse eid="EXO 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 19:6" />Abạnga m'ade-m idifhon s'afọhn-nja ọttạra ofhon kw'awurada. Ẹkkaabha ch'm'akpaak anạng p'Israẹl jọ ma.”<verse eid="EXO 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 19:7" />Ma wọ Mosẹs ọkpa nnạm ukwu otobha adennạng p'anạng mbọ, ọtạkha idik s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kẹ-ẹ ọtọhna bẹ́ ọkpaak, ọkpaak bẹ <char style="it">bẹ phyibh.</char> <verse eid="EXO 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 19:8" />Anạng mbọ phyibh n'abhin k'okpe gwạnọ bẹ́, “M'ansi udik kwidede usi k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ọkpaakha.” Ma wọ, Mosẹs ọkpa nnạm ọta ọkpaak Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ẹpọhna chabẹ.<verse eid="EXO 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 19:9" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Amma m'nsạkha ntor-ọ k'ebona ch'ipyi <char style="it">bẹ́ kkạạng,</char> ọfha anạng mbọ abhaang-m s'm'mkpaak abọ idik, ọfha abẹ n'achera udik kwọ k'okpe kwidede.” Ma wọ, Mosẹs n'ọkpaakhẹ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ẹpọhna ch'anạng p'Israẹl kk'anạnga.<verse eid="EXO 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 19:10" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kpa nnạm ata akhebha anạng mbọ, m'asi abẹ achok ifor sabẹ iwur chemma ọttạra uphyini. Tte abẹ akpobhu ekpo igiapẹ pyabẹ, <verse eid="EXO 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 19:11" />abẹ ado ifor sabẹ atik iwu ch'ettong ittaan, ukwuru bẹ́, ma iwu njọ ch'ettong ittaan jọ ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'ọsạkha k'okpecho kw'Sinai, k'ukhubha kw'anạng phyibh m'ase-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 19:12" />Ọma ge erem baabha okpecho nwọ, abạra akpaak bẹ bẹ́, ‘Atik ifor sabạnga, ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ nạngẹ okpecho nwọ uvur o, brasẹ n'ukpir kw'm'utwu ammakpa pẹ ọbọhk. K'udik ọkka, ọnạng kwidede kw'utwu ọbọhk ma okpecho nwọ, abẹ m'afhẹ-ẹ ọfhọ. <verse eid="EXO 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 19:13" />Abẹ m'atọhbh-ẹ ata, oyongu ma abẹ akhum-ẹ akhọhn, tte abẹ nạngẹ ọbọhk avunu. Ode oyokhanạng o, ọbạra ode eten o, abẹ nạ́ng-ẹ ọbọhk atte uruk akpen.’ Okpe kw'abẹ age inyisa tạrr eden ibhir, ma wọ abẹ m'asenga afora okpecho nwọ.”<verse eid="EXO 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 19:14" />Ma wọ, masẹ Mosẹs ọsạk k'okpecho nwọ, ukwu usi anạng mbọ awur, abẹ abạra akpobhu ekpo igiapẹ py'abẹ. <verse eid="EXO 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 19:15" />N'obeni bẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga ado ifor atik iwu njọ ch'ettong ittaan. Abạnga nạ́ngẹ ayok abẹ ayim o.”<verse eid="EXO 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 19:16" />K'ekpebha ch'iwu ch'ettong ittaan, ẹbhaangkpon ẹtta, ẹbạra ẹmạnẹ, ebona ch'ipyi <char style="it">bẹ kkạạng</char> ibubh okpecho k'erạng-ẹrạng, inyisa ege k'erạng-k'ẹrạng <char style="it">bẹ́ popopoobh,</char> ojora ọvạkha ọnạng kwidede kw'uning ma ibyibhingasẹ. <verse eid="EXO 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 19:17" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs utim anạng mbọ ubina k'ibyibhingasẹ, abẹ ata akhebha Ubinọkpaabyi, abẹ abe k'ekpecho isekhisek. <verse eid="EXO 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 19:18" />Isusong ibubha okpecho kw'Sinai, ukwuru s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọsạk ma okpecho nwọ masẹ ekpon. Isusong nnọ ivura masẹ akpondaak okpecho nwọ kubungu n'onyengi ipyibh-iphyibha. <verse eid="EXO 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 19:19" />Ẹmạng ch'inyisa ẹkhaangkẹ ẹt-ọta. Ma wọ, Mosẹs ọkpaakhẹ udik, Ubinọkpaabyi utima ẹbhaangkpon ọpọhn-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 19:20" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọsạkha k'okpecho kw'Sinai k'ẹrạng-ẹrạng, oyeri Mosẹs bẹ́ uvura okhebh-ẹ kha. Ma o, Mosẹs uvura. <verse eid="EXO 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 19:21" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Sạkha ata atwạr anạng mbọ itọhng, ọfha abẹ nạngẹ erem ajek, bẹ́, abẹ akwu ase Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ọfha anạng saabhada nạ́ngẹ ape. <verse eid="EXO 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 19:22" />Ọbạra afọhnẹja p'n'afora Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bọ, abẹ m'agba achok ifor sabẹ iwur-uwur, deja Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'ọnạng bẹ irem.”<verse eid="EXO 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 19:23" />Mosẹs obeni Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Anạng mbọ okpecho kw'Sinai máfora e, ukwuru bẹ́ ọmoyeni wọ atwạr mạna itọhng bẹ́, ‘Ge erem baabha okpecho nwọ, achok wẹ uwur-uwur.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 19:24" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Sạkha ata atima Aarọn akwu. Okhenka, afọhnẹja ọttạra anạng mbọkha, abẹ nạ́ngẹ yuyom ayom bẹ́, abẹ avur akhebha Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, deja m'ọnạngẹ bẹ irem.”<verse eid="EXO 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 19:25" />Ma wọ Mosẹs ọsạk okhebha anạng mbọ, otek bẹ oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni.<verse eid="EXO 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EXO 20" />
  <para style="s">Nnyina jobh s'Ubinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 5:1-21">Deutẹrọnọmi 5.1-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 20:1" />Ma wọ, Ubinọkpaabyi ọkpaakhẹ idik nna, oben bẹ́:<verse eid="EXO 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 20:2" />“Amma wọ nde Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga, kw'utim bạnga ubina k'Ijip, k'isek s'ibira.<verse eid="EXO 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 20:3" />“Abạnga ọkha ọdwạkh-ọdwạk kákpobha, oyonga amma.<verse eid="EXO 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 20:4" />“Abạnga ọkpata kágwa kw'okheri ọttọhk fidede f'uning k'ẹrạng, ọbạra ode f'uning k'isek, ọttạra f'uning k'asi ẹtaanga. <verse eid="EXO 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 20:5" />Abạnga echo kátwunga anạng akpatava mbọ, abạnga pyẹ kábạra akpobha, ukwuru bẹ́, amma Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'nde Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga, nde Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ọkhaam ottemma, kw'n'ọnạng iva irem k'mpyibha s'ab'otte, tạrr ukpira mgbọmma nttaan, ọttạra mgbọmma nnebung k'anạng p'awun-m. <verse eid="EXO 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 20:6" />Okhenka, mgbọmma nnọ ibhikh-asong s'ikhaam abamẹ idạdaakha, s'n'ibạra ichok nnyina saam, m'nkhọhkha bẹ idạdaakha.<verse eid="EXO 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 20:7" />“Abạnga eche ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga k'innukhuden kátima, ukwuru bẹ́, ọnạng kw'utim eche chẹ k'innukhuden múbina ọnạng.<verse eid="EXO 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 20:8" />“Ajima Ẹyọhngkwokha-wu, abạnga achok chẹ masẹ awuradawu anạng Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 20:9" />Atima iwu isajạnẹ asi itọhm sabạnga phyibh, <verse eid="EXO 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 20:10" />okhenka, iwu njọ ch'ettong iwu isenọfa, ẹjọ ch'ede ẹyọhngkwokhawu ch'ikpukpobha, ẹnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga. Ma iwu njọ, ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ, ọbạra ọma wọ, ọbạra ode ujunungnwa kwọ, ode ọkwanạng-nwa kwọ, ode ọtọhmnạng kwọ kw'ujunung, ode kw'ikwanạng, ode itirakpo pyabạnga, ọbạra ode ukhikhennạng kw'urukhu k'ifhon sabạnga, nạ́ngẹ ọtọhm usi. <verse eid="EXO 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 20:11" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi utim iwu isajạnẹ usi ẹrạng ọttạra isek, ọttạra ẹraangadiden, ọttạra ekpo phyi-phyibh py'ining k'ẹtaanga kwabẹ. Okhenka, okwok oyọhng s'ottong iwu isenọfa. Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi odo Ẹyọhngkwokhawu njọ, ochok chẹ masẹ awuradawu.<verse eid="EXO 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 20:12" />“Akpobha ab'atte ọttạra abakka, ọfha abạnga aruk akpen p'adum-udum k'isisek s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga ọnạngẹ bạnga.<verse eid="EXO 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 20:13" />Abạnga ọnạng káfhọ.<verse eid="EXO 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 20:14" />“Abạnga ọtta kátạm.<verse eid="EXO 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 20:15" />“Abạnga uribh káfu.<verse eid="EXO 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 20:16" />“Abạnga nttẹnsẹ kw'afhạra kábe.<verse eid="EXO 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 20:17" />“Abạnga ichọhm s'ayok, ọttạra ipanạng p'ayok, ọbạra ode ọtọhmnạng kwẹ kw'ujunung, ọbạra ode kw'ikwanạng, ode ẹbhaam chẹ, ode ẹnyạnyaang, tạrr oseng k'ọttọhk f'idede f'oyok ọkhaam, k'ẹfa kátạkha.”<verse eid="EXO 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 20:18" />Masẹ anạng mbọ ase s'ẹbhaangkpon n'ẹmạnẹ, ẹbạra ẹtta itum, abẹ abhaanga s'inyisa ege, abẹ abạra ase s'okpecho n'ode isusong-isusong, ojora ọvạkha bẹ, abẹ n'afhạnọ <char style="it">bẹ tikhi-tikhi-tikhi.</char> Ma wọ, abẹ abe eden-ibhir, <verse eid="EXO 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 20:19" />aben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Ọma oyeni ma ifor sọ kpaak udik nạngẹ mạna, khiri m'ankhọhm-ọ itọhng ọkhọmọ. Okhenka, Ubinọkpaabyi ọbọhk kátte ọkpaak mạna udik, deja kk'ampua.”<verse eid="EXO 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 20:20" />Mosẹs oben anạng mbọ bẹ́, “Nạngẹ bạnga ojor. Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ukwua bẹ́, ukwu oyoma bạnga, ọfha abạnga akhaama ojora fẹ, f'm'usi bạnga arạbh arik ipyibha.”<verse eid="EXO 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 20:21" />Anạng mbọ abe eden-ibhir, Mosẹs mạnkkeni osenga ọbaanga ebona ch'ipyi <char style="it">bẹ́ kkạạng,</char> k'ibyi s'Ubinọkpaabyi uning.<verse eid="EXO 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnyina s'iten k'akpatava ọttạra ijabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 20:22" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kpaak anạng p'Israẹl bẹ́, ‘Abạnga kk'asia k'abạnga oyeni k'ifor bẹ́, amma kk'nninga k'erạng mkpaak bạnga abẹ. <verse eid="EXO 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 20:23" />Abạnga asilva ọttạra agol kátima agwa akha p'abạnga m'akpobha attạra kakhaam.<verse eid="EXO 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 20:24" />“Abạnga atima adọhngọ asi ijabyi, abạnga afọhnọ nja ikkạmasẹ ma, ọttạra nnạnga s'ẹmẹm, ọttạra s'arạkhạmaan, ọttạra s'mvu, ọttạra s'mmaam s'abạnga m'anạng-m. Ibyi sidede s'nsi bẹ́, ide ikpukpobhabyi s'eche chaam, amma m'nsạkha nkwu nkhebha bạnga ma, mbạra ndo bạnga. <verse eid="EXO 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 20:25" />De m'atima ata asi ijabyi anạng-m, ata p'abẹ ado-odo kátima, ukwuru bẹ́, de atim ata p'abẹ ado-odo, kk'sẹ akhibha. <verse eid="EXO 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 20:26" />Abạnga k'ibyạrẹ-mfhok kásenga avura k'ijabyi saam atena ẹrạng-ẹrạng, ọfha abạnga nạngẹ sẹ irinikhum chabạnga akhọhk.”<verse eid="EXO 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EXO 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 21:1" />Maa wọ ode nnyina s'm'anạng anạng p'Israẹl:<verse eid="EXO 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnyina s'abira p'aHiburu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 21:2" />“Ode adebhi ubira kw'ode uHiburu-nạng, m'usi abọ ọtọhm k'icho isajạnẹ. Ottong icho isenọfa, m'ọnnaanga ibira, ọttọhk vạnọ-vạnọ mọ́nạng. <verse eid="EXO 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 21:3" />Ode ukwu mạnkkeni, m'ọkpa nnạm mạnkkeni; okhenka, de ukwu ikwanạng kwẹ abẹ, m'ọbhạna ikwanạng kwẹ abẹ. <verse eid="EXO 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 21:4" />Ode aro kwẹ ọnạng-ẹ ubira kwẹ wạnọ kw'ikwanạng bẹ́, ọtạkha, de ọmaan-ẹ ajunungva, ọbạra ode apanạngva, ikwanạng nwọ ọttạra iva pẹ m'ade p'aro kwẹ, ujunung nwọ mạnkkeni wọ m'ọbhạna.<verse eid="EXO 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 21:5" />“Okhenka, de ubira nwọ ọkpaakhẹ akwẹ ọttaanẹ bẹ́, ‘Amma aro kwaam ọttạra ikwanạng kwaam ọttạra iva paam adaakh-m ọdaak ro, amma khaam nọ́daakha bẹ́, nnaanga ibira e,’ <verse eid="EXO 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 21:6" />aro kwẹ m'utim-ẹ okhebha Ubinọkpaabyi. M'obe-ẹ k'ẹttọhmma, ọbạra ode k'ẹkpọmmachi, utima ijum udwu-ẹ itọhng. Ma wọ, ubira nwọ n'ode kwẹ k'akpen pẹ phyibh.<verse eid="EXO 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 21:7" />“De ọnạng ọtạk ọkwanạng-nwa kwẹ okpe k'ibira, uminanwa nwọ oche kw'adikkobh n'abhạna mọ́bhạna <verse eid="EXO 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 21:8" />De uminanwa nwọ nạn aro kwẹ idik nọ́daakha, m'utti-ẹ ọbọhk abẹ abhekh-ẹ k'ibira. Aro kwẹ ẹfa kọ́khaam bẹ́, ukpẹ-ẹ ọnạng akhikhennạng, ukwuru bẹ́, ẹma aro nwọ kwẹ echekha ch'ọnạngẹ ubira nwọ nóchokha. <verse eid="EXO 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 21:9" />De ọtạk uminanwa nwọ ọnạng ujunungnwa kwẹ, ọbaan bẹ utim-ẹ masẹ ọkwanạng-nwa kwẹ oyeni. <verse eid="EXO 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 21:10" />De ọbạra ọtạkha ikwanạng ọdwạkh-ọdwạk, ọbaan bẹ́, ọnạng ocheden-kwanạng uchiattọhk, ọttạra ekpo py'ifor, ọbạra ọttạr-ẹ iyima. <verse eid="EXO 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 21:11" />De nạn ikwanạng nwọ ekpo mbyọ ẹttaan nọ́nạnga, ikwanạng nwọ ọbaan bẹ́, ọbhạna k'ọphyaam, akpokha mútima obhek ẹnnaanga chẹ.<verse eid="EXO 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnyina s'avun oyok asi ọttọhk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 21:12" />“Ọnạng kwidede kw'uvunu oyok ọfhọ, abẹ m'agba afhọ ẹma. <verse eid="EXO 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 21:13" />Okhenka, de nạn khẹ k'ẹyaakha nọ́fha, s'akwẹ ode bẹ́, Ubinọkpaabyi wọ otte kwẹ ọbọhk uyin, tte ọrạbh ọta uttubha k'ibyi s'm'ntekha. <verse eid="EXO 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 21:14" />Okhenka, de ọnạng ọfhọ oyok k'ẹyaakha, abạnga atim-ẹ abina arik ijabyi saam, ata afhẹ-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 21:15" />“Ọnạng kwidede kw'ọfhọ otte, ọbạra ode ọkka, ọbaan bẹ́, abẹ afhẹ-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 21:16" />“Ọnạng kwidede kw'ufu oyokhanạng, ọbạra ode bẹ́, ukpẹ-ẹ okpe, ọbạra ode bẹ́, abẹ akhebh-ẹ ọttạra ọnạng nwọ k'mbọhk, ọbaan bẹ́, abẹ afhẹ-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 21:17" />“Ọnạng kwidede kw'ọsaakhẹ otte, ọbạra ode ọkka, ọbaan bẹ́, abẹ afhẹ-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 21:18" />De anạng afa atta ẹtta, oyok wạnọ ọtọbh oyok ẹta, ọbạra ode bẹ́, uvun-ẹ ibọhkdwuk, oyok núpua, okhenka uyima ọkhạmana, <verse eid="EXO 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 21:19" />ẹma nwọ kw'uvunu oyok ibọhkdwuk abẹ khẹ irem mánạng, de oyok ọnnaang ibọhkdwuk nnọ, ọtạkha uchikwura kwẹ okhonga osenga, ẹma nwọ kw'uvunu oyok m'ọmmạnga akpokha ọnạng oyok k'okpe kw'kk'oyok ukhibha, ọbạra okkerẹ-ẹ tạrr ifor ikpọhkh-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 21:20" />“Ode ọnạng utim ichi uvun ubira-junung, ọbạra ode ubira-kwanạng kwẹ tạrr ope kakhẹ-ẹ k'mbọhk, ọbaan bẹ́, abẹ anạng ọnạng nwọ irem. <verse eid="EXO 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 21:21" />Okhenka, de ubira nwọ ọnnaang nkwur nnọ k'iwu jạnẹ, ọbạra ode k'iwu ifa, ọkhaam-ubira nwọ, abẹ khẹ irem mánạng, ukwuru bẹ́, ubira nwọ ode akpokha pẹ.<verse eid="EXO 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 21:22" />“De ajunung afa arim irima, abẹ apạnnẹ avun ikwanạng kw'utim ifhạr ọttọhk, ifhạr nnọ isenga ma iyin s'okpe kwẹ nạn tạm obenga, ọttọhk ọbạr-ọbạr abẹ námuma, ọnạng kw'ọjẹ udik ngwọ m'utwuk ọttọhk fidede f'udim kw'ikwanạng nwọ ọkpaar, kw'esobh ẹbạra echera ẹnạng-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 21:23" />Okhenka, de abẹ amum ikwanạng nwọ ọttọhk f'ọbạr-ọbạr, m'atima akpen atera akpen, <verse eid="EXO 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 21:24" />de udwu-ẹ ichen, adwu-ẹ ichen, de ọrạbh-ẹ ẹsa, arạbh-ẹ ẹsa, de ọkpaar-ẹ ọbọhk, akpaar-ẹ ọbọhk, de ọkpaar-ẹ ofhok, akpaar-ẹ ofhok, <verse eid="EXO 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 21:25" />de ọkkạm-ẹ ekpon, akkạm-ẹ ekpon, de usi-ẹ ebhena, asi-ẹ ebhena, de obor-ẹ upfhurakpakpa, abor-ẹ upfhurakpakpa.<verse eid="EXO 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 21:26" />“De ọnạng uvunu ubira-junung, ọbạra ode ubira-kwanạng kwẹ ọttọhk udwu-ẹ ichen, ọbaan bẹ́, otte ubira nwọ ọbọhk ọbhạna k'ọphyaam, ukwuru ichen sẹ. <verse eid="EXO 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 21:27" />De ọnạng uvunu ubira-junung, ọbạra ode ubira-kwanạng kwẹ, ọrạbh-ẹ ẹsa, ọbaan bẹ́, otte ubira nwọ ọbọhk ọbhạna k'ọphyaam, ukwuru ẹsa chẹ.<verse eid="EXO 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 21:28" />“De ẹbhaam-dim ikhumu ọnạng abhik tạrr ope, ode ujunung, ọbạra ode ikwanạng, ọbaan bẹ́, abẹ atọbh chẹ ata tạrr achẹ epe, tte ọnạng nạngẹ eten chẹ uchi. Okhenka, oyeni kw'ọkhaam ẹbhaam-dim njọ ofhoru mọ́tạkha. <verse eid="EXO 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 21:29" />Okhenka, de ẹbhaamdim njọ kk'anạng abhik ikhuma-khuma, abẹ atwạr oyeni itọhng, ukuma chẹ vạvạkha tạrr achẹ ẹta ẹfhọ ujunung ọbạra ode ikwanạng, ọbaan bẹ abẹ atọbh chẹ ata tạrr achẹ epe, tte abẹ abạra afhọ oyeni. <verse eid="EXO 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 21:30" />Ma wọ, de abẹ akpaar ntwukha anạng-ẹ, ọbaan bẹ́, utwuk fidede f'abẹ akpaar anạng-ẹ, ọfha utima obhek akpen pẹ. <verse eid="EXO 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 21:31" />Inyina nja ẹbạra ede ukhira ngwọ gwạnọ, de ẹbhaamdim ikhumu ujunungnwa, oseng uminanwa, ẹfhẹ-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 21:32" />De ẹbhaamdim njọ ikhumu ubira-junung ọbạra ode ubira-kwanạng, ọkhaam ẹbhaamdim njọ ọbaan bẹ́, ọnạng ọkhaam-ubira ashẹkẹl ẹrạbh ukuma jọbh p'asilva, ọbaan adạkhẹ bẹ́, abẹ atima ata afhọ ẹbhaamdim njọ.<verse eid="EXO 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 21:33" />“De ọnạng utumu ipekhuma otto eje, ode ẹbhaam, ọbạra ode bẹ́, ẹnyạnyaang jọ etto k'ẹtaanga, <verse eid="EXO 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 21:34" />ọbaan bẹ́, ọnạng kw'utumu ipekhuma nnọ utwuk akpokha ọnạng oyeni kw'ọkhaam ẹnyạnyaang, ẹma bạra ọtạkha ọnyạnyaang-bukhu.<verse eid="EXO 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 21:35" />“De ẹbhaamdim ch'ọnạng isi ẹbhaamdim ch'ọnạng ọdwạkh-ọdwạk ọttọhk, achẹ ikwu epe, abẹma mbọ anạng afa m'akpe ẹbhaamdim ch'ining akpen, akhebh akpokha, abẹ abạra akhebh ẹbhaam-bukhu ngwọ obengana. <verse eid="EXO 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 21:36" />Okhenka, de anạng asong bẹ́, ẹbhaam-dim njọ n'ekhọhng anạng khu-khum, bạra oyeni ukuma chẹ vạvạkha oge k'ọpa, m'utima ẹbhaam otera ẹbhaam, njọ ch'epope n'ede chẹ.<verse eid="EXO 21:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EXO 22" />
  <para style="s">Nnyina s'iten k'ẹkhaama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 22:1" />“De ọnạng ufu ẹbhaam, ọbạra ode ọrạkhạmaan, ọfhọ, ọbạra ode bẹ́, okpe chẹ okpe, m'utwuk mmaam nsen k'ẹbhaam jạnẹ, de ode ọrạkhạmaan, m'utwuk annebung k'ọrạkhạmaan wạnọ.<verse eid="EXO 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 22:2" />“De abẹ avạk uriribha s'n'ufu uribh k'irungu bạra abẹ avun-ẹ afhọ, ọnạng kw'ọfh-ẹ ofhoru kw'ẹnạng-fha mọ́tạkha. <verse eid="EXO 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 22:3" />Okhenka, de ọfhẹ-ẹ s'iwu kk'echobha, kk'uttia k'inyina ch'ẹnạngfha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:3">“Uriribha ọbaan bẹ́, urik ọttọhk fidede pf'ufhu, okhenka, de nạn ọttọhk ọkhaam, ọbaan bẹ́, abẹ akpẹ-ẹ atima atera ọttọhk pf'ufu.<verse eid="EXO 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 22:4" />“De abẹ ase eten ch'ufu k'mbọhk sẹ s'itim irukhu akpen, ode ẹnyạnyaang, ọbạra ode ọrạkhạmaan o, ọbaan bẹ́, utwuk chẹ k'ikpe ifa.<verse eid="EXO 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 22:5" />“De ọnạng utim itirakpo pyẹ bẹ́, ọta ọnạng uchiattọhk, ukwu otte pyẹ ọbọhk, ettena ẹta ichi owonu, ọbạra ode owonu kw'ọnạng kw'vine o, ọbaan bẹ́, utima ekpo ẹkkapyẹ p'ibin kakhẹ k'owonu kw'agrep utwuk.<verse eid="EXO 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 22:6" />“De ọnạng ukhumu erekpa chẹ, ekpon ẹyạma ejekha k'owonu kw'oyok, ẹta ẹkkạmọ ekpo py'utubhu, ọbạra ode py'ọphy-ọphya otobha, ọbạra ode bẹ́, ẹkpa ch'ọnạng nwọ ẹyạm kubungu, ọbaan bẹ́, ọnạng kw'oge ekpon njọ utwuk oyok ekpo pyẹ py'ẹkkạmọ.<verse eid="EXO 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 22:7" />“De ọnạng ọnạngẹ oyok akpokha, ọbạra ode ekpo ẹdwạkh-ọdwạk bẹ́, ochokh-ẹ, abẹ akhebha pyẹ ma ọchọhm kwẹ afu, abẹ avạkha uriribha nwọ, ọbaan bẹ́, uriribha nwọ utwuk pyẹ k'ikpe ifa. <verse eid="EXO 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 22:8" />Okhenka, de abẹ nạn uriribha nwọ násia, ọbaan bẹ́, oyeni-ọchọhm obe k'ititikha Ubinọkpaabyi ọkpaak de k'ekpo py'oyok ufua. <verse eid="EXO 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 22:9" />K'iponga phyi-phyibh s'iten k'uribh f'ẹbhaam ọttạra, f'ẹnyạnyaang, ọttạra f'ọrạkhạmaan, ọttạra f'ivạra, ọbạra ode ọttọhk fidede f'udim-udimi, f'ọnạng obeni bẹ́, “Ọttọhk pfaam vọ ma,” anạng mbọ afa m'atima iponga nnọ akkena Ubinọkpaabyi. Ọnạng kw'iponga ipyibhi, ọbaan bẹ́, utwuk ọttọhk mvọ ikpe ifa ọnạng oyok.<verse eid="EXO 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 22:10" />“De ọnạng utiri oyok ẹnyạnyaang, ọbạra ode ẹbhaam, ọbạra ode ọrạkhạmaan, ọbạra ode utirattọhk fidede, apfẹ ukwu ope, ọbạra ode bẹ́, abẹ amaamẹ pfẹ ọttọhk, ọbạra ode bẹ́, udim-udimi s'ọnạng nạn utum núgia, <verse eid="EXO 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 22:11" />abẹma anạng afa m'achekhi k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, iponga oyok nípyibha. Ọbaan bẹ́, oyeni ochera oche ngwọ, oyok dạk mútwuk. <verse eid="EXO 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 22:12" />Okhenka, de akwẹ ode bẹ́, abẹ afu utirattọhk mvọ k'oyok k'mbọhk, oyonga m'utwuk pfẹ ọnạng oyeni. <verse eid="EXO 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 22:13" />De ode bẹ́, ẹkpaten njọ ẹvạk utirattọhk mvọ ẹfhọ, ẹyaakhẹ k'akpa-k'akpa, ọbaan bẹ́, ọtạkha akpakpa p'eten njọ p'arikhi ọkhọhkha, dạkhẹ chẹ mútwuk.<verse eid="EXO 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 22:14" />“De ọnạng ọyaamẹ utirattọhk f'oyok, abẹ avun pfẹ asi ọttọhk, ọbạra ode bẹ́, apfẹ opope, s'oyeni nạn ode, ọbaan bẹ́, ọnạng kw'ọyaamẹ pfẹ utwuk ọnạng oyeni. <verse eid="EXO 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 22:15" />Okhenka, de oyeni kw'ọkhaam utirattọhk mvọ uning k'ininga okpe kw'udik ngwọ uyini, ọnạng kw'ọyaamẹ utirattọhk mvọ pfẹ mútwuk. De ọyaamẹ utirattọhk mvọ k'akpokha, akpokha p'utim ọyaam pfẹ m'atera utirattọhk mvọ f'udimi.<verse eid="EXO 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnyina s'iten k'oche kw'ayokhanạng m'aruk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 22:16" />“De ujunung ọbọhr uminanwa kw'nạn ujunung tạm nósonga uyima abẹ k'ẹfa, ọbaan bẹ́, usi iminakpo, bạra ode ikwanạng kwẹ. <verse eid="EXO 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 22:17" />De otte kw'uminanwa nwọ ufhumu wowong bẹ́, kẹ-ẹ nnwa kwẹ mọ́nạng k'ọbada, ọbaan bẹ́, ujunung nwọ usi iminakpo ọnạng uminanwa kw'nạn ujunung tạm nósonga.<verse eid="EXO 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 22:18" />“Abạnga ikwanạng kw'n'utima akpakpa-pyibha ọbọhra anạng, ọbọhk kkáte uruk akpen.<verse eid="EXO 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 22:19" />“Ọnạng kwidede kw'uyim eten abẹ, ọbaan bẹ́, abẹ afhẹ-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 22:20" />“Ọnạng kwidede kw'n'ọfọhnọ ẹja ọnạng ọkha fidede, ọyaang Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọjẹ, ọbaan bẹ́, abẹ afhẹ-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 22:21" />“Abạnga ukhikhennạng igbaan kási, abạnga khẹ irem kánạng, ukwuru bẹ́, wa abạnga agba ade akhikhennạng k'Ijip.<verse eid="EXO 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 22:22" />“Abạnga opokwa ọttạra upfunwa igbaan kási. <verse eid="EXO 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 22:23" />De abạnga asi bẹ igbaan, abẹ agạma ayer-m, k'udik ọkka, amma m'mmaanga ẹmạng chabẹ ọbhaanga. <verse eid="EXO 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 22:24" />M'nkọhkha idwạdwạkhọ saam, mbạra ntima ọkkangkkang-kkro mfhọ bạnga. Ipanạng pabạnga m'ade apokwa, iva pabạnga m'abạra ade apfuva.<verse eid="EXO 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 22:25" />“De abạnga afhoru ọnạng kwidede kw'ode kwaam, kw'ode ukpukpora, kw'uning bạnga abẹ akpokha, abạnga iru káge k'oche kw'anạng p'n'afhor anạng akpokha n'asi. <verse eid="EXO 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 22:26" />De ayaamẹ ivạra s'oyok-ọbaanga kwọ, rik sẹ brasẹ n'ukpir k'ẹchọhkha, <verse eid="EXO 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 22:27" />ukwuru bẹ́, ẹrọ mạnkkeni m'utima ububha ifor sẹ. De nạn sẹ nárikha, mbạng vọ n'abạra ububha uyima o? De ọgạm oyer-m, amma m'mmaang-ẹ ọbhaanga, ukwuru bẹ́, amma nkhaam ikwosi-ttem.<verse eid="EXO 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 22:28" />“Abạnga Ubinọkpaabyi kánnukhu. Abạnga ọnạng kw'ọdạbhẹ anạng pabạnga kásaakhẹ.<verse eid="EXO 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 22:29" />“Abạnga ẹnạnga ch'ọchọhm kw'uchiattọhk fabạnga, ọttạra ch'atwuk pabạnga kávạkha atima.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:29">“Ọbaan bẹ́, abạnga anạng-m achedenva pabạnga p'ade ajunung.<verse eid="EXO 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 22:30" />Oche ngwọ gwọ kw'abạnga m'asi k'mmaam ọttạra arạkhạmaan pabạnga. Tte apyẹ ininga ab'ọkka abẹ k'iwu isenọfa, okhenka, de ottong iwu isenọttaan, atạkha pyẹ akken-m.<verse eid="EXO 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 22:31" />“Abạnga m'ade anạng paam p'awur-uwur. Ma wọ, abạnga eten ch'nten s'ẹkpa ifhọ, iyaakhẹ k'ayaar-kayaar káchi, abạnga abhạrẹ chẹ anạng mpfa.<verse eid="EXO 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EXO 23" />
  <para style="s">Nnyina s'aponga-kpaara p'ator-otor ọttạra ikwosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 23:1" />“Afhạra k'nákpaak akpaanga. Ubyibyanạng káttạra abe nttẹnsẹ kw'afhạra.<verse eid="EXO 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 23:2" />“Ọsaabh kátwạn asi udik kw'nạn otora. Okpe kw'abe nttẹnsẹ k'osobhchọhm, ọsaabh k'asaana atima afhạra abhạkhẹ iponga. <verse eid="EXO 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 23:3" />Ukpukpora k'ichen kárạbh, abe-ẹ k'nnạm asi afhạra k'okpe kw'obe iponga sẹ.<verse eid="EXO 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 23:4" />“De ase ẹbhaam, ọbạra ode ẹnyạnyaang ch'ọwawunanạng kwọ ch'etten eden, ọbaan bẹ́, avạkha chẹ akkena oyeni. <verse eid="EXO 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 23:5" />De ase ẹnyạnyaang ch'ọwawunanạng kwọ etto ẹtọhkha achẹ, chẹ káseng arik; ọbaan bẹ́, akkaana chẹ oseng k'oyeni.<verse eid="EXO 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 23:6" />“Iponga s'ijibhi ukpukpora kávạkha abhạkhẹ k'esobh. <verse eid="EXO 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 23:7" />Ọnạng udik kábọhma. Ọnạng kw'mbọhk sẹ iwur-uwur ọttạra kw'ọkpaakhẹ udik ọkka káfhọ, khiri ọnạng kw'iponga ipyibhi ọbọhk mạ́ntte. <verse eid="EXO 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 23:8" />Ngwu kachi o, khiri ngwu n'ikpa ọnạng achen bẹ́, nạngẹ udik ọkka ose, ibạra ivạkha itọhnga s'ọnạng kw'otor-otor ibhạkhẹ.<verse eid="EXO 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 23:9" />“Abạnga ukhikhennạng irem kánạng o. Abạnga asong oche ma kw'ikhikhennạng ẹmma ikpira, s'uwa abạnga kk'akhikhennạng adia k'Ijip.<verse eid="EXO 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnyina s'ẹyọngkwokha-kpe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 23:10" />“Abạnga atubh iwonu k'icho isajạnẹ, abạnga abạra aphya ekpo p'abạnga atubhu. <verse eid="EXO 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 23:11" />Okhenka, ottong icho isenọfa, abạnga atte isisek ọbọhk itạm, abạnga ọttọhk vạnọ-vạnọ ma kási, fidede f'omeni ma m'ode uchiattọhk ọnạng akpukpora p'arukhu bạnga abẹ. Mkpaten m'ibạra ichi ekpo py'abẹ atạk arik. Abạnga m'asi ukhira ngwọ ọttạra iwonu s'abạnga s'agrep, ọttạra s'oliv.<verse eid="EXO 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 23:12" />“Abạnga asi ọtọhm k'iwu isajạnẹ, okhenka, ottong iwu isenọfa abạnga ọtọhm kási, ọfha mmaam sabạnga, ọttạra nnyạnyaang sabạnga ikwokha ọyọhng; ọttạra bẹ́, abira p'n'asi itọhm anạngẹ bạnga, ọttạra akhikhennạng, abạra annemi ifor.<verse eid="EXO 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 23:13" />“Abạnga atạkha okpe asi idik nna phyibh s'kk'bạnga mkpaakha. Abạnga ache p'akha káyeri; tte ọnạng nạngẹ ache p'akha mbọ bhạbhaang ọbhaang kạbạnga k'ẹmma.<verse eid="EXO 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnobha ntaan s'icho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 23:14" />“Nden nttaan k'icho kwidede, abạnga m'asi erobha ch'ottennebh anạng-m.<verse eid="EXO 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 23:15" />“Abạnga asi Erobha ch'Brẹd kw'abẹ nạn yist nágia, anạng-m. K'iwu isenọfa, abạnga m'achi brẹd kw'abẹ nạn yis nágia, koche kw'ntọhnọ bạnga. Abạnga asi erobha njọ k'okpe kw'ọbaan bẹ́, abạnga asi, k'ophye kw'Abib, ukwuru bẹ́, ma ophye nwọ wọ kw'uwa abạnga abin k'Ijip.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:15">“Ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ nạngẹ abọhk-kpakpa utim ukwu obe-m k'ititikha o.<verse eid="EXO 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 23:16" />“Abạnga m'asi Erobha ch'Iphya ọttạra acheden-chidwuk py'ekpo p'abạnga atubhu k'iwonu sabạnga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:16">“Abạnga m'asi Erobha njọ ch'iphya s'ikpong nnạm k'icho, k'okpe kw'abạnga kk'iphya s'iwonu sabạnga asia.<verse eid="EXO 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 23:17" />“Nden nttaan k'icho, ajunung phyi-phyibh m'ayin Aro Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'ititikha.<verse eid="EXO 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 23:18" />“Abạnga khaam isẹ s'ibin k'ẹjafọhnọ kánạng, ọttạra ọttọhk f'abẹ age yist.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:18">“Abạnga iyaak s'nnạnga saam s'erobhawu káchok tạrr iwu echobha.<verse eid="EXO 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 23:19" />“Abạnga atima acheden-chidwuk pyabạnga py'ede ẹkka-pẹ p'abạnga aphya k'iwonu sabạnga, akwu k'ọchọhm kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwạbạnga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:19">“Abạnga abasi p'ivu kátima awọhn uvunwa.<verse eid="EXO 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oseng-eden kw'Ubinọkpaabyi m'uchi bạnga eden</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 23:20" />“Kkeri e, amma m'ntọhm oseng-eden kwaam uchi bạnga eden, ọfha okkeri bạnga s'abạnga m'asenga k'eden tạrr abạnga akpira k'ibyi nnọ s'kk'ndia. <verse eid="EXO 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 23:21" />Abạnga akhọhm-ẹ itọhng, abạra asạkha echo anạng-ẹ. Abạnga khẹ udik kákhaanga o, khiri idik-kaanga chabạnga múbina ọnạng e, ukwuru bẹ́, eche chaam ining abẹ ma. <verse eid="EXO 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 23:22" />De abạnga atạk okpe akhọhmọ itọhng anạng-ẹ k'idik s'm'ọkpaak, abạnga abạra asi udik kwidede kw'mkpaakhẹ, amma m'nde ọwawunanạng kw'awawunanạng pabạnga, m'mbạra nnengi ifor saam k'anạng p'nạn bạnga abẹ nábua. <verse eid="EXO 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 23:23" />Oseng-eden kwaam m'uchi bạnga eden, m'utima bạnga ọnwa k'isek s'Amọr, ọttạra aHet, ọttạra aPẹriz, ọttạra aKenaan, ọttạra aHiv, ọttạra aJẹbus. M'dimi bẹ phyi-phyibh. <verse eid="EXO 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 23:24" />Abạnga echo kátwunga anạng akha pabẹ, abạnga pyẹ kákpobha. Abạnga usisi kwabẹ kábạra ator. Abạnga avọhkhọ akha mbọ pyabẹ, abhạkhẹ atwukh-utwukhu. <verse eid="EXO 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 23:25" />Abạnga akpobha amma Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'nde Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga. Amma m'ndo uchiattọhk fabạnga, ọttạra asi pabạnga. Amma m'nnengi ikhạmana k'ikhaana sabạnga mmạrẹ, <verse eid="EXO 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 23:26" />ikwanạng wạnọ-wạnọ kw'ifhạr m'iyin, kw'm'ọbạra ode ujidim k'isek sabạnga kóde. Amma m'nnạng bạnga akpen p'adum-udum.<verse eid="EXO 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 23:27" />“Amma m'ntọhm ojora faam uchi bạnga eden, mbạra nge ẹkhạma ch'irim bạnga abẹ k'dạmadạma. M'nsi awawunanạng pabạnga arạbh <char style="it">bẹ́ phyibh.</char> <verse eid="EXO 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 23:28" />M'ntọhm agbạrandwạng achi bạnga eden ẹta ikhubh aHiv, ọttạra aKenaan, ọttạra aHet k'abạnga k'ititikha. <verse eid="EXO 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 23:29" />Amma anạng mbọ k'cho gwạnọ mạ́nkubh, deja, isisek nnọ m'ide <char style="it">bẹ́ khạraang,</char> mkpaten m'ikwu isaabh iyọhnga bạnga. <verse eid="EXO 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 23:30" />Amma m'nkubh bẹ sạsạkhẹ-sạsạkhẹ tạrr ukpira k'okpe kw'abạnga kk'asaabha k'oche kw'abạnga m'atạkha isisek nnọ.<verse eid="EXO 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 23:31" />“Amma m'nge nnem sabạnga tạma k'Ẹraanga-khora tạrr ukpira k'Ẹraanga-diden ch'aPhilistiya, abạra atạma k'ibyi s'owor tạrr ukpira k'ọraanga kw'aYuphrates. M'ntte anạng p'arukhu ma isisek nnọ ọbọhk nnạng bạnga, abạnga akhubh bẹ atwukhọ ororo. <verse eid="EXO 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 23:32" />Abạnga echekha kátạkha anạng mbọ abẹ, ọttạra ikha sabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 23:33" />Abạnga bẹ ọbọhk kátte aruk k'isisek sabạnga, deja, abẹ m'asi bạnga asi ikhọngkwuru-dik k'akhaam k'ititikha, ukwuru bẹ́, k'udik ọkka, ekpobha ch'akha pabẹ m'ede ibyibyia ẹnạng abạnga ma.<verse eid="EXO 23:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EXO 24" />
  <para style="s1">Ẹyaakha ch'echekha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 24:1" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Tima Aarọn, ọttạra Nadab, ọttạra Abihu, ọttạra adecho arạbh attaan ukuma jobh p'Israẹl akwu. Abạnga aninga edenibhir akpobh-m. <verse eid="EXO 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 24:2" />Mosẹs mạnkkeni wọ m'osenga ọgbaara Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Ayok mbọkha nạngẹ fạfor-afor. Ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ nạngẹ Mosẹs abẹ ọttạra uvura okpecho o.”<verse eid="EXO 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 24:3" />Masẹ Mosẹs ofon ọta ọkpaak anạng p'Israẹl idik nnọ phyibh s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọkpaakhẹ, ọttạra nnyina sẹ, abẹ abhina okpe gwạnọ bẹ́, “M'ansi udik kwidede usi kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'obena e.” <verse eid="EXO 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 24:4" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs n'ọkkẹrẹ udik kwidede kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ọkpaakha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 24:4">Ubina k'ekpekpebha, usi ijabyi k'okpecho-rin, ọbạra ọtạkha mkpommachi s'ata jobh-kamfa ofo, s'iter mfonamma jobh-kamfa s'Israẹl.<verse eid="EXO 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 24:5" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs ọtọhmọ adikkobh p'Israẹl bẹ́, abẹ ata anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi nnạnga ikkạmasẹ, abẹ abạra atima abhaamva afọhnọ ẹja ch'ẹnạnga ch'ẹgbạkha anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 24:6" />Mosẹs ọtạk isẹ nnọ rạnẹ oge k'agbangbang, ọtạkha nnọkha owobhu k'ijabyi. <verse eid="EXO 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 24:7" />Ma wọ, ọtạk Nnwẹr s'Echekha oyeri ọnạng anạng p'Israẹl. Abẹ abhina bẹ́, “M'ansi udik kwidede usi kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'obena e. M'ansạkha echo ọsạkha annạng-ẹ e.”<verse eid="EXO 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 24:8" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs ọtạk isẹ nnọ owobhu anạng mbọ. Oben bẹ́, “Maa wọ ode isẹ s'echekha ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'bạnga abẹ ọkhaama, otor k'idik nna phyibh.”<verse eid="EXO 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 24:9" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn, ọttạra Nadab, ọttạra Abihu, ọttạra adecho arạbh attaan ukuma jobh p'Israẹl afon, <verse eid="EXO 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 24:10" />ata ase Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl. Ibyi s'ọbyạrẹ mfhok ide masẹ ọgbarẹ kw'abẹ atim ata p'saphiya asi, s'ittaanẹ masẹ ọrạngkpakpa. <verse eid="EXO 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 24:11" />Okhenka, Ubinọkpaabyi adecho mbọ p'Israẹl ipyibha núsia. Abẹ ase Ubinọkpaabyi, abẹ achi, abạra agwo.<verse eid="EXO 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 24:12" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi n'obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Ọma vura kwu k'okpecho, aninga ma. M'nnạng-ọ atakpa p'kk'nnyina ọttạra ntọhna nkkẹra, s'm'akpebhi bẹ.” <verse eid="EXO 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 24:13" />Ma o, Mosẹs ọttạra Joshua kw'n'otor-ẹ ọtọhm, afona. Mosẹs uvura k'okpecho kw'Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 24:14" />Mosẹs oben adecho mbọ bẹ́, “Abạnga aninga maa atik, tạrr amkpa nnạm. Aarọn ọttạra Hur m'aninga bạnga abẹ maa. Ọnạng kwidede kw'ọkhaam udik oyok abẹ, tte okhebha bẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 24:15" />Masẹ Mosẹs uvur k'okpecho nwọ, ebona ẹfhạrọ wẹ. <verse eid="EXO 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 24:16" />Abạrada p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi asạkha ma okpecho okpecho kw'Sinai. Ebona njọ ẹfhạrọ okpecho k'iwu isajạnẹ. Ottonga iwu isenọfa, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oyeri Mosẹs k'ebona ẹtaanga. <verse eid="EXO 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 24:17" />K'achen p'anạng p'Israẹl, abạrada p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'okpecho k'ẹrong, ade masẹ ekpon ẹkkạmọ ọttọhk tạrr apfẹ udimi. <verse eid="EXO 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 24:18" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs ọnwa k'ebona njọ ẹtaanga masẹ uvur k'okpecho. Wa uning ma iwu arạbh afa, ọttạra nnunguwu arạbh afa.<verse eid="EXO 24:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EXO 25" />
  <para style="s">Nnạnga s'ibyirukhasẹ s'Ubinọkpaabyi usi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 25:1" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 25:2" />“Kpaak anạng p'Israẹl bẹ́, ọnạng-ọnạng okken-m ẹnạnga. M'atạkha ẹnạnga njọ k'ọnạng kwidede kw'utwu-ẹ k'ettem bẹ́, ọnạng-m ẹnạnga. <verse eid="EXO 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 25:3" />Nnạnga s'm'atạkha kabẹ k'mbọhk ide: gol, ọttạra silva, ọttạra brons, <verse eid="EXO 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 25:4" />ọttạra ndikhi s'ide blu, ọttạra s'ikhoru ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhoru isisẹ, ọttara ndikhi iyokhasẹ ikkasẹ, ọttạra avu-phyạbha, <verse eid="EXO 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 25:5" />ọttạra atenkpa p'arạkhạmaan-dim sabẹ afokhu asi-khora, ọttạra atenkpa akkapẹ p'mvu, ọttạra mkpaakha s'akasiya; <verse eid="EXO 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 25:6" />ọttạra ana p'oliv p'attukkạng, ọttạra ekpo p'abẹ n'atima asi ana p'abẹ n'abyenga anạng k'echo, ọttạra insẹns; <verse eid="EXO 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 25:7" />ọttạra ata p'oniks, ọttạra ata akkapẹ adwạkh-ọdwạk p'abẹ n'akpạna k'ẹphọd<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ẹphọd ede inọhma-khuma s'ọfọhn-ẹja, s'ikhaam abọhk-khuma p'aren k'nkkaang, ọttạra udikhikpa, ọttạra ata akkapẹ p'abẹ atim adokha mbọhk sẹ k'nkkaang.</char></note>, ọttạra ẹvạrakpa ch'ittemmạma.<verse eid="EXO 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 25:8" />“Tte abẹ asi irukhabyi s'awurada anạng-m, ọfha osenga ma, nnukh bẹ abẹ. <verse eid="EXO 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 25:9" />Si ibyirukhasẹ nna, ọttạra ekpo pyidede p'm'atima asi asẹ inyạnẹ, ide obengana k'ukhira kw'nkọkh-ọ.<verse eid="EXO 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikwukwur s'Echekha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 25:10" />“Tte abẹ atima mkpaakha s'akasiya asi ikwukwur s'adum pẹ ade ntwạkhọ nttaan ọmaana akpamma sọnajobh, ẹkpa chẹ ede ntwạkhọ mfa ọmaana akpamma attaan, ebe chẹ ede ntwạkhọ mfa ọmaana akpamma attaan. <verse eid="EXO 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 25:11" />Tima gol ọkkọkka fhạrọ sẹ k'ẹtaanga ọttạra k'iyaan, abạra atima gol afhạrọ ammakpabem pẹ abaabha. <verse eid="EXO 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 25:12" />Tima gol rạbha ariringi annebung ge k'ntwạkhọ nnebung s'ikwukwur nnọ, ẹfa k'ukhubha gwạnọ, ẹfa k'ukhubha ngwọkha. <verse eid="EXO 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 25:13" />Tima mkpaakha s'akasiya si nsemachi, atima gol afhạrọ sẹ. <verse eid="EXO 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 25:14" />Ge nsemachi nnọ k'ariringi p'abem p'ikwukwur nnọ, p'abẹ m'avạkha adira sẹ. <verse eid="EXO 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 25:15" />Nsemachi nnọ m'ininga ma ariringi p'ikwukwur nnọ; abạnga sẹ kárạbha. <verse eid="EXO 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 25:16" />Tạkha atakpa p'nnyina nnọ s'm'nnạng-ọ, yikha ma Ikwukwur nnọ s'Echekha.<verse eid="EXO 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 25:17" />“Bạra tima gol ọkkọkka rạbha ikwukwurkpa ch'ephyokhu. Adum pẹ m'ade ntwạkhọ nttaan ọmaana akpamma sọnajobh, ẹkpa chẹ m'ede ntwạkhọ mfa ọmaana akpamma attaan. <verse eid="EXO 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 25:18" />M'atima gol adwuk achẹrubim afa abera k'ikpicho kw'ikwukwurkpa njọ. <verse eid="EXO 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 25:19" />Chẹrub wạnọ m'uninga k'echo jạnẹ, nwọkha uninga k'echo njọkha. Si achẹrubim mbọ ọttạra ikwukwurkpa njọ agbạkha ayok, k'ncho mfa s'ikwukwur nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 25:20" />Tte achẹrubim mbọ akhaama abạbaang p'm'ẹmmaama k'ẹrang ibubha ikwukwurkpa s'ikwukwur nnọ. Tte achẹrubim mbọ akkeri ayok ititikha, tte apyẹ ekkeri k'ikwukwurkpa njọ. <verse eid="EXO 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 25:21" />Tạkha ikwukwurkpa njọ khubha k'ẹrạng-ẹrạng kw'Ikwukwur s'Echekha, atạkha nnyina s'm'nnạng-ọ age ma ẹtaanga. <verse eid="EXO 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 25:22" />Ma ẹrạng-ẹrạng kw'ikwukwurkpa njọ, ọttạra k'ottemkwẹ kw'achẹrubim mbọ p'aning k'ẹrạng-ẹrạng kw'Ikwukwur s'Echekha nnọ, wọ m'nkebh-ọ, mbạra nnạng-ọ nnyina phyi-phyibh s'm'anạng anạng p'Israẹl.<verse eid="EXO 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okpokkro kw'brẹd kw'Ubinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 25:23" />“Tima mkpaakha s'akasiya si okpokkro kw'adum pẹ ade ntwạkhọ nttaan, ẹkpa chẹ ede ẹtwạkhọ jạnẹ ọmaana akpamma asajạnẹ, ebe chẹ ede ntwạkhọ mfa ọttạra akpamma attaan. <verse eid="EXO 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 25:24" />Tima gol ọkkọkka fhạrọ wẹ, abạra atima gol adokha ammakpa pẹ abaabha. <verse eid="EXO 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 25:25" />M'abạra asi ammakpabem p'ẹkpa ebenga masẹ ẹbọhkpattem, atima gol afhạrọ pyẹ. <verse eid="EXO 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 25:26" />Tima gol si ariringi annebung p'okpokkro nwọ, akpạna pyẹ ma nnwyạnga nnebung s'okpokkạro nwọ, k'mfhok nnọ sẹ nnebung. <verse eid="EXO 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 25:27" />Ariringi mbọ m'aninga abaanga ma ammakpabem p'ikwukwur nnọ, p'm'avạkha nsemachi sabẹ m'atima adira okpokkro nwọ. <verse eid="EXO 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 25:28" />Tima mkpaakha s'akasiya asi nsemachi nnọ, atima gol afhạrọ sẹ, ọfha abẹ n'atima adira okpokkro nwọ. <verse eid="EXO 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 25:29" />Tima gol ọkkọkka asi agbang-gbang, ọttạra nsengakpa, ọttạra akkọbh, ọttạra akpobhu-mbọhk p'abạnga m'atima asi nnạnga ibyengasẹ. <verse eid="EXO 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 25:30" />Nạna brẹd kw'awurada ma okpokkro nwọ k'ititikha saam k'okpe kwidede.<verse eid="EXO 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itukkạng-chi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 25:31" />“Dwuk gol ọkkọkka atima asi itukkạng-chi. Ẹyạr chẹ, ọttạra abọhkha, ọttạra akkọbh, ọttạra agbo, ọttạra ayoyo pyẹ m'ade ichi njọ jạnẹ. <verse eid="EXO 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 25:32" />Abọhkha asajạne m'atọhnga k'ọkhaan-ọkhaan kw'itukkạng-chi, attaan m'aninga k'ukhubha gwạnọ, attaan aninga k'ukhubha ngwọkha. <verse eid="EXO 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 25:33" />Akkọbh attaan p'ade masẹ ayoyo p'almọn, ọttạra agbo, ọttạra ayoyo, m'aninga k'ẹbọhkha jạnẹ, attaan aninga k'ẹbọhkha ẹdwạkh-ọdwạk, abạra ade ukhira ngwọ gwạnọ ọttạra abọhkha mbọ asajạnẹ phyibh p'avạk k'itukkạng-chi njọ. <verse eid="EXO 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 25:34" />Itukkạng-chi njọ m'ẹkhaama akkọbh annebung p'ade masẹ ayoyo p'almọn ọttạra agbo, ọttạra ayoyo. <verse eid="EXO 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 25:35" />Ogbo wạnọ m'uninga k'isekh-isek kw'abọhkha-gbạkha p'acheden atọhnga ma itukkạng-chi njọ, ogbo kw'ottong afa m'ọbạra uninga k'isekh-isek kw'abọhkha-gbạkha p'attong afa, ottong agbo attaan m'uninga k'isekhisek kw'abọhkha-gbạkha p'attong attaan. Phyi-phyibh m'ode abọhkha asajạnẹ. <verse eid="EXO 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 25:36" />Agbo ọttạra abọhkha mbọ phyibh m'ade ichi njọ jạnẹ, ọttạra ma itukkạng-chi njọ ch'abẹ atim gol ọkkọkka adwuk.<verse eid="EXO 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 25:37" />“Ma o, si atukkạng asenọfa, anạna pyẹ ma itukkạng-chi njọ, ọfha apyẹ ẹnna k'ottemkwẹ kw'ititikha sẹ. <verse eid="EXO 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 25:38" />Tima gol ọkkọkka dwuk afamgba, ọttạra nsengakpa s'ekpon kkikkibhi. <verse eid="EXO 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 25:39" />Tima gol ọkkọkka si itukkạng-chi ch'adọbh pẹ ade talẹn wạnọ, ọttạra ekpo phyi-phyibh py'ẹttạr ma. <verse eid="EXO 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 25:40" />Songa bẹ́ m'asi ọttọhk fidede obengana k'oche kw'nkọkh-ọ k'okpecho o.<verse eid="EXO 25:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EXO 26" />
  <para style="s">Ibyirukhasẹ s'Ubinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 26:1" />“Tima ichọhmma-vạra jobh sabẹ atim ọvạra ọkkọkka ayok, ọttạra ndikhi s'ide blu, ọttạra s'ikhoru ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhoru isisẹ, ọttạra achẹrubim p'ommengkka-nạng usi, asi ibyirukhasẹ nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 26:2" />Ọvạra mvọ phyibh m'ode obengana, adum pabẹ m'ade ntwạkhọ arạbh afa ukuma mfa, ẹkpa chabẹ m'ede ntwạkhọ nsajạnẹ. <verse eid="EXO 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 26:3" />Tạkha ọvạra osen bọhra rạnẹ, abạra abọhra mvọkha osen ukhira ngwọ gwạnọ. <verse eid="EXO 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 26:4" />Si ager p'ade blu age k'ammakpa p'ivạra nnọ rạnẹ s'abọhr, abạra asi ukhira ngwọ gwạnọ k'nnọkha. <verse eid="EXO 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 26:5" />Si ager arạbh afa ukuma jobh age k'ichọmma-vạra rạnẹ, abạra asi ager arạbh-afa ukuma jobh age k'ivạra nnọkha. Tte ager mbọ akkeri ayok ititikha. <verse eid="EXO 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 26:6" />Ma wọ, m'atima gol asi mkpạkha arạbh afa ukuma jobh s'm'ivạkha ọvạra mvọ atima k'ibyi rạnẹ, ọfha ibyirukhasẹ nnọ ide ibyi rạnẹ.<verse eid="EXO 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 26:7" />“Tima avu-phyạbha si nchọmmavạra jobhkawạnọ, s'm'ide ikkira s'm'ibubha ibyirukhasẹ nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 26:8" />Tte ọvạra mvọ jobhkawunọ ode obengana. Tte afhẹ ode ntwạkhọ ẹrạbh ukuma nsen k'adum pẹ, ọttạra ntwạkhọ nsajạnẹ k'ẹkpa chẹ. <verse eid="EXO 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 26:9" />Bọhra ọvạra mvọ osen atima asi rạnẹ, abạra abọhra mvọkha ọsajạnẹ atima asi rạnẹ. Nwyạnga ivạra nnọma s'ọvạra ọsajạnẹ nden mfa k'ẹchọhmma k'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 26:10" />Si ager arạbh-afa ukuma jobh age k'ivạra rạnẹ s'abọhr, abạra age ager arạbh afa ukuma jobh k'ivạra nnọkha rạnẹ s'abọhr. <verse eid="EXO 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 26:11" />M'atima brons asi mkpạkha arạbh-afa ukuma jobh, age pyẹ k'ager mbọ, atima atọhnga ivạra nnọ, ọfha ẹvạkha ukkira ngwọ k'ibyi rạnẹ. <verse eid="EXO 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 26:12" />De n'ode k'adum p'attạr-ọttạra ma ọvạra f'ẹchọhmma f'ukkhira ngwọ, ikpokha s'ivạra s'ibekh-obek m'ilẹbhẹ ibubha k'ẹpannạm ch'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 26:13" />Adum p'ivạra s'ukkira nwọ m'ide ẹtwạkhọ jạnẹ ọmaana ikpokha k'ukhubha gwạnọ, ẹtwạkhọ jạnẹ ọmaana ikpokha k'ukhubha gwọkha. S'ibekh-obek m'ilẹbhẹ k'ukhubha kwidede, ọfha ibubha ibyirukhasẹ nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 26:14" />Tima atenkpa p'arạkhạmaan p'abẹ afokhu asi-khora bubha ukkira ngwọ, abạra atạkha atenkpa p'mvu abubha atenkpa p'arạkhạmaan mbọ k'erạng-ẹrạng.<verse eid="EXO 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 26:15" />“Tima mkpaakha s'akasiya asi mkpọmmachi s'ibobe k'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 26:16" />Tte ẹkpọmmachi chidede ede ntwạkhọ chi k'adum, ọttạra ntwạkhọ mfa ọmaana akpamma attaan k'ẹkpa chẹ, <verse eid="EXO 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 26:17" />ọttạra mfok mfa s'ide obengana, ibạra ikkeri ayok ititikha. Si mkpọmmachi nnọ phyi-phyibh s'ibyirukhasẹ m'ide ukhira ngwọ gwạnọ. <verse eid="EXO 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 26:18" />Si mkpọmmachi ẹrạbh k'ẹrạkh-ẹrạkha kw'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ, <verse eid="EXO 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 26:19" />abạra atima asilva asi nnạna arạbh afa age k'isekhisek kw'mkpọmmachi nnọ, nnạna mfa k'ẹkpọmmachi chidede, ẹnạna jạnẹ k'echo jạnẹ. <verse eid="EXO 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 26:20" />K'ukhubha kw'ibir-ibira kw'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ, si mkpọmmachi ẹrạbh, <verse eid="EXO 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 26:21" />ọttạra nnạna arạbh-afa s'asilva, nnạna mfa k'ẹkpọmmachi chidede. <verse eid="EXO 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 26:22" />Si mkpọmmachi nsajạnẹ k'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ tena k'ukhubha kw'ududon n'udimi, <verse eid="EXO 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 26:23" />abạra asi mkpọmmachi mfa k'nnwyạnga s'ẹrạkh-ẹrạkha s'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 26:24" />M'agbạkha mkpọmmachi nnọ mfa k'nnwyạnga s'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ, tạma k'irin tạrr ukpira k'acho pabẹ. Age pyẹ k'uriringi wạnọ; mbọ afa m'ade ukhira gwạnọ. <verse eid="EXO 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 26:25" />Ma wọ, mkpọmmachi nnọ m'ide mkpọmmachi nsenọttaan, ọttạra nnạna chikawạnọ s'asilva, nnạna mfa k'isekhisek kw'ẹkpọmmachi jạnẹ.<verse eid="EXO 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 26:26" />“M'abạra atima mkpaakha s'akasiya asi nsemachi. Si nsen s'mkpọmmachi k'ukhubha gwạnọ kw'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ, <verse eid="EXO 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 26:27" />abạra asi nsemachi nsen k'ukhubha ngwọkha, asi nsen k'ukhubha kw'ududon n'udimi, k'nnạm-nnạm kw'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 26:28" />Esemachi ch'ottemkwẹ m'ẹtạma k'echo jạnẹ ẹvạkha k'echo njọkha, k'ottemkwẹ kw'ẹkpọmmachi. <verse eid="EXO 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 26:29" />Tima gol afhạrọ mkpọmmachi nnọ, abạra atima gol asi ariringi, p'm'avạkha nsemachi nnọ, atima gol afhạrọ nsemachi nnọ.<verse eid="EXO 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 26:30" />“Mun ibyirukhasẹ nnọ tor k'oche kw'nkọkh-ọ k'okpecho.<verse eid="EXO 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 26:31" />“Tima ndikhi s'ide blu, ọttạra s'ikhor-ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhor-isisẹ, ọttạra ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok, ọttạra achẹrubim p'ommengkka-nạng usi. <verse eid="EXO 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 26:32" />Rena sẹ k'mkpạkha s'gol k'mkpọmmachi nnọ nnebung s'mkpaakha s'akasiya, atima gol afhạrọ sẹ, atạkha abera k'nnạna nnebung s'asilva. <verse eid="EXO 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 26:33" />Rena ivạra nnọ k'mkpạkha, atạkha Ikwukwur s'Echekha achok k'nnạm-nnạm kw'ivạra nnọ. Ivạra nnọ m'ibhaangẹ Ibyi s'Awurada k'Ibyi s'Awurada p'ayọhng Awurada. <verse eid="EXO 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 26:34" />M'achok ikwukwurkpa ch'ephyokhu k'Ikwukwur s'Echekha, k'ibyi s'Awurada p'ayọhng Awurada. <verse eid="EXO 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 26:35" />Bera okpokkro k'iyaan kw'ivạra nna, k'ẹrạng-ẹrạng kw'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ, abạra achok itukkạng-chi ekkeri wẹ ititikha k'ukhubha kw'ẹrạkh-ẹrạkha.<verse eid="EXO 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 26:36" />“N'ode ivạra s'ẹchọhmma k'ukkira nwọ, m'atima ndikhi s'ide blu, ọttạra s'ikhor-ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhor-isisẹ, ọttạra ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok, f'ode ọbọhktọhm f'odokh-ọvạra. <verse eid="EXO 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 26:37" />M'atima gol asi mkpạkha s'ivạra nnọ, ọttạra mkpọmmachi nsen s'mkpaakha s'akasiya, atima gol afhạrọ sẹ, bạrasẹ n'atim brons adwuk nnạna nsen sabẹ.<verse eid="EXO 26:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EXO 27" />
  <para style="s">Ijabyi s'ẹnạnga ẹkkạmachẹ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 27:1" />“Tima mkpaakha s'akasiya si ijabyi s'ikhaam akhubha annebung. Ebe chẹ m'ede ntwạkhọ nnebung ọmaana ibhaakha, adum pẹ ade ntwạkhọ nsenọfa ọmaana ibhaakha, ẹkpa chẹ ede ntwạkhọ nsenọfa ọmaana ibhaakha. <verse eid="EXO 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 27:2" />Gwa ubhik k'nnwyạnga nnọ nnebung, ọfha abhik mbọ ọttạra ijabyi nnọ ade ọttọhk mvọ vạnọ. Atima brons afhạro ijabyi nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 27:3" />Tima brons si ẹtọhmkpo pyẹ phyibh, py'ede: ọsọhkha f'itạtọhng kpukpokhu, ọttạra asọvẹl, ọttạra akpobhu-mbọhk, ọttạra agbumu p'akhaam asa, ọttạra nsenga. <verse eid="EXO 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 27:4" />Tima brons si itegba, atima brons asi ibunu, abạra atima brons asi ariringi annebung p'itegba nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 27:5" />Chok itegba nnọ k'isekhisek kw'ijabyi, ọfha ibunu nnọ ininga k'ibhaang-ifa s'ijabyi. <verse eid="EXO 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 27:6" />Tima mkpaakha s'akasiya si nsemachi s'ijabyi nnọ, abạra atima brons afhạrọ sẹ. <verse eid="EXO 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 27:7" />M'anọhma nsemachi nnọ ma ariringi mbọ, ọfha asẹ ininga k'akhubha mbọ afa p'ijabyi, k'okpe kw'abẹ m'adira. <verse eid="EXO 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 27:8" />Tima mkpaakhakpa si ijabyi nnọ itto eje. Si ator k'oche kw'uwa nkọhkh-ọ k'okpecho.<verse eid="EXO 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eterttem ch'ibyirukhasẹ s'Ubinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 27:9" />“Si eterttem ch'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ. Tima ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok si ichọhmma-vạra s'ide ntwạkhọ arạbh asenọfa ukuma jobh k'adum, akpạna sẹ k'ẹrạkh-ẹrạkha, <verse eid="EXO 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 27:10" />ọttạra mkpọmmachi ẹrạbh, ọttạra nnạna s'brons ẹrạbh, ọttạra mkpạkha s'asilva, ọttạra mvạrakpa s'mkpọmmachi. <verse eid="EXO 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 27:11" />Ukhubha kw'ibir-ibira m'ọbạra ode ntwạkhọ arạbh asenọfa ukuma jobh, m'ọkhaama mkpọmmachi ẹrạbh, ọttạra nnạna s'brons ẹrạbh, ọttạra mkpạkha s'asilva, ọttạra mvạrakpa s'm'ikpạna k'mkpọmmachi nnọ.<verse eid="EXO 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 27:12" />“Ukhubha kw'eterttem njọ kw'ududon n'udimi m'ode ntwạkhọ arạbh attaan ukuma chi k'adum, ọbạra ọkhaama ichọhmma-vạra, ọttạra mkpọmmachi jobh, ọttạra nnạna jobh. <verse eid="EXO 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 27:13" />Ukhubha kw'ududon n'uyin, adum pẹ m'ede ntwạkhọ arạbh attaan ukuma chi. <verse eid="EXO 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 27:14" />Adum p'ichọhmma-vạra m'ade ntwạkhọ ẹrạbh ukuma mfa ọmaana ibhaakha, asẹ m'ikpạna k'ukhubha gwạnọ k'ọmmakhubh, m'ikhaama mkpọmmachi nttaan, ọttạra nnạna nttaan. <verse eid="EXO 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 27:15" />Ichọhmma-vạra s'ide ntwạkhọ ẹrạbh ukuma mfa ọmaana ibhaakha k'adum, s'ikhaam mkpọmmachi nttaan ọttạra nnạna nttaan, m'ibạra ikpạna k'ukhubha ngwọkha.<verse eid="EXO 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 27:16" />“K'ọmmakhubh kw'eterttem, kpạna ichọhmma-vạra s'ide ntwạkhọ ẹrạbh ukuma jobh k'adum, asẹ m'ide blu, ọttạra s'ikhor-ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhor-isisẹ, ọttạra ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ oyokh-oyok, f'ode ọbọhktọhm f'odokh-ọvạra, ibạra ikhaama mkpọmmachi nnebung, ọttạra nnạna nnebung. <verse eid="EXO 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 27:17" />Mkpọmmachi phyi-phyibh s'ibaabh eterttem njọ m'ikhaama avạrakpa p'asilva, ọttạra mkpạkha, ọttạra nnạna s'brons. <verse eid="EXO 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 27:18" />Eterttem njọ m'ede ntwạkhọ arạbh asenọfa ukuma jobh k'adum, ọttạra ntwạkhọ arạbh attaan ukuma chi k'ẹkpa, m'ẹkhaama ichọhmma-vạra s'ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok s'igoru ikpira ntwạkhọ nsenọfa ọmaana ibhaakha, ọttạra nnạna s'brons. <verse eid="EXO 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 27:19" />Ẹtọhmkpo phyi-phyibh py'm'atima asi ibyirukhasẹ nnọ, ọtọhm fidede f'ẹtọhmkpo mbyọ, ọttạra abhik pẹ phyibh p'ukkira, ọttạra abhik p'eterttem njọ, phyi-phyibh m'ade brons.<verse eid="EXO 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana p'utukkạng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 27:20" />“Ben anạng p'Israẹl bẹ́, abẹ atima ana p'atto iyaan, py'abẹ amyạn k'achidwuk p'oliv py'n'ẹnạng ọyantaana, ọfha attukkạng n'ayeni k'okpe kw'idede. <verse eid="EXO 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 27:21" />K'ukkira kw'etobha, k'iyaan-iyaan kw'ivạra s'ining k'ititikha s'Ikwukwur s'Echekha, Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva pẹ m'ayeni attukkạng k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, tạma k'ẹchọhkha tạrr iwu echobha. Ntọhna nna ide s'anạng p'Israẹl tạrr ukpira k'igbọ s'm'immaana k'iwu oro.<verse eid="EXO 27:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EXO 28" />
  <para style="s">Nnya s'ọfọhn-ẹja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 28:1" />“Yeri nwakka Aarọn, ọttạra ajunungva pẹ p'ade Nadab, ọttạra Abihu, ọttạra Ẹleyaza, ọttạra Itamar k'ikhaana s'anạng p'Israẹl, ọfha abẹ asi ọtọhm f'afọhnẹja. <verse eid="EXO 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 28:2" />Bọhra nnya s'awurada nạng nwakka Aarọn, ọfha ọkhaama ikpukpobha ọttạra abạrada. <verse eid="EXO 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 28:3" />Ben ajunung phyibh p'asi emmengkka, p'kk'ekkoji ch'ọbọhkttọhm-dema mvọ nnạng bẹ́, abẹ abọhra Aarọn nnya k'ẹbọhk-nạna chẹ, ọfha usi ọttọhm f'ọfọhnẹja. <verse eid="EXO 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 28:4" />Maa wọ ode nnya sabẹ m'abọhra: ẹvạrakpa ch'ittemmạma, ọttạra ẹphọd, ọttạra ọkpaar-mbọhk, ọttạra ọnọhma-baba, ọttạra ẹvạrakpa ch'echo-dạdạbh, ọttạra udikhikpa kw'irin. Abẹ m'abọhra nnya nnọ s'awurada anạng nwakka Aarọn, ọttạra ajunungva pẹ, ọfha abẹ asi ọtọhm f'afọhnẹja. <verse eid="EXO 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 28:5" />Tte abẹ atima ndikhi s'gol, ọttạra s'ide blu, ọttạra s'ikhor-ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhor-isisẹ, ọttạra ndikhi ikkasẹ abọhra nnya nnọ.<verse eid="EXO 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ẹphọd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 28:6" />“Tte ommengkka-nạng utima ndikhi s'gol, ọttạra s'blu, ọttạra s'ikhor-ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhor-isisẹ, ọttạra ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok, ọbọhra ẹphọd. <verse eid="EXO 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 28:7" />Awẹ m'ọkhaama mvạrakpa mfa k'nkkang, p'abẹ m'abọhra amaana k'nnwyạnga sẹ mfa, ọfha asẹ ivạkha ayok. <verse eid="EXO 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 28:8" />Udikhikpa kwẹ kw'abẹ atim emengkka ayok m'ode ukhira ngwọ gwạnọ. Abẹ m'atima ndikhi s'gol ayok, ọttạra s'blu, ọttạra s'ikhor-ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhor-isisẹ, ọttạra ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok.<verse eid="EXO 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 28:9" />“Tạkha nta afa p'oniks, akkẹr ache p'iva p'Israẹl ma. <verse eid="EXO 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 28:10" />Kkẹr ache asajạnẹ k'ẹta jạnẹ, abạra akkẹr mbọkha asajạnẹ k'ẹta njọkha, kkẹr sẹ tor k'igbọ sabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 28:11" />Kkẹr ache p'iva p'Israẹl ma ata mbọ afa, k'oche kw'omengkkanạng n'ọkkẹr ọttọhk k'ata. Atạkha gol afhạrọ ammakpabem p'ata mbọ afa, <verse eid="EXO 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 28:12" />abạra atạkha sẹ akpa k'avạrakpa mbọ p'nkkang s'ẹphọd, ede masẹ ata p'ijima anạng iva p'Israẹl. Aarọn m'utima ache mbọ k'nkkang sẹ, ede masẹ ijima k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 28:13" />Bẹ gol abaabha ammakpabem p'ata mbọ afa, <verse eid="EXO 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 28:14" />ọttạra mgbakkọhbhọ mfa s'gol ọkkakwẹ masẹ idikhi, akpạna sẹ ma ata mbọ.<verse eid="EXO 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ẹvạrakpa ch'ittemmạma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 28:15" />“Bọhra ẹvạrakpa ch'ittemmạma ch'ẹkka ch'Ubinọkpaabyi ororu, f'ode ọbọhktọhm f'ommengkka-nạng. Tima ndikhi s'gol, ọttạra s'ide blu, ọttạra s'ikhor-ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhor-isisẹ, ọttạra ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok, abọhra chẹ masẹ ẹphọd. <verse eid="EXO 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 28:16" />Adum ọttạra ẹkpa chẹ m'ade obengana de ayom ẹbọhkpattem, abạra anwyạnga chẹ nden mfa. <verse eid="EXO 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 28:17" />Ge akhaana annebung kw'nta s'ijibh-ujibh ma. K'ọkhaana kw'ucheden, ge ẹta ch'ruby, ọttạra ch'topaz, ọttạra cha bẹryl <verse eid="EXO 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 28:18" />k'ọkhaana kw'otong afa, bẹ ẹta ch'tọkwọis, ọttạra ch'saphiya, ọttạra ch'ẹmẹral; <verse eid="EXO 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 28:19" />k'ọkhaana kw'ottong attaan, bẹ ẹta ch'jasin, ọttạra ch'agate, ọttạra ch'amẹtist, <verse eid="EXO 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 28:20" />k'ọkhaana kw'ottong annebung, bẹ ẹta ch'krisolita, ọttạra ch'oniks, ọttạra ch'jaspa. Bẹ gol afhạrọ ammakpabem p'ata mbọ. <verse eid="EXO 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 28:21" />Apyẹ m'ade ata jobh-kamfa, chidede m'ebe k'eche ch'ujunungnwa wạnọ kw'Israẹl. Kkẹr eche jạnẹ masẹ ẹkhọhkha k'ẹta chidede ch'm'ebe k'echo ch'mfonama chidede k'mfonama nnọ jobh-kamfa.<verse eid="EXO 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 28:22" />“Tima gol ọkkọkka kw'abẹ ayokhu masẹ idikhi si mgbakkọhbhọ akpạna ma ẹvạrakpa njọ ch'ittemmạma. <verse eid="EXO 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 28:23" />Tima gol si ariringi afa, akpa pyẹ ma nnwyạnga nnọ mfa s'ẹvạrakpa ch'ittemmạma.<verse eid="EXO 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 28:24" />Kpa mgbakkọhbhọ mvọ ọfa f'gol k'ariringi p'nnwyạnga s'ẹvạrakpa njọ ch'ittemmạma, <verse eid="EXO 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 28:25" />abạra akpa acho mbọkha afa p'mgbakkọhbhọ k'ata mbọ afa, amaana k'nkkang, k'ititikha s'ẹphọd. <verse eid="EXO 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 28:26" />Si ariringi afa p'gol, akpạna pyẹ k'nnmyạnga nnọkha mfa k'ẹtaanga kw'ẹvạrakpa ch'ittemmạma abaanga ẹphọd. <verse eid="EXO 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 28:27" />Si adạkhẹ ariringi afa p'gol, akpạna pẹ k'isekhisek kw'mvạrakpa s'nkkang, k'ititikha s'ẹphọd, ọbaanga k'ẹbọhra ch'ẹrạng-erạng kw'udikhikpa kw'ẹphọd. <verse eid="EXO 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 28:28" />Tima idikhi ch'ede blu, kpạna k'ariringi p'ẹvạrakpa ch'ittemmạma, mạnna k'ariringi p'ẹphọd, akpạna kha udikhikpa kw'irin, ọfha ẹvạrakpa njọ ch'ittemmạma nạngẹ ẹchaarẹ etto.<verse eid="EXO 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 28:29" />“Okpe kwidede kw'Aarọn n'oben bẹ́, ọnwa k'ibyi s'awurada, m'ujima ache p'ajunungva p'Israẹl k'ettem chẹ, p'abẹ abbẹ k'ẹvạrakpa ch'ittemmạma ch'ẹkka ọkkachẹ, ọfha Ubinọkpaabyi n'utima ujima anạng pẹ. <verse eid="EXO 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 28:30" />M'abạra abẹ Urim ọttạra Tumim ma ẹvarakpa ch'ittemmạma, ọfha Aarọn n'utima k'ittemmạma k'okpe kwidede kw'obe Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'ititikha. Ma wọ kw'Aarọn m'n'utima ujima k'ettem oche kw'm'ọkhaama ẹkka ọkkachẹ otena anạng p'Israẹl k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 28:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnya nnọkha s'afọhn-ẹja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 28:31" />“Tima ivạra s'blu mạnkkeni bọhra ọnọhma-baba kw'ẹphọd, <verse eid="EXO 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 28:32" />awẹ m'ọkhaama ọmma kw'echo-gige k'ottemkwẹ. Abẹ abạra ayok inọhma-dwạngọ oyok ọfha nạng'ọyaakhẹ. <verse eid="EXO 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 28:33" />Tima ndikhi s'blu, ọttạra okhor-ichicho, ọttạra okhor-isisẹ, ọttạra ndikh'ikkasẹ yokh achidwuk, fhạrọ ammakpa p'inọhma-diden nnọ, ọttạra nganyaang s'gol k'ottemkwẹ kwabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 28:34" />Abẹ m'atima nganyaang ọttạra achidwuk mbọ afhạrọ ammakpa p'ọnọhma-baba nwọ phyi-phyibh. <verse eid="EXO 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 28:35" />Aarọn m'oge wẹ k'okpe kw'm'usi ọtọhm f'ọfọhnẹja. Abẹ m'abhaanga mmạng s'nganyaang k'okpe kw'm'ọnwa k'Ibyi s'Awurada k'ititikha s'Ubinọkpaabyi, ọttạra k'okpe kw'm'uyin k'iyaan, ọfha nạngẹ ope.<verse eid="EXO 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 28:36" />“Tima gol ọkkọkka si ẹchaangkpa, akkẹr ma masẹ ẹkhọhkha bẹ́, AWURADA AYIM ANẠNG ỌVAAR UBINỌKPAABYI. <verse eid="EXO 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 28:37" />Tima idikhi ch'ede blu dạbh amaana k'ọdạbhecho kw'ọfọhnẹja; ininga k'ititkha kw'ọdạbhecho nwọ. <verse eid="EXO 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 28:38" />M'ininga Aarọn k'ititikha-ttem, Aarọn m'ọtọhkha ẹkhọngkwuru ch'ining k'nnạnga s'awurada s'anạng p'Israẹl, usi asẹ iwur, s'ọbạra nnạnga ide yạn. M'efona ororo ẹnạna Aarọn ma ititikha-ttem, ọfha Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ochera ọtakha nnạnga nnọ.<verse eid="EXO 28:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 28:39" />“Tima ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok ayok ọnọhma-baba nwọ, abạra atima ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok ayok ọdạbhecho. Udikhikpa kw'irin m'ode ọbọhktọhm f'odokh-ọvạra. <verse eid="EXO 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 28:40" />Gba bọhra ọnọhma-baba, ọttạra ẹvạrakpa-dikhi, ọttạra avạrakpa p'echo anạng ajunungva p'Aarọn, ọfha abẹ akhaama ikpukpobha ọttạra abạrada. <verse eid="EXO 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 28:41" />Ode kk'nwakka Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva pẹ nnya nnọ agia, byenga bẹ ana k'echo, abạra anạna bẹ ọbọhk k'echo. Do bẹ abẹ awur, ọfha abẹ asi-m ọtọhm f'afọhnẹja.<verse eid="EXO 28:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 28:42" />“Tima ndikhi sabẹ ayokh-oyok bọhra ekpo-khuma py'ẹtaanga, py'm'ẹtạma k'irin ikpira k'ntaak, ibubha bẹ ifor. <verse eid="EXO 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 28:43" />Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva pẹ m'age pyẹ k'okpe kwidede kw'abẹ m'anwa k'ukkira kw'etobha, ọbạra ode bẹ́, abẹ m'asenga afona k'ijabyi, ọfha abẹ asi ọtọhm k'Ibyi s'Awurada, ọfha abẹ nạngẹ apini, akwu ape.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 28:43">“Inyina nja m'ininga ẹnạng Aarọn ọttạra iva p'iva pẹ tạrr ipimmanitor.<verse eid="EXO 28:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EXO 29" />
  <para style="s">Oche kw'abẹ m'asi afọhnẹja p'Ubinọkpaabyi akhaama awurada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 29:1" />“Maa wọ ode oche kw'm'asi abẹ akhaama awurada, ọfha abẹ asi ọtọhm f'afọhnẹja: tạkha ọbhaamnwa-dim, ọttạra arạkhạmaan-dim afa p'nạn ekhem akhaam. <verse eid="EXO 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 29:2" />Bạra tima abubuma ọkkọkka p'wit asi brẹd kw'abẹ nạn yist nágia, ọttạra ekpo ẹkkạngapyẹ py'abẹ age ana, ọttạra abukpa py'abẹ nạn yist nágia, py'abẹ abạra arẹbhẹ ana p'oliv. <verse eid="EXO 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 29:3" />Yikha pyẹ k'ikhạrạbang atima akwu, ọttạra ẹbhaam njọ, ọttạra arạkhạmaan-dim mbọ afa. <verse eid="EXO 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 29:4" />Ma wọ, m'atima Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva pẹ akwu k'ẹchọhmma ch'ukkira nwọ kw'etobha, atima asi akpobhu bẹ ifor. <verse eid="EXO 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 29:5" />Tạkha nnya nnọ s'ide ọnọhma-baba, ọttạra ọkpaar-mbọhk kw'ẹphọd, ọttạra ẹphọd oyeni, ọttạra ẹvạrakpa ch'ittemmạma, ge Aarọn. Akpẹ-ẹ udikhikpa kw'abẹ atim emmengkka ayok, atima avạkha ẹphọd nwọ ma irin. <verse eid="EXO 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 29:6" />Kpẹ-ẹ ọdạbhecho, abạra akhubh-ẹ ikpo s'awurada amaana ma ọdạbhecho nwọ. <verse eid="EXO 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 29:7" />Tạkha ana p'abẹ n'abyenga ọnạng k'echo byeng-ẹ k'echo. <verse eid="EXO 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 29:8" />Atima ajunungva pẹ akwu, age bẹ anọhma-baba, <verse eid="EXO 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 29:9" />abạra akpa bẹ ọdạbhecho. Atạkha adikhikpa akpa Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva pẹ. Inyina nja ch'ẹjafufọhnọ m'ede chabẹ tạrr ipimmanitor. Ma wọ m'anạna Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva pẹ ọbọhk k'echo.<verse eid="EXO 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 29:10" />“Tima ẹbhaamdim kwu k'ititikha s'ukkira kw'etobha, Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva pẹ m'anạna chẹ mbọhk k'echo. <verse eid="EXO 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 29:11" />Yẹk ẹbhaamdim njọ ẹdwạngọ ma ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ma ẹchọhmma ch'ukkira kw'etobha. <verse eid="EXO 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 29:12" />Tima ẹnọhna chọ kperi isẹ rạnẹ s'ẹbhaamdim njọ, atwạkhọ k'abhik p'ijabyi, abạra atạkha s'irikhi abyenga ma irin ch'ijabyi nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 29:13" />Atạkha iyaak phyi-phyibh s'ifhạrọ afhạrọ, ọttạra s'ibubh ẹnnạng, ọttạra s'ibubh adwạdwạrọ, akkạmọ pyẹ ma ijabyi. <verse eid="EXO 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 29:14" />Okhenka, kkạmọ atennạng p'ẹbhaamdim njọ, ọttạra atenkpa pẹ, ọttạra afhạrọ pẹ k'iyaan-iyaan kw'ibyibhingasẹ. Ẹjọ m'ede ẹnạnga ch'ipyibha kpukpobhu.<verse eid="EXO 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 29:15" />“Tạkha ọrakhạmaandim wạnọ ma mbọ afa, Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva pẹ anạna chẹ mbọhk k'echo. <verse eid="EXO 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 29:16" />Yẹk ọrạkhạmaandim nwọ ẹdwạngọ, atạkha isẹ sẹ awobhu k'akhaan-ọkhaan phyi-phyibh p'ijabyi nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 29:17" />Jẹk ọrạkhạmaan-dim nwọ <char style="it">bẹ́ sẹkhẹ-sẹkhẹ</char>, akpobhu afhạrọ pẹ, ọttạra mfhok, atạkha echo attạra k'nnọkha s'ajẹkhẹ. <verse eid="EXO 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 29:18" />Kkạmọ ọrạkhạmaandim nwọ phyi-phyibh ma ijabyi nnọ. Ma wọ m'ode ẹnạnga ẹkkạmachẹ ẹnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ch'erebhi iruk, ẹbạra ede ẹnạnga ch'abẹ aseng k'ekpon akkạmọ anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 29:19" />“M'atạkha ọrakhạmaandim nwọkha, Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva pẹ anạna chẹ mbọhk k'echo. <verse eid="EXO 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 29:20" />Yẹk chẹ ẹdwạngọ, atạkha isẹ sẹ rạnẹ afokha k'itọhngkpa s'udimbọhk kw'Aarọn, ọttạra ajunungva pẹ, ọttạra k'nnọhnadim s'udimbọhk kwabẹ, ọttạra k'nnọhnadim s'udimfok kwabẹ. Abạra awobhu isẹ k'akhaan-ọkhaan phyi-phyibh kw'ijabyi nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 29:21" />Gba tạkha isẹ rạnẹ k'ijabyi, attạra k'ana p'abẹ n'abyenga ọnạng k'echo, awobhu Aarọn, ọttạra k'nnya sẹ, abạra awobhu ajunungva pẹ, ọttạra k'nnya sabẹ. Ma wọ, ẹma ọttạra ajunungva pẹ, ọttạra nnya sabẹ m'akhaama awurada.<verse eid="EXO 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 29:22" />“Tạkha iyaak s'ọrạkhạmaan-dim nwọ, ọttạra iyaak s'ẹsạra, ọttạra iyaak s'ibubh afhạrọ, ọttạra s'ibubh attennạng, ọttạra s'adwạdwạrọ, ọttạra ọtaak kw'udimfhok. Ma wọ m'ode ọrạkhạmaandim kw'ẹbọhk-nạna. <verse eid="EXO 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 29:23" />Ma ikhạrạbang nnọ s'brẹd kw'abẹ nạn yist nágia, s'ining k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, m'atạkha brẹd wạnọ, wạnọ kw'udin-udini kw'abẹ age ana, ọttạra wạnọ kw'obhekh-obhekhi. <verse eid="EXO 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 29:24" />Tạkha pyẹ phyi-phyibh ge Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva pẹ k'mbọhk, awobhu pyẹ masẹ ẹnạnga ch'ẹbạrẹ udik k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 29:25" />Bạra atạkha pyẹ kabẹ k'mbọhk, akkạmọ k'ijabyi, ọttạra ẹnạnga ẹkkạmachẹ, ch'erebhi Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi iruk, ẹnạnga ch'abẹ asengi k'ekpon akkạmọ anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 29:26" />Okpe kw'kk'ọkwọ kw'ọrạkhạmaan-dim atima asi ẹbọhk-nạna ch'Aarọn, wobhu ẹnạnga njọ k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi masẹ ẹnạnga ch'ẹbạrẹ udik. Okhebh pfọ vọ ma.<verse eid="EXO 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 29:27" />“Tạkha nten nnọ s'ẹrạkhạmaan-dim s'ẹbọhk-nạna, s'ide s'Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva pẹ, ọttạra k'ọkwọ nwọ kw'awobh-owobhu, ọttạra ọtaak kw'anạng-ẹ, asi asẹ ikhaama awurada. <verse eid="EXO 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 29:28" />Ma wọ ode okhebh f'anạng p'Israẹl m'anạng Aarọn ọttạra iva pẹ k'okpe kwidede. Ẹvọ ode ọtạbha kw'anạng p'Israẹl m'asi anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi masẹ nnạnga sabẹ s'ẹgbạkha.<verse eid="EXO 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 29:29" />“Nnya s'Aarọn s'awurada ikhaam iva p'iva pẹ, sabẹ m'age sabẹ m'abyenga bẹ ana k'echo, ọttạra sabẹ m'anạna bẹ ọbọhk k'echo. <verse eid="EXO 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 29:30" />Ujunungnwa kw'm'ọtạkha ininga ch'otte masẹ ọfọhnẹja, kw'm'ukwu bẹ́, ukwu usi ọtọhm k'ukkira kw'etobha, k'Ibyi s'Awurada, m'oge nnya nnọ k'iwu isenọfa.”<verse eid="EXO 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 29:31" />Tạkha ọrạkhạmaan-dim kw'ẹbọhk-nạna, awọhn nten sẹ ma ibyi s'awurada. <verse eid="EXO 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 29:32" />Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva pẹ m'aninga ma ẹchọhmma ch'ukkira kw'etobha achi nten s'ọrạkhạmaan-dim nwọ, ọttạra brẹd kw'uning ma ikhạrạbang nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 29:33" />Abẹ m'achi nnạnga nnọ s'ekpobhu ch'efokhu, sabẹ atim asi ẹbọhk-nạna chabẹ, ọttạra wuwur kwabẹ. Okhenka, ọnọng ọdwạkh-ọdwạk sẹ múchi, ukwuru bẹ́, iseng ittạra awurada. <verse eid="EXO 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 29:34" />Fidede f'ochobh iwu, ode eten, ọbạra ode brẹd, annemeden akkạmọ, ọnạng nạngẹ uchi, ukwuru bẹ́, apfe oseng ọttạra awurada.<verse eid="EXO 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 29:35" />“Si udik kwidede kw'kkọ-ọ ntọhna nạng Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva pẹ, atima iwu isenọfa anạna bẹ ọbọhk k'echo. <verse eid="EXO 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 29:36" />Iwu chidede, m'atima ẹbhaamdim afọhnọ ẹja ch'efokhu ch'ipyibha. Si efokhu tima si ijabbyi nnọ ikhaama awurada, abạra abyenga sẹ ana, ọfha asẹ ikhaama awurada. <verse eid="EXO 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 29:37" />Tima iwu isenọfa si efokhu ch'ijabyi, abạra asi asẹ ikhaama awurada. Ma wọ, ijabyi nnọ n'abạra ide ibyi s'awurada, fidede f'utwu ma n'ọkhaam awurada.<verse eid="EXO 29:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 29:38" />“Maa wọ ode ẹnạnga ch'm'anạng k'ijabyi k'iwu chidede: arạkhạmaan-va afa p'ade cho gwạnọ. <verse eid="EXO 29:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 29:39" />Tima ọrạkhạmaan-nwa wạnọ k'ekpebha, abạra atima wạnọ k'ẹchọhkha afọhnọ ẹja. <verse eid="EXO 29:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 29:40" />K'ocheden-rạkhạmaan-nwa nwọ, yoma okpobhumbọhk wạnọ k'akpobhumbọhk jobh p'abubuma ọkkọkka p'wit, p'afhunu ọttạra ẹna-kpomma ch'ana p'oliv, ọttạra k'itwuk-kpomma jạnẹ ch'm'ede masẹ ẹnạnga ch'ugwua. <verse eid="EXO 29:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 29:41" />Tima ọrạkhạmaan-nwa nwọkha fọhnọ ẹja k'ẹchọkha, ọttạra k'ẹnạnga ch'agwu, ọttạra k'ẹnạnga ch'itwuk-byenga k'oche kw'wạra asi k'ekpebha. Achẹ m'ede ẹnạnga ch'erebhi iruk, ch'abẹ aseng k'ekpon anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 29:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 29:42" />“Igbọ s'm'ikwu k'ororo m'isi ẹnạnga ẹkkạmachẹ nja k'okpe kwidede k'ẹchọhmma ch'ukkira kw'etobha, k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Ma wọ m'nkhebha bạnga, mkpaak udik nnạng bạnga. <verse eid="EXO 29:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 29:43" />Ma wọ m'mbạra nkhebha anạng p'Israẹl, ntima abạrada paam nsi ibyi nnọ ikhaama awurada.<verse eid="EXO 29:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 29:44" />“Ma wọ, amma m'nsi ukkira nwọ kw'etobha, ọttạra ijabyi nnọ ikhaama awurada, mbạra nsi Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva pẹ akhaama awurada, ọfha abẹ asi ọtọhm f'afọhnẹja. <verse eid="EXO 29:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 29:45" />Ma wọ, amma m'nninga iva p'Israẹl abẹ, mbạra nde Ubinọkpaabyi kwabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 29:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 29:46" />Abẹ m'asonga bẹ́, amma wọ nde Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwabẹ, kw'utim bẹ ubina k'Ijip, ọfha nnuk bẹ abẹ. Amma wọ nde Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwabẹ.<verse eid="EXO 29:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EXO 30" />
  <para style="s">Ijabyi s'insẹns</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 30:1" />“Atima mkpaakha s'akasiya asi ijabyi s'abạnga m'n'akkạmọ insẹns. <verse eid="EXO 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 30:2" />Si sẹ ikhaama akhubha annebung. Adum pẹ ọttạra ẹkpa chẹ m'ade obengana, kw'ode ẹtwạkhọ ọmaana ibhaakha, ebe chẹ m'ede ntwạkhọ nttaan, abhik pẹ m'abina ma ẹkpaakha njọ jạnẹ. <verse eid="EXO 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 30:3" />Tima gol ọkkọkka bubha ẹrang-ẹrang kwẹ, ọttạra k'akhaan-ọkhaan pẹ phyibh, ọttạra k'abhik. Abạra atima gol afhạrọ ammakpabem pẹ akhạbha. <verse eid="EXO 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 30:4" />Tima gol si ariringi afa, age pyẹ akkeri ayok ititikha k'ijabyi nnọ, k'isekhisek kw'ammakpabem mbọ p'gol, ọfha apyẹ ẹvạkha mkpọmmachi sabẹ m'atima adira ijabyi nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 30:5" />Tima mkpaakha s'akasiya si mkpọmmachi, atima gol afhạrọ sẹ. <verse eid="EXO 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 30:6" />Chok ijabyi nnọ k'ititikha s'ikwukwur s'ining k'ititikha s'Ikwukwur s'Echekha, k'ititikha s'ikwukwur-kpa ch'efokhu, ch'ining k'erạng-ẹrạng kw'Ikwukwur s'Echekha, k'ibyi s'm'nkhebh-ọ.<verse eid="EXO 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 30:7" />“K'ekpebhawu chidede, Aarọn ọbaan bẹ́, ọkkạmọ insẹns kw'orebhi iruk ma ijabyi nnọ k'okpe kw'm'ọta okkeri attukkạng. <verse eid="EXO 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 30:8" />Ọbaan bẹ́, ọbạra ọkkạmọ insẹns okpe kw'm'oyeni attukkạng k'ẹchọhkha, ọfha insẹns n'akkạmọ oche ngwọ-ngwọ k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, tạrr ukpira k'igbọ s'm'ikwu k'iwu oro. <verse eid="EXO 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 30:9" />Abạnga insẹns ọdwạkh-ọdwạk kátima akwu ma ijabyi nna, ode ẹnạnga ẹkkạmachẹ ch'ukhira kwidede o, ọbạra ode ẹnạnga ch'agwu o, ode ch'itwuk-byenga o, abạnga ma ijabyi nnọ kási. <verse eid="EXO 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 30:10" />Aarọn m'usi ẹjafọhna ch'efokhu eden jạnẹ k'cho k'abhik p'ijabyi nnọ. Ọbaan bẹ́, utima isẹ s'eten usi ẹjafọhna njọ ch'efokhu ch'cho, ch'ede ẹnạnga ch'ipyibha kpukpobhu, tạrr ukpira k'igbọ s'm'ikwu k'iwu oro. Ẹjafọhna njọ m'ede awurada p'ayọhng awurada ẹnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.”<verse eid="EXO 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ọtạbha kw'ẹjafọhna ch'efokhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 30:11" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 30:12" />“K'okpe kw'm'atạkha ubhik kw'anạng p'Israẹl, ọbaan bẹ́, ọnạng kwidede usi ọtạbha kw'ebhekha ch'akpen pẹ ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'okpe kw'abẹ m'abhikh-ẹ. Ma wọ, ọkhạnkhạmọ kw'm'otto okhebha bẹ k'okpe kw'm'abhik bẹ, kòde. <verse eid="EXO 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 30:13" />Ọnạng kwidede kw'abẹ kk'abhikha m'ọnạng shẹkẹl ibhaakha otor k'shẹkẹl kw'ọchọhm kw'awurada, kw'ọdọhbhọ ukpira Gẹra ẹrạbh. Ibhaakha nnọ s'shẹkẹl rọ ide ẹnạnga ẹnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 30:14" />Anạng mbọ phyibh p'abẹ kk'abhikha p'ade icho ẹrạbh usukuma, m'anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ẹnạnga. <verse eid="EXO 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 30:15" />Masẹ abạnga m'asi ẹnạnga ch'efokhu anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, tte avạvara nạngẹ anạng ayongu ibhaakha s'shẹkẹl, tte akpukpora nạngẹ abạra anạng f'ọsạkhẹ ọyọhnga ibhaakha s'shẹkẹl. <verse eid="EXO 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 30:16" />Tạkha ọtạbha kw'ẹjafọhna ch'efokhu k'anạng p'Israẹl, atima asi ọtọhm k'ukkira kw'etobha kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Udik ngwa m'ode ijima ọnạng anạng p'Israẹl, ọbạra ode ẹjafọhna ch'efokhu ọnạng abạngama oyeni.”<verse eid="EXO 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ọgbangbang kw'mbọhk kw'mfhok kpukpobhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 30:17" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 30:18" />“Tima brons si ọgbang-gbang kw'mbọhk ọttạra mfhok kpukpobhu, abạra atima brons asi ẹnạna chẹ. Ge asi ma ọgbangbang nwọ bera k'ottemkwẹ kw'ukkira kw'etobha ọttạra ijabyi. <verse eid="EXO 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 30:19" />Tte Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva pẹ n'atima asi p'aning ma ọgbangbang nwọ n'akpobhu mbọhk ọttạra mfhok sabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 30:20" />Okpe kwidede kw'abẹ anwa k'ukkira kw'etobha nwọ, abe m'akpobhu mbọhk ọttạra mfhok sabẹ, ọfha abe nạngẹ ape. Abẹ m'abạra asi oche ngwọ k'okpe kw'abẹ m'asenga afora ijabyi nnọ bẹ́, abẹ ata anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ẹnạnga ch'uchiattọhk. <verse eid="EXO 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 30:21" />Abẹ m'akpobhu mbọhk ọttạra mfhok sabẹ, ọfha abẹ nạngẹ ape. Inyina nja m'efona ororo ininga ẹnạng Aarọn, ọttạra ajunungva pẹ tạrr ukpira k'igbọ s'iwu oro.”<verse eid="EXO 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana p'ẹbọhk-nạna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 30:22" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 30:23" />“Tạkha ekpo demapẹ mba py'ekpo ọkkọkka, py'n'isi ọttọhk orebh iruk masẹ ashẹkẹl ẹnọhna ukuma arạbh asen p'myrrh kw'ode asi-asi, ọttạra ashẹkẹl arạbh jobh-kamfa ukuma jobh p'sinamọn, ọttạra ashẹkẹl arạbh jobh-kamfa ukuma jobh p'kalamus, <verse eid="EXO 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 30:24" />ọttạra ashẹkẹl ẹnọhna ukuma arạbh asen p'kasiya. Phyi-phyibh m'ator k'ẹnạnga ch'ọchọhm kw'awurada, ọttạra ẹna-kpomma ch'ana p'oliv. <verse eid="EXO 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 30:25" />Tima pyẹ si ana p'ẹbọhk-nạna ch'awurada, p'arebhi iruk, f'ode ọbọhktọhm f'ọnạng kw'n'usi ekpo erebh iruk. Apyẹ m'ade ana p'ẹbọhk-nạna ch'awurada. <verse eid="EXO 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 30:26" />Ma wọ m'abyenga pyẹ k'ukkira kw'etobha, ọttạra k'Ikwukwur s'Echekha, <verse eid="EXO 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 30:27" />ọttạra k'okpokkạro, ọttạra ekpo phyibh py'ẹnạn ma, ọttạra k'itukkạng-chi, ọttạra ekpo pyẹ phyibh, ọttạra k'ijabyi s'insẹns, <verse eid="EXO 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 30:28" />ọttạra k'ijabyi s'ẹnạnga ẹkkạmachẹ, ọttạra ekpo pyẹ phyibh, ọttạra ọgbangbang, ọttạra ẹnạna chẹ. <verse eid="EXO 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 30:29" />M'asi apyẹ iwur, ẹkhaama awurada p'ayọhng awurada, fidede f'utwu pyẹ m'ọkhaama awurada.<verse eid="EXO 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 30:30" />“Byenga Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva pẹ ana k'echo akhaama awurada, ọfha abẹ ade afọhnẹja paam. <verse eid="EXO 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 30:31" />Kpaak anạng p'Israẹl bẹ́, ‘Ana mba m'ade ana paam p'ẹbọhk-nạna ch'awurada tạrr ukpira k'igbọ s'iwu oro. <verse eid="EXO 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 30:32" />Ọnạng ọdwạkh-ọdwạk ana mbọ k'ifor kábyenga, ana-khira mbọ kási k'eden ẹdwạkh-ọdwạk, ukwuru bẹ́, ana mbọ ade ana p'awurada. <verse eid="EXO 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 30:33" />Ọnạng kwidede kw'usi ana p'arebhi iruk masẹ mba, ọnang kwidede kw'ọbạra ọtạkha pyẹ obyenga ọnạng ọdwạkh-ọdwạk kw'oyongu ọfọhnẹja, ọbaan bẹ́, abẹ akhubh-ẹ k'ofhon.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Insẹns</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 30:34" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Tạkha ekpo py'n'isi ọttọhk orebh iruk masẹ resin, ọttạra onicha, ọttạra galbanum, ọttạra insẹns ọkkọkka, ayoma pyẹ obengana, <verse eid="EXO 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 30:35" />afhunu pyẹ atima asi insẹns, ode ọbọhktọhm f'ọnạng kw'n'usi ekpo py'n'erebh iruk. Insẹns nwọ m'ode abubuma, abubuma p'ade akkapẹ, abạra akhaama awurada. <verse eid="EXO 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 30:36" />Tạkha byạnọ khok ẹpẹrẹ, atạkha abera k'ititikha s'Ikwukwur s'Echekha k'ukkira kw'etobha, kw'm'mkhebh-ọ. Asẹ m'ide awurada p'ayọhng awurada inạng bạnga. <verse eid="EXO 30:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 30:37" />Abạnga insẹns-khira nwọ oche ngwọ kási anạng abạngama oyeni. Abạnga atạkha wẹ masẹ ọttọhk f'awurada ọnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 30:38" />Ọnạng kwidede kw'usi insẹns demakwẹ nwa, ọfha n'ọbhaanga orebh f'iruk chẹ, ọbaan bẹ́, abẹ akhubh-ẹ k'ofhon.”<verse eid="EXO 30:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EXO 31" />
  <para style="s1">Bẹzalẹl ọttạra Oholiyab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 31:1" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 31:2" />“Kker e, amma kk'Bẹzalẹl kw'ode ujunungnwa kw'Uri, kw'ode nnwa kw'Hur, k'efona ch'Juda nnenga. <verse eid="EXO 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 31:3" />Amma khẹ Iguguma s'Ubinọkpaabyi nnạnga, ọttạra ekkoji, ọttạra idik-songa, ọttạra itina ch'emengkka-khira chidede, <verse eid="EXO 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 31:4" />ọfha usi ọtọhm f'gol, ọttạra f'silva, ọttạra f'brons tạtekha, <verse eid="EXO 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 31:5" />f'm'ọphyaakhẹ ata, ọbạra otobha pyẹ, ọbạra ọgwa nchi, ọttạra ọtọhm ommengkka-tọhm k'ukhira-k'ukhira. <verse eid="EXO 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 31:6" />Ayongu ma, amma kk'Oholiyab kw'ode ujunungnwa kw'Ahisamak, k'efona ch'Dan nnenga bẹ́, ugi-ẹ ọbọhk. Amma kk'ammengkka phyi-phyibh ekkoji ch'emmengkka nnạnga, ch'abẹ m'atima asi ọttọhk fidede f'kk'ọ ntọhna. <verse eid="EXO 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 31:7" />M'asi ukkira kw'etobha, ọttạra Ikwukwur s'Echekha, ọttạra ikwukwurkpa ch'efokhu, ọttạra ẹnya-kpo mbyọkha phyibh py'ukkira nwọ, <verse eid="EXO 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 31:8" />ọttạra okpokkro, ọttạra ekpo phyibh py'm'ẹnạna ma, ọttạra itukkạng-chi ch'gol ọkkọkka, oseng k'ekpo pyẹ phyi-phyibh, ọttạra ijabyi s'insẹns, <verse eid="EXO 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 31:9" />ọttạra ijabyi s'ẹnạnga-ẹkkạmachẹ, ọttạra ekpo pyẹ phyibh, ọttạra ọgbangbang ọttạra ẹnạna chẹ, <verse eid="EXO 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 31:10" />ọttạra nnya iyokhasẹ s'ide nnya s'awurada s'Aarọn kw'ode ọfọhnẹja, ọttạra nnya s'ajunungva pẹ k'okpe kw'abẹ m'asi ọttọhm f'afọhnẹja, <verse eid="EXO 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 31:11" />ọttạra ana p'abẹ n'abyenga ọnạng k'echo, ọttạra insẹns kw'orebhi iruk kw'abẹ m'achok k'ibyi s'Awurada. Tte abẹ asi idik nnọ ator k'oche kw'ntọhn-ọ.”<verse eid="EXO 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ẹyọhngkwokhawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 31:12" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 31:13" />“Ben anạng p'Israẹl bẹ́, ‘Ọbaan bẹ́, abạnga achok Iyọhngkwokhawu saam. Ma wọ m'ode ẹkhọhkha ch'abạngama amma abẹ, tạrr ukpira igbo s'iwu oro, ọfha abạnga asonga bẹ́, amma wọ nde Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'n'usi bạnga akhaama awurada.<verse eid="EXO 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 31:14" />“ ‘Abạnga achok Ẹyọhngkwokhawu njọ, ukwuru bẹ́, achẹ ede iwu ch'awurada ẹnạng bạnga. Ọnạng kwidede kw'unnukhu iwu njọ, ọbaan bẹ́, abẹ afhẹ-ẹ. Ọnạng kwidede kw'usi ọtọhm-khira fidede ma iwu njọ, ọbaan bẹ́, abẹ akhubh-ẹ k'ofhon. <verse eid="EXO 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 31:15" />Iwu isajạnẹ rọ s'abạnga m'asi ọttọhm, okhenka, iwu ch'ettong iwu isenọfa, m'ede Ẹyọhngkwokha ch'awurada ẹnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Ọnạng kwidede kw'usi ọttọhm ma iwu njọ, ọbaan k'obo. <verse eid="EXO 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 31:16" />Ma wọ, anạng p'Israẹl m'achok ẹyọhngkwokhawu njọ, abẹ m'achok iwu njọ masẹ echekha ch'm'ininga tạrr ukpira k'igbọ s'm'ikwu k'iwu oro. <verse eid="EXO 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 31:17" />Iwu njọ m'ede ẹkhọhkha ch'amma ọttạra anạng p'Israẹl tạrr ipimmanitor, ukwuru bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi utim iwu isajạnẹ usi ẹrạng ọttạra isek, okhenka, s'ottong iwu isenọfa, ukuma ọtọhm sisi, okwokha ọyọhng.”<verse eid="EXO 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 31:18" />Masẹ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs idik nnọ ọkpaakha phyibh k'okpecho kw'Sinai, n'ọtạk ata-gbẹra afa p'nnyina, p'ẹma Ubinọkpaabyi utim ẹnọhna chẹ ọkkẹr, ọnạng Mosẹs.<verse eid="EXO 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EXO 32" />
  <para style="s">Ọbhaam-nwa kw'abẹ atim gol asi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 32:1" />Masẹ anạng p'Israel ase bẹ́, Mosẹs k'okponga oseng eden k'okpecho, abẹ ata akhạbha Aarọn age k'ngekha aben bẹ́, “Khiri kha, kwu asi akha nạng mạna p'm'atima mạna eden. De n'ode oyoyaanẹ nwọ Mosẹs kw'utim mạna ubina k'Ijip, s'kk'ittia ikhebh-ẹ kha kánsong e.”<verse eid="EXO 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 32:2" />Ma wọ Aarọn ubhin bẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga awạra akkạra py'gol py'ipanạng pabạnga, ọttạra py'iva pabạnga, ajunungva ọttạra apanạngva, akken-m.” <verse eid="EXO 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 32:3" />Ma wọ anạng mbọ phyibh awạra akkạra pyabẹ akkena Aarọn. <verse eid="EXO 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 32:4" />Ọtạkha ekpo py'abẹ kk'ẹ akkena, udwuk ọkpata kw'okher ọbhaamnwa, utima ọttọhm-ttọhk usi awẹ ọkwọhnga. Ma wọ, abẹ abeni bẹ́, “Israẹl o, akkeri ọkha fabạnga ma f'utim bạnga ubina k'Ijip-e.”<verse eid="EXO 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 32:5" />Masẹ Aarọn ose udik ngwa, usi ijabyi ma ititikha s'ọbhaam-nwa nwọ, owon ẹmạng bẹ́, “Uphyini m'ansi erobha annạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi-e.” <verse eid="EXO 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 32:6" />Ma wọ iwu echobh ma, anạng mbọ agim-ugim aphyạbha, ata afọhnọ ẹja ch'nnạnga ikkạmasẹ, abẹ abạra atima nnạnga s'ẹgbạkha akwu. Abẹ abina ma, abẹ ata aninga ẹyạr achi, abạra agwo, bạra abẹ n'abin atạma isaasadik sisi.<verse eid="EXO 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 32:7" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Sạkha, khiri anạng pọ p'atim abina k'Ijip kk'akhibha. <verse eid="EXO 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 32:8" />Abẹ kk'idwudwukha atima akpa nnạm avạra ntọhna s'nnạng bẹ, abẹ kk'ọkpata-nwa abạra adwukha kw'ode masẹ ọbhaam-nwa. Abẹ kk'ncho atwunga anạng-ẹ, abẹ kk'ẹja abạra afọhna anạng-ẹ, abẹ aben bẹ́, ‘Israẹl o, akkeri ọkha fabạnga ma f'utim bạnga ubina k'Ijip e.’<verse eid="EXO 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 32:9" />“Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Amma kk'anạng mba nsia phyibh, abẹ ade anạng p'akhaam ẹgaga e. <verse eid="EXO 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 32:10" />M'atte-m ọbọhk nkhọhkha bẹ ottemkạm kwaam, ọfha mbạra ndimi bẹ. Ma wọ m'nsi-ọ ẹkhạma chididen.”<verse eid="EXO 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 32:11" />Okhenka, Mosẹs ophyemi Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwẹ ọphyaam, oben bẹ́, “O Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ode yạn kw'n'akhaam ottemkạm anạng pọ abẹ, p'ọma oyeni atim ẹfa chididen, ọttạra ekhema abina k'Ijip o? <verse eid="EXO 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 32:12" />Ukwuru yạn kw'anạng p'Ijip n'abạra aben bẹ́, ‘Wa, ọkhaam ẹkka-pyibha otena bẹ abẹ, ẹgwọ usi utima bẹ ubina k'Ijip ukwu ọfhọ ma akpecho mba, ọfha osenga ma udimi bẹ woowong ma ọyagbin?’ Yaanga ottemkạm kwọ jẹ, adiri ettem, anạng pọ ipyibha kási. <verse eid="EXO 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 32:13" />Jima atọhmnạng pọ Abraham, ọttạra Isaak, ọttạra Jekọb, p'ọma oyeni atim ifor sọ achekhi anạng bẹ bẹ́, ‘Amma m'nsi iva p'iva pabạnga asaabh masẹ ndudoru s'ọrạngkpaang, mbạra nnạng iva p'iva pabạnga isisek nna phyibh s'nchekhi nnạng bẹ. Asẹ m'ibạra ide okhebh pfabẹ tạrr ipimmanitor.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 32:14" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi udiri ettem, ipyibha ch'uwa ọkhạmọ bẹ́, usi anạng pẹ, dạk núsia.<verse eid="EXO 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 32:15" />Mosẹs ọbhạkhẹ nnạm ọsạkha k'okpecho, utima atakpa afa k'mbọhk sẹ, p'abẹ akkẹre k'nnyina k'nnạm mfa, k'ititikha ọttạra k'nnạm. <verse eid="EXO 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 32:16" />Wa atakpa mbọ ade ọbọhktọhm f'Ubinọkpaabyi, ọkkẹra kw'uning ma atakpa mbọ ode ọkkẹra kw'Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 32:17" />Masẹ Joshua ọbhaang mmạng s'anạng n'awuru, ọben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kkọhm oche kw'akpong-mạng n'atto kha ibyibhingasẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 32:18" />Mosẹs ubhina bẹ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 32:18">“Ẹmạng ch'ekhema sạng ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 32:18">ebomạng sạng ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 32:18">ẹmạng ch'ọkkọhna jọ n'ntera mmaanga.”<verse eid="EXO 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 32:19" />Masẹ Mosẹs oseng ofora ibyibhingasẹ, n'ose ọkha f'abẹ agwa masẹ ọbhaam-nwa, ọttạra utubha, ettem ipyibh-ẹ, ọbhạrẹ atakpa p'utim k'mbọhk, ọvọhkhọ pyẹ k'abuma-k'abuma ma ekpecho-rin. <verse eid="EXO 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 32:20" />Ọbạra ọtạkha ọkha mvọ f'abẹ kk'asia ọbhaabh k'ekpon; brasẹ n'ọtạk pfẹ okhok tạrr apfẹ ọpẹre, ọtạkha abubuma mbọ uttumu k'asi, ọkwa anạng p'Israẹl agwo pyẹ.<verse eid="EXO 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 32:21" />Mosẹs oben Aarọn bẹ, “Anạng mba asi-ọ mbạng kw'atim bẹ asi ipyibha ch'ebeng ma o?”<verse eid="EXO 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 32:22" />Aarọn ubhina bẹ́, “Aro kwaam, totokhạn, nạng-ọ ọdwạkhọ, ọma asong oche ma kw'idik-tạma n'idaak anạng mba sisi. <verse eid="EXO 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 32:23" />Abẹma bọ aben-m bẹ́, ‘Si akha nạng mạna p'm'atima mạna eden. De n'ode oyoyanẹ nwọ Mosẹs kw'utim mạna ubina k'Ijip, kw'kk'utia okhebh-ẹ kha kánsong e.’ <verse eid="EXO 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 32:24" />Ma wọ mbeni bẹ bẹ́, ‘Ọnạng kwidede kw'ọkhaam akkạra p'gol, tte ọwạra.’ Ma wọ abẹ awạra anạng-m, ndira pyẹ nge k'ekpon. Ma wọ ọkha mvama uyin e!”<verse eid="EXO 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 32:25" />Mosẹs ukwu ose bẹ́, anạng mbọ n'asi idindingi-dik, ọttạra bẹ́, Aarọn kk'bẹ ọbọhk uttia abẹ attena aseng eden, tạrr akwẹ n'ode ọsamma-dik ọnạng awawunanạng pabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 32:26" />Ma wọ Mosẹs obe k'ẹbaakhama k'ibyibhingasẹ oben bẹ́, “Ọnạng kwidede kw'obe Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi abẹ, tte ukwu otor-m.” Ma wọ aLẹvi phyibh ammunu ator-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 32:27" />Mosẹs oben bẹ bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl obeni bẹ́, ‘Tte ọnạng-ọnạng ọkpa ọkkangkkang-kkro kwẹ k'irin, osenga ofona ororo, ọkpa nnạm-nnạm ma ibyibhingasẹ, tạma k'echo jạnẹ kpira k'echo njọkha. Tte ọnạng-ọnạng ọfhọ nwọkka kwẹ, ọttạra oyok-ikhaana kwẹ, ọttạra oyok-ọbaanga kwẹ.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 32:28" />ALẹvi asi oche kw'Mosẹs obeni bẹ, anạng nnọhna nsenọfa ukuma arạbh jobh bọ ape ma iwu njọ.<verse eid="EXO 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 32:29" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs obeni bẹ bẹ́, “Chemma, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'bạnga otekha, ukwuru s'abạnga nạn iva ọttạra ivotte pabạnga nájọkha, ẹma kk'bạnga udia ma iwu ch'chemma.”<verse eid="EXO 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 32:30" />Masẹ iwu echobh, Mosẹs oben anạng mbọ bẹ́, “Abạnga kk'ipyibha chididen asia. Okhenka, amma m'nta k'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, nudusi m'nsi efokhu ch'm'ekpobhu mpyibha sabạnga.” <verse eid="EXO 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 32:31" />Ma wọ, Mosẹs ọkpa nnạm k'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, oben bẹ́, “Ipyibha ch'anạng mba asi kk'ẹbạra e! Abẹ kk'gol atima agwa akha anạng abẹma oyeni. <verse eid="EXO 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 32:32" />Totokhạn, khenka bina nạng mpyibha sabẹ, de nạn bẹ mábina anạng, pfhura eche chaam k'nnwẹr s'kk'akkẹra.”<verse eid="EXO 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 32:33" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọpọhna Mosẹs bẹ́, “Ọnạng kwidede kw'usi-m ipyibha wọ m'mpfhura eche chẹ k'nnwẹr saam. <verse eid="EXO 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 32:34" />Sọhng mantọmma, ata atima anạng mbọ eden afona k'ibyi s'wạra mkpaakh-ọ, itọhmọ saam m'ichi bạnga eden. Okhenka, de ukpir k'okpe kw'm'nnạng bẹ irem, amma m'nnạng bẹ irem k'mpyibha sabẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 32:35" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhmọ ọkhạkạmọ ọnạng anạng mbọ, ukwuru usisi kwabẹ, ọttạra ọkha mvọ f'okher ọbhaam-nwa kw'Aarọn kk'udwukha.<verse eid="EXO 32:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EXO 33" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 33:1" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Ọma ọttạra anạng p'atim abina k'Ijip, abina arik isisek nna. Abạnga afona k'isisek s'ntim ọyọhng kwaam nchekhi nnạng Abraham, ọttara Isaak, ọttạra Jekọb mben bẹ́, ‘Amma m'nnạng iva p'iva pabạnga isisek nna.’ <verse eid="EXO 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 33:2" />Amma m'ntọhm itọhmọ saam ichi bạnga eden, abạnga akhubh aKenaan, ọttạra Amọr, ọttạra aHet, ọttạra aPẹriz, ọttạra aHiv, ọmaana aJẹbus. <verse eid="EXO 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 33:3" />Asọhng k'isisek nnọ s'abasi ọttạra ọkhọhn asaabh-ọsaabh. Okhenka, amma bạnga abẹ mạ́ntwạn, ukwuru bẹ́, abạnga ade anạng p'asi idik-abhaang, nạngẹ bạnga nkwu mfhọ k'eden.”<verse eid="EXO 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 33:4" />Masẹ anạng mbọ abhaang ẹkkaabha-pyibha njọ, abẹ n'aning k'ikwosi, ọnạng kw'okke adạkhẹ ẹfanganẹ-kpo gạge kòde. <verse eid="EXO 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 33:5" />N'ode s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs obena bẹ́, “Kpaak anạng p'Israẹl bẹ́, ‘Abạnga asi idik-abhaang aseng eden. De wạra ntwạnọ bạnga abẹ mfona k'okpe nwa sạsạkhẹ, wạra kk'bạnga mfha. Awạra ọmaan f'abạnga, ọfha nsonga ọttọhk f'm'nsi ọttạra bạngama.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 33:6" />Mạ nna, anạng p'Israẹl awạra ẹphyanganẹ-kpo pyabẹ k'okpecho kw'Horẹb.<verse eid="EXO 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukkira kw'etobha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 33:7" />K'ibyibhingasẹ sidede s'anạng p'Israẹl, wa Mosẹs n'uttima ukkira k'ororo kw'ibyibhingasẹ nnọ, oyeri sẹ bẹ́, “Ukkira kw'etobha.” Ọnạng kwidede kw'ororu bẹ́, ọbạbh Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi udik, m'ofona k'ukkira kw'etobha kw'uning k'iyaan-iyaan kw'ibyibhingasẹ. <verse eid="EXO 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 33:8" />Okpe kwidede kw'Mosẹs ofon k'ukkira nwọ, anạng phyibh m'abina abe k'nnạmma k'ukkira kwabẹ, n'akkeri Mosẹs tạrr ọnwa k'ukkira nwọ ẹtaanga. <verse eid="EXO 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 33:9" />Masẹ Mosẹs ọnwa k'ukkira ẹtaanga, ebona m'ẹsạkha ebe udumudum, ikwu ininga ma ẹchọhmma s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi n'ọkpaak udik ọttạra Mosẹs. <verse eid="EXO 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 33:10" />Okpe kwidede kw'anạng mbọ ase s'ebona ebe k'ẹchọhmma ch'ukkira nwọ, abẹma mbọ phyibh m'abina abe k'ikpukpobha, ọnạng-ọnạng k'ẹchọhmma ch'ukkira kwẹ. <verse eid="EXO 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 33:11" />Wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi n'ọkpaak udik ọnạng Mosẹs ititikha ọttạra ititikha, masẹ ọnạng ọkpaakhẹ udik oyok-ikhaana kwẹ abẹ. Ma wọ, Mosẹs ọkpa nnạm ofona k'ibyibhingasẹ. Okhenka, Joshua, kw'ode udikkobh kw'n'ọtwạn abẹ, kw'ọbạra ode nnwa kw'Nun, uning ma s'uning ma k'ukkira.<verse eid="EXO 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mosẹs abạrada p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 33:12" />Mosẹs obeni Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Ọma oyeni, n'aben-m bẹ́, ntima anạng mba eden. Okhenka, khaam ọnạng tạm nátibha kw'm'ọtwạn abamẹ. Ọma kk'abena bẹ́, ‘Amma nsong eche mạma, ọma kk'ọphyaam pfaam atạkha.’ <verse eid="EXO 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 33:13" />De amma kk'ọphyaam ntạkha k'ititikha sọ, tibh-m nden sọ, ọfha nsong-ọ, mbạra nfona ororo ntạkha ọphyaam pfọ. Jima bẹ́, ẹkhạma nja ede anạng pọ.”<verse eid="EXO 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 33:14" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Amma oyeni m'ntwạn abọ amfona, mbạra nnạng-ọ ẹyọhngkwokha.”<verse eid="EXO 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 33:15" />Ma wọ Mosẹs ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “De ọma oyeni nạn mạna abẹ mátwạn amfona, mạna ọbọhk kátte ambina ma ibyi nna. <verse eid="EXO 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 33:16" />Ọnạng m'usi yạn osonga bẹ́, ettem erebh-ọ kha etena amma abẹ, ọttạra anạng pọ, de nạn mạna abẹ nátwạna? Bạng ọttọhk vọ m'ọkhọhkha bẹ́, amma ọttạra anạng pọ ankạmọ k'anạng mbọkha p'ọyagbin?”<verse eid="EXO 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 33:17" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ubhin Mosẹs bẹ́, “Amma m'nsi mvọ f'kk'aphyema, ukwuru bẹ́, ettem khaam erebha etena abọ, mbạra nsong-ọ k'eche.”<verse eid="EXO 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 33:18" />Ma o, Mosẹs ọbẹ́, “N'akhọhkh-m abạrada pọ khẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 33:19" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben bẹ́, “Amma m'nsi ajibhada paam phyi-phyibh achi bạnga eden kabạnga k'ititikha, amma m'mbạra nsi ẹyaakha ch'eche chaam, ch'ede Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, nnạng-ọ. Amma m'nkhaama ikwosi ntena ọnạng kw'ọdaakh-m bẹ́, nse-ẹ ikwosi, mbạra nsi ijibha nnạng ọnạng kw'ọdaakh-m bẹ́, nsi ijibha nnạng-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 33:20" />Okhenka, ọma ititikha saam mákke ase, ukwuru bẹ́, ọnạng kw'm'ose-m ọbạra uruk akpen kòde.”<verse eid="EXO 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 33:21" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni bẹ́, “Ọkhaam ibyi rạnẹ s'ibaang-m s'm'abe k'ẹtakpa. <verse eid="EXO 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 33:22" />Okpe kw'abạrada paam m'aseng, m'ntạkh-ọ nge k'ẹtakpa-mma, mbạra ntima ọbọhk kwaam mbubh-ọ tạrr nseng. <verse eid="EXO 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 33:23" />Masẹ m'ndira ọbọhk kwaam, m'ase nnạm saam mạnkkeni, okhenka, ititikha saam máse.”<verse eid="EXO 33:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EXO 34" />
  <para style="s">Atakpa abhapẹ p'abẹ akkẹrẹ nnyina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 34:1" />Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kkẹbh atakpa afa p'ade masẹ mbọkha p'echeden, amma m'mbạra nkkẹr idik nnọ s'uwa ining k'atakpa mbọ p'echeden p'avọhkhọ. <verse eid="EXO 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 34:2" />Do ifor k'ekpebha avura okpecho kw'Sinai. Khebh-m k'okpecho k'ẹrạng. <verse eid="EXO 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 34:3" />Tte ọnạng wạnọ wạnọ nạngẹ abọ ọtwạnọ ukwu, tte ọnạng nạngẹ k'ibyi sidede ma okpecho nwọ obe, ọbạra itirakpo byọ, tte nạngẹ asạsaarẹ ma okpecho nwọ ichi.”<verse eid="EXO 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 34:4" />Ma wọ Mosẹs ọkkẹbh atakpa afa p'ade masẹ mbọkha p'echeden, utima pyẹ kakhẹ k'mbọhk k'ekpebha uvura okpecho kw'Sinai, oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 34:5" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọsạk k'ebona, obe ọbaanga Mosẹs, ọnạng ẹyaakha ch'eche chẹ, ch'ede Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 34:6" />Oseng k'ororo kw'Mosẹs, ọnạng ẹyaakha bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ikwosi, ọttạra ọphyaam, kw'n'ọtạkha okpe brasẹ n'ọdwạkh-ẹ, kw'ọbạrẹ idạdaakha, ọttạra ichichera, <verse eid="EXO 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 34:7" />kw'n'ọkhọkha anạng nnọhna ibhikh-asong idạdaakha sẹ, ọbạra ubina ọnạng ọmmaana-pyibh, ọttạra ochokpọhkhọ, ọttạra ipyibha. Okhenka, ọnạng kw'iponga ipyibhi ọbọhk mótte, n'ọnạng iva pabẹ, ọttạra iva p'iva irem k'ẹkhọngkwuru ch'ab'otte, tạrr ukpira mgbọmma nttaan ọttạra nnebung.”<verse eid="EXO 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 34:8" />Mosẹs onnemeden ọrạkha echo k'ikpukpobha. <verse eid="EXO 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 34:9" />Oben bẹ́, “O Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, de ode bẹ́, amma kk'ọphyaam nkhaama kakhọ k'ititikha, tte ọma Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi atwạn mạna abẹ amfona. Ọbạra ode bẹ́, anạng mba ade anạng p'asi idikh-abhaang, bina nạng mạnna k'mpyibha s'amạna, abạra atạkha mạna masẹ anạng pọ.”<verse eid="EXO 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 34:10" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni bẹ́, “Amma n'ntạkha echekha ọma abẹ. Anạng pọ phyibh m'atima achen pabẹ ase ikkukkonadik s'm'nsi, s'nạn tạm nạ́nsia k'ẹkhạma jạnẹ jạnẹ k'iyagbin phyi-phyibh. Anạng mba p'arukhu abọ m'abạra asẹ idik s'ipe bẹ ifor s'amma Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi m'nsi nnạng bạnga. <verse eid="EXO 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 34:11" />Sạkha echo nạng idik s'mben-ọ bẹ́, asi chemma. Amma m'nkhubh anạng p'Amọr, ọttạra aKenaan, aHet, aPẹriz, aHiv, ọttạra aJẹbus. <verse eid="EXO 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 34:12" />Akker o, abạnga nạngẹ ẹgbagba akhaam ọttạra anạng mbọ p'arukhu ma isek nnọ s'abạnga n'afona o, deja, abạnga kk'ọmma kwididen arua achok abạngama oyeni e. <verse eid="EXO 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 34:13" />Abạnga avọhkhọ njabyi sabẹ, ọttạra ata p'akha pabẹ, abạnga abạra avọhkhọ mkpọmmachi s'Ashẹra pabẹ <verse eid="EXO 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 34:14" />Abạnga ọttọhk ọdwạkh-ọdwạk kákpobha, khiri Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'eche chẹ ede Ottemma, ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Ottemma.<verse eid="EXO 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 34:15" />“Akker o, abạnga nạngẹ ẹgbagba akhaam ọttạra anạng mbọ p'arukhu ma isek nnọ o, deja, masẹ abẹ m'asi isaasadik ọttạra akha pabẹ, bẹ́, abẹ afọhnọ nja anạng akha mbọ, abẹ m'abher bạnga obher bẹ́, abạnga ata achi ichiakpo py'abẹ atim afọhnọ nja. <verse eid="EXO 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 34:16" />De abạnga atạk aminava pabẹ anạng adikkobh pabạnga k'ọbada, okpe kw'aminava mbọ m'asenga ẹsasa anạng akha pabẹ, abẹ m'awọhkhọ adikkobh pabạnga ator bẹ asi ẹmmaana njọ jạnẹ.<verse eid="EXO 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 34:17" />“Abạnga akpatava kádwuk.<verse eid="EXO 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 34:18" />“Abạnga asi erobha ch'brẹd kw'abẹ nạn yist nágia k'iwu isenọfa, ator k'oche kw'kk'bạnga ntọhna. Abạnga asi oche ngwọ k'okpe kw'obaan bẹ́, abạnga asi, k'ophye kw'Abib, ukwuru bẹ́, ma ophye nwọ wọ kw'uwa abạnga abin k'Ijip.<verse eid="EXO 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 34:19" />“Iva p'ichedenfhạr sidede ade paam, ọttạra achedenva adimpẹ p'itirakpo phyibh, ode ọrạkhạmaan o, ọbạra ode mmaam. <verse eid="EXO 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 34:20" />Tima ọrạkhạmaan-nwa bhek ocheden-nwa kw'ẹnyạnyaang, okhenka, de nạn chẹ mábhek, phyạkhẹ chẹ ikhukhora. Bhek achedenva pabạnga phyibh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:20">“Tte ọnạng wạnọ wạnọ nạngẹ mbọhk-mbọhk ukwu obe-m k'ititikha.<verse eid="EXO 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 34:21" />“Abạnga asi ọtọhm k'iwu isajạnẹ, okhenka, abạnga akwokha ọyọhng k'iwu isenọfa. Ọbạra ode k'ọyabha-kpe kw'ekpo tutubh, ọttạra k'ọphyakpe, ọbaan bẹ́, abạnga akwokha ọyọhng.<verse eid="EXO 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 34:22" />“Abạnga asi Erobha ch'Iphya s'acheden-dwuk py'ekpo p'abạnga atubhu k'iwonu sabạnga, ọttạra Erobha ch'Iphya s'wit, ọttạra Erobha ch'Iphya s'ikpong nnạm k'cho. <verse eid="EXO 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 34:23" />Ọbaan bẹ́, ajunung pabạnga phyi-phyibh ayin k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa, kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl, nden nttaan k'chọ. <verse eid="EXO 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 34:24" />Amma m'nkhubh nkhạma k'abạnga s'ining kabạnga k'ititikha, mbạra mmaama nnem sabạnga. K'okpe kw'abạnga m'akwu k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga ma nden nnọ nttaan s'icho, ọnạng kw'm'okkeri isisek sabạnga ichen kòde.<verse eid="EXO 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 34:25" />“Abạnga khaam isẹ s'ibin k'ẹjafọhna ch'ibin k'ọttọhk fidede f'ọkhaam yist kánạng, abạnga kábạra achera bẹ́, eten jạnẹ jạnẹ ch'ẹjafọhna ch'Erobha ch'Pasova ininga tạrr iwu echobha.<verse eid="EXO 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 34:26" />“Atạkha acheden-dwuk akkapẹ k'isek sabạnga, akwu k'ọchọhm kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ubinọkpaabyi kwabạnga. Abạnga abasi p'ivu kátima awọhn uvunwa.”<verse eid="EXO 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 34:27" />Ma wọ Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kkẹr idik nna, ukwuru bẹ́, kk'echekha ntạkha ọma amma abẹ, ọttạra anạng p'Israẹl ntor ma idik nna.” <verse eid="EXO 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 34:28" />Wa Mosẹs uning Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi abẹ k'nnyawu arạbh-afa, ọttạra nnunguwu arạbh afa, uchiattọhk núchia, asi nọ́bạra ugwua. Ọkkẹrẹ idik s'Echekha ch'Nnyina Jobh ma atakpa mbọ.<verse eid="EXO 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ititikha s'Mosẹs inn-ọnna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 34:29" />Masẹ Mosẹs ọsạk k'okpecho kw'Sinai, ọttạra atakpa mbọ afa p'Echekha ch'Nnyina kakhẹ k'mbọhk, kósong bẹ́ ititikha sẹ n'inn-ọnna, ukwuru s'kk'idik ọkpaakha ọttạra Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 34:30" />Okpe kw'Aarọn ọttạra anạng p'Israẹl n'ase Mosẹs, s'ititikha sẹ n'inn-ọnna, ojora bẹ bẹ́, abẹ asenga abaang-ẹ k'ifor. <verse eid="EXO 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 34:31" />Okhenka, Mosẹs oyeri bẹ, Aarọn ọttạra adecho phyi-phyibh p'ofhon akpa nnạm ator-ẹ, ọkpaak bẹ idik. <verse eid="EXO 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 34:32" />Oyongu ma, anạng p'Israẹl phyibh asenga abaang-ẹ, ọkpaak bẹ nnyina phyi-phyibh s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ẹ ọnạnga k'okpecho kw'Sinai.<verse eid="EXO 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 34:33" />Masẹ Mosẹs kk'bẹ idik nnọ ọkpaakha phyibh, ọtạkha ẹvạrakpa ububha ititikha sẹ. <verse eid="EXO 34:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 34:34" />Okhenka, okpe kwidede kw'Mosẹs m'uyin Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi k'ititikha bẹ́, ọkpaak abẹ idik, m'owonga ẹvạrakpa njọ k'ititikha. Okpe kw'm'uyin k'iyaan ukwu ọkpaak anạng p'Israẹl idik s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ẹ ọkpaakha, <verse eid="EXO 34:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 34:35" />anạng p'Israẹl ase bẹ́, ititikha sẹ n'inna <char style="it">bẹ́ yenga-yenga-yenga</char>. Ma wọ, Mosẹs n'ọtạk ẹvạrakpa ububha k'ititikha tạrr ukpira k'okpe kw'm'ọbạra ọnwa kha bẹ́, ọta ọkpaak udik ọttạra Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 34:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EXO 35" />
  <para style="s">Nnyina s'Ẹyọhngkwokha-wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 35:1" />Mosẹs oyeri etobha ch'anạng p'Israẹl phyibh, oben bẹ bẹ́, “Maa wọ ode idik s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'bạnga obena bẹ́, abạnga asi: <verse eid="EXO 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 35:2" />Abạnga m'asi ọtọhm k'iwu isajạnẹ, okhenka, iwu ch'ettong isenọfa m'ede iwu ch'awurada, ch'ede Ẹyọhngkwokhawu ẹnạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Ọnạng kwidede kw'usi ọtọhm ma iwu njọ, ọbaan bẹ́, abẹ afhẹ-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 35:3" />Abạnga ekpon k'ibyirukhasẹ sidede kámuma ma Ẹyọhngkwokhawu njọ.”<verse eid="EXO 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnạnga s'anạng asi ibyiningasẹ s'Ubinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 35:4" />Mosẹs ọkpaakhẹ anạng p'Israẹl phyi-phyibh bẹ, “Ma wọ ode oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'obena bẹ́, abạnga asi: <verse eid="EXO 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 35:5" />Arengi ẹnạnga k'ekpo p'abạnga akhaam, anạng Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ẹnạnga. Ọnạng kwidede kw'ọdaakh-ẹ, tte utima ẹnạnga ch'gol, ọttạra ch'asilva, ọttạra ch'brons, okkena Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi; <verse eid="EXO 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 35:6" />ọttạra ndikhi s'ide blu, ọttạra ikhor-ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhor-isisẹ, ọttara ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok, ọttara avu-phyạbha; <verse eid="EXO 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 35:7" />ọttạra atenkpa p'arạkhạmaan-dim p'abẹ afokhu asi-khora, ọttạra atenkpa p'mvu, ọttạra mkpaakha s'akasiya, <verse eid="EXO 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 35:8" />ọttạra ana p'oliv p'ekpon eyenachẹ, ọttạra ekpo py'erebh iruk py'abẹ n'atima asi ana py'abẹ n'abyenga ọnạng k'echo, ọttạra insẹns kw'orebhi iruk; <verse eid="EXO 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 35:9" />ọttạra ata p'oniks, ọttạra ata adwạkh-ọdwạk p'abạnga m'akpạna k'ẹphọd, ọttạra k'ẹvạrakpa ch'ittemmạma.<verse eid="EXO 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 35:10" />“Tte ammenkka-nạng phyi-phyibh p'aning kabạnga k'ikhaana, ayin akwu, akwu asi ọttọhk fidede f'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'mạna obena bẹ́, ansi: <verse eid="EXO 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 35:11" />ibyirukhasẹ nnọ, ọttạra ukkira kwẹ, ọttạra ipakhọnga sẹ, ọttạra mkpaakha sẹ, ọttạra nchi s'ẹchọhmma, ọttạra nsemachi, ọttạra mkpọmmachi, ọttạra nnạna sẹ; <verse eid="EXO 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 35:12" />ọttạra Ikwukwur s'Echekha, ọttạra nsemachi sẹ, ọttạra ikwukwurkpa ch'efokhu, ọttạra ichọhmma-vạra s'm'ikpa sẹ ẹmaana k'ẹtaanga, <verse eid="EXO 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 35:13" />ọttạra okpokkro, ọttạra nsemachi sẹ, ọttạra ekpo phyi-phyibh py'ẹnạn ma, ọttạra brẹd kw'awurada, <verse eid="EXO 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 35:14" />ọttạra itukkạng-chi ch'ekpon yiyeni, ọttạra ekpo pyẹ, ọttạra attukkạng, ọttạra ana p'ekpon yiyeni, <verse eid="EXO 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 35:15" />ọttạra ijabyi s'insẹns, ọttạra nsemachi sẹ, ọttạra ana p'abẹ n'abyenga ọnạng k'echo, ọttạra insẹns kw'orebhi iruk, ọttạra ivạra s'ẹchọhmma ch'ibyirukhasẹ; <verse eid="EXO 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 35:16" />ọttạra ijabyi s'ẹnạnga ẹkkạmachẹ, ọttạra itegba sẹ s'brons, ọttạra nsemachi sẹ, ọttạra ekpo pyẹ phyibh, ọttạra ọgbangbang kw'brons, ọttạra ẹnạna chẹ, <verse eid="EXO 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 35:17" />ọttạra ọvạra f'eterttem, ọttạra mkpọmmachi, ọttạra nnạna sẹ, ọttạra ọvạra f'ọmmakhubh kw'eterttem; <verse eid="EXO 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 35:18" />ọttạra abhik py'ibyirukhasẹ, ọttạra p'eterttem, ọttạra ndikhi sabẹ, <verse eid="EXO 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 35:19" />ọttạra nnya iyokhasẹ s'ọtọhm f'ọtọhm kw'awurada, s'ide nnya s'awurada s'Aarọn kw'ode ọfọhnẹja, ọttạra nnya s'ajunungva pẹ m'age k'okpe kw'abẹ m'asi ọtọhm masẹ afọhnẹja.”<verse eid="EXO 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 35:20" />Ma wọ, anạng p'Israẹl phyibh abin arik Mosẹs. <verse eid="EXO 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 35:21" />Ọnạng kwidede kw'ọdaakh-ẹ, kw'ọbạra uttum-ẹ k'ettem, utim ẹnạnga okkena Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, k'oche kw'ọtọhm f'ukkhira kw'etobha, ọttạra f'nnya s'awurada m'ofona ororo. <verse eid="EXO 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 35:22" />Anạng phyi-phyibh, ajunung ọttạra ipanạng p'ubin bẹ k'nttem, atim ẹnya-kpo, k'ukhira-k'ukhira py'abẹ atim gol asi, py'ede abaangakpa, ọttạra akkạra py'itọhng ọttạra mbaanga s'nnọhna, ọttạra ọmaan f'ẹdwạngọ, akwu. Abẹma phyibh atim agol pabẹ akwu, masẹ ẹnạnga ch'ẹbạrẹ udik akkena Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 35:23" />Ọnạng kwidede kw'ọkhaam ndikhi s'ide blu, ọttạra s'ikhor-ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhor-isisẹ, ode ndikhi sabẹ ayokh-oyok o, ọbạra ode avu-phyạbha o, ode atenkpa p'ẹrạkhạmaan-dim p'abẹ afokhi asi-khora o, ọbạra ode atenkpa p'mvu o, utim ukwu. <verse eid="EXO 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 35:24" />Ayok p'atim ẹnạnga ch'asilva, ọbạra ode ch'brons, abẹ atim akkena Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi. Ọnạng kwidede kw'ọkhaam mkpaakha s'akasiya, sabẹ m'akke atima asi ọtọhm fidede, ọbạra utima ukwu. <verse eid="EXO 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 35:25" />Ommengkka-kwanạng kwidede utim mbọhk sẹ oyok ọttọhk, utima ọttọhk f'kk'oyokha f'ode blu, ọttạra f'ode ichicho, ọttạra f'ode isisẹ, ọttạra ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok, ukwu. <verse eid="EXO 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 35:26" />Ipanạng phyibh p'ubin bẹ k'nttem, p'abạra akke emengkka ch'ekpo yuyok, ayokhu avu-phyạbha. <verse eid="EXO 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 35:27" />Adecho atima ata p'oniks, ọttạra ata-khira adwạkh-ọdwạk p'abẹ m'akpạna k'ẹphọd, ọttạra k'ẹvạrakpa ch'ittemmạma, akwu. <verse eid="EXO 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 35:28" />Abẹ abạra atima ekpo py'n'isi ọttọhk orebh iruk, ọttạra ana p'oliv p'ekpon yiyeni, ọttạra ana p'abẹ n'abyenga ọnạng k'echo, ọttạra insẹns kw'n'orebh iruk, akwu. <verse eid="EXO 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 35:29" />Anạng p'Israẹl phyibh, ajunung ọttạra ipanạng p'ubin bẹ k'nttem, atim nnạnga s'ibin bẹ k'nttem, akkena Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, k'ọtọhm f'kk'osenga k'Mosẹs oben bẹ bẹ́, abẹ asi.<verse eid="EXO 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bẹzalẹl ọttara Oholiyab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 35:30" />Ma wọ Mosẹs obeni anạng p'Israẹl bẹ́, “Akker e, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Bẹzalẹl, kw'ode ujunungnwa kw'Uri, kw'ode nnwa kw'Hur, kw'ubin k'ẹkhạma ch'Juda, orenga e. <verse eid="EXO 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 35:31" />Ẹma Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ẹ Iguguma sẹ ọnạnga, ọttạra esonga, ọttạra ọyanttaana, ọttạra idik-songa, ọttạra emmengkka-khira chidede, <verse eid="EXO 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 35:32" />ọfha usi ommengkka-tọhm f'gol, ọttạra f'silva, ọttạra f'brons, <verse eid="EXO 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 35:33" />ọttạra bẹ́, n'ọkkẹbh ata otobha, ọttạra nchi gwạgwa, ọbạra usi ommengkka-tọhm f'emmengkka k'ukhira k'ukhira. <verse eid="EXO 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 35:34" />Kk'Bẹzalẹl ọttạra Oholiyab kw'ode ujunungnwa kw'Ahisamak, kw'ubin k'efona ch'Dan, itina ọnạnga bẹ́, abẹ akpebhi anạng adwạkh-ọdwạk mmengkka sabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 35:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 35:35" />Kk'bẹ emmengkka ch'ommengkka-tọhm k'ukhira k'ukhira ọnạnga, m'asẹ ammengkka, ọttạra adokh-ọvạra, ọttạra adokh-ọvạra f'ode blu, ọttạra f'okhor-ichicho, ọttạra f'okhor-isisẹ, ọttạra ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok, ọttara ayokh-ekpo phyi-phyibh. Abẹma mbọ phyibh m'ade abaro p'emmengkka, ọttạra abaro p'ekpo dudokhu.<verse eid="EXO 35:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EXO 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 36:1" />“Ma wọ, wa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Bẹzalẹl ọttạra Oholiyab, ọttạra ommengkka-nạng kwidede emmengkka ọttạra esonga ch'ọtọhm fidede f'ibyi s'awurada sisi ọnạnga. Anạng mbọ bọ m'asi ọtọhm mvọ ator k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'bẹ ọtọhna.”<verse eid="EXO 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 36:2" />Ma wọ Mosẹs oyeri Bẹzalẹl ọttạra Oholiyab, ọttạra ammengkka-nạng phyi-phyibh p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'itina ọnạnga, ọttạra anạng p'ubin bẹ k'nttem bẹ́, abẹ akwu asi ọtọhm mvọ. <verse eid="EXO 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 36:3" />Wa abẹ atạk nnạnga phyibh s'anạng p'Israẹl kk'atima akwu k'mbọhk s'Mosẹs, ọfha abẹ atima asi ọtọhm f'ibyi s'awurada. Wa k'ekpebhawu chidede, anạng mbọ afon ororo atima nnạnga s'ibin bẹ k'nttem akwu. <verse eid="EXO 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 36:4" />Ma wọ, ammengkka-nạng mbọ phyibh p'n'asi ọtọhm mvọ f'ọchọhm kw'awurada abin arik itọhm sabẹ, <verse eid="EXO 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 36:5" />akwu aben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Ẹtọhmkpo py'nạng kk'anạnga ma, kk'ẹsaabha ẹyọhnga ọtọhm f'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhnọ mạna bẹ́, ansi e.”<verse eid="EXO 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 36:6" />Ma wọ Mosẹs ọnạngẹ ẹfa, abẹ awon ẹmạng k'ibyibhingasẹ <char style="it">bẹ́ wạmm</char>, aben bẹ́, “Tte ujunung kwidede, oseng ikwanạng, ukuma ẹnạnga chidede nạnạng ch'eten k'ọchọhm kw'awurada sisi.” Osenga ma, n'ọkpa bẹ bẹ́, abẹ nạngẹ adạkhẹ ẹtọhmkpo atim akwu, <verse eid="EXO 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 36:7" />ukwuru bẹ́, ekpo py'abẹ kk'atima akwu kk'ẹsaabha ẹyọhnga itọhm phyibh sabẹ m'asi.<verse eid="EXO 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibyirukhasẹ s'Ubinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 36:8" />Ammengkka phyi-phyibh k'ikhaana s'atọhmnạng mbọ atim ọvạra f'ẹchọhmma jobh f'abẹ atim ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok asi. Wa abẹ atim ndikhi s'ide blu, ọttạra s'ikhoru ichicho, ọttạra s'ide isisẹ, asi ibyirukhasẹ nnọ, abẹ attạra achẹrubim ma. <verse eid="EXO 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 36:9" />Ọvạra mvọ phyibh f'ẹchọhmma ode obengana, adum ade ntwạkhọ arạbh afa ukuma mfa, ẹkpa ede ntwạkhọ nsajạnẹ. <verse eid="EXO 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 36:10" />Abẹ atạk ọvạra osen atọhnga ibyi rạnẹ, abẹ atạkha adạkhẹ mvọkha osen asi ukhira ngwọ gwạnọ. <verse eid="EXO 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 36:11" />Ma wọ, abẹ asi ager p'ade blu k'ammakpa p'ivạra s'ẹchọhmma njọ jạnẹ ch'abẹ kk'atọhnga, abẹ asi adạkhẹ ukhira ngwọ gwạnọ k'ivạra nnọkha sabẹ kk'atọhnga. <verse eid="EXO 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 36:12" />Abẹ asi ager arạbh afa ukuma jobh akpạna k'ivạra s'ẹchọhmma nnọ rạnẹ sabẹ kk'atọhnga, abẹ akpạna adạkhẹ ager arạbh afa ukuma jobh k'ivạra s'ẹchọhmma nnọkha sabẹ kk'atọhnga. <verse eid="EXO 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 36:13" />Ma wọ, abẹ atim gol asi mkpạkha arạbh afa ukuma jobh, atima avạkha ọvạra mvọ ọfa f'abẹ kk'atọhnga ibyi rạnẹ, ọfha ibyirukhasẹ nnọ ide rạnẹ.<verse eid="EXO 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 36:14" />Abẹ atim avu-phyạbha asi ọvạra f'ẹchọhmma jobhkawạnọ, abubha k'ẹrạng-ẹrạng kw'ibyirukhasẹ. <verse eid="EXO 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 36:15" />Ọvạra f'ẹchọhmma mvọ jobhkawạnọ phyi-phyibh ode obengana, adum ade ntwạkhọ ẹrạbh afa ukuma nsen, ẹkpa ede ntwạkhọ nsajạnẹ. <verse eid="EXO 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 36:16" />Abẹ atạk ọvạra f'ẹchọhmma osen atọhnga ibyi rạnẹ, abẹ atạkha adạkhẹ mvọkha ọsajạnẹ atọhnga ibyi rạnẹ. <verse eid="EXO 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 36:17" />Ma wọ, abẹ asi ager arạbh afa ukuma jobh akpạna k'ivạra s'ẹchọhmma njọ jạnẹ ch'abẹ kk'atọhnga, abẹ akpạna adạkhẹ ager arạbh afa ukuma jobh k'ivạra s'ẹchọhmma nnọkha sabẹ kk'atọhnga. <verse eid="EXO 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 36:18" />Ma wọ abẹ atim brons asi mkpạkha arạbh afa ukuma jobh atima avạkha ukkira ngwọ, k'ibyi rạnẹ. <verse eid="EXO 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 36:19" />Ma wọ abẹ atim atenkpa p'arạkhạmaan p'abẹ afokhu asi-khora abubha ukkira ngwọ, bạrasẹ abẹ atima adạkhẹ atenkpa p'mvu abubha k'ẹrạng-ẹrạng.<verse eid="EXO 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 36:20" />Abẹ atim ichi ch'akasiya asi nsemachi s'ibe obe k'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 36:21" />Adum p'esemachi chidede ede ntwạkhọ chi, ẹkpa chẹ ede ẹtwạkhọ ọmaana ibhaakha, <verse eid="EXO 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 36:22" />abẹ abạra asi acho afa p'ade obengana, abạra akkeri ayok ititikha. Wa abẹ abạra asi nsemachi phyi-phyibh s'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ ukhira ngwọ gwạnọ. <verse eid="EXO 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 36:23" />Abẹ asi nsemachi ẹrạbh s'ikkeri k'ẹrạkh-ẹrạkha kw'ibyirukhasẹ s'Ubinọkpaabyi, <verse eid="EXO 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 36:24" />wa abẹ abạra atima silva asi nnạna arạbh afa age k'isekhisek kwabẹ, esemachi chidede ẹkhaam nnạna mfa, echo chidede k'ẹnạna chẹ. <verse eid="EXO 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 36:25" />K'ibir-ibir kw'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ, abẹ asi nsemachi ẹrạbh, <verse eid="EXO 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 36:26" />ọttạra nnạna s'silva arạbh afa, nnạna mfa k'isekhisek kw'esemachi chidede. <verse eid="EXO 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 36:27" />K'nnạm-nnạm kw'ibyirukhasẹ, k'ukhubha kw'ududon n'udimi, abẹ asi nsemachi nsajạnẹ, <verse eid="EXO 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 36:28" />ọttạra nsemachi mfa k'nnwyạnga s'nnạm-nnạm kw'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 36:29" />Ma nnwyạnga nnọ mfa, abẹ agbạk nsemachi s'ikher ayok ọgbạkha, tạma k'isekhisek tạrr ukpira k'ẹrạng-ẹrạng; abẹ age sẹ k'uriringi wạno. <verse eid="EXO 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 36:30" />Ma wọ, wa ode nsemachi nsenọttaan, ọttạra nnạna s'silva chikawạnọ, nnạna mfa k'esemachi jạnẹ.<verse eid="EXO 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 36:31" />Abẹ atim ichi ch'akasiya asi nsemachi, abe atima nsen asi ammakhubh k'ukhubha gwạnọ kw'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ, <verse eid="EXO 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 36:32" />nsen k'ukhubha ngwọkha, nsen k'mkpọmmachi s'ammakhubh p'ukhubha kw'ududon n'udimi k'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 36:33" />Abẹ asi esemachi k'ottemkwẹ tạma k'echo jạnẹ tạạr ẹvạkha k'echo njọkha k'ottemkwẹ kw'mkpọmmachi. <verse eid="EXO 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 36:34" />Abẹ atim gol afhạrọ mkpọmmachi nnọ, abạra atima gol asi ariringi p'avạk nsemachi nnọ. Bạra abẹ n'atim gol afhạrọ sẹ phyibh.<verse eid="EXO 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 36:35" />Abẹ atim ndikhi s'ide blu, ọttạra s'ikhor-ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhor-isisẹ, ọttạra ndikhi ọkkọkka sabẹ ayokh-oyok ma ivạra s'ẹchọhmma nnọ, ọttạra k'achẹrubim p'ommengkka-nạng usi. <verse eid="EXO 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 36:36" />Abẹ atim ichi ch'akasiya asi mkpọmmachi s'ivạra s'ẹchọhmma nnọ, abẹ atima gol afhạrọ sẹ. Abẹ atima gol asi mkpạkha s'mkpọmmachi nnọ, abẹ atima gol afhạrọ sẹ, abẹ abạra atima silva asi nnạna sabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 36:37" />Abẹ atim ndikhi s'ide blu, ọttạra s'ikhor-ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhor-isisẹ, ọttạra ndikhi ọkkọkka sabẹ ayokh-oyok, f'ode ọbọhktọhm f'odokh-ọvạra. <verse eid="EXO 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 36:38" />Wa abẹ abạra asi mkpọmmachi nsen ọttạra mkpạkha sabẹ. Abẹ atima gol afhạrọ acho p'mkpọmmachi nnọ, ọttạra avạrakpa pabẹ, abẹ atima adạkhẹ brons asi nnạna nsen sabẹ.<verse eid="EXO 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EXO 37" />
  <para style="s">Ikwukwur s'echekha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 37:1" />Wa Bẹzalẹl utim ichi ch'akasiya usi Ikwukwur s'Echekha. Adum pẹ ade ntwạkhọ nttaan ọmaana akpamma sọwạnọ, ẹkpa chẹ ede ntwạkhọ mfa ọmaana akpamma attaan, ebe chẹ ede ntwạkhọ mfa ọmaana akpamma attaan. <verse eid="EXO 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 37:2" />Utima gol ọkkọkka ọfhạrọ sẹ k'ẹtaanga ọttạra k'iyaan, ọbạra ọbạnga gol ọbaak sẹ ọbaabh-ọbaabha. <verse eid="EXO 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 37:3" />Utima gol usi ariringi annebung, oge k'mfhok s'ikwukwur nnọ, ariringi afa k'ukhubha gwạnọ, afa k'ukhubha ngwọkha. <verse eid="EXO 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 37:4" />Utima ichi ch'akasiya usi nsemachi, ọbạra utima gol ọfhạrọ sẹ. <verse eid="EXO 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 37:5" />Oge nsemachi nnọ k'ariringi p'aning k'akhaan-ọkhaan p'ikwukwur nnọ, ọfha abẹ n'avạkha ma adira sẹ. <verse eid="EXO 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 37:6" />Utima gol ọkkọkka usi ikwukwurkpa ch'efokhu, ch'adum pẹ ade ntwạkhọ nttaan ọmaana akpamma sọwạnọ, ẹkpa chẹ ede ntwạkhọ mfa ọmaana akpamma attaan. <verse eid="EXO 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 37:7" />Ma wọ utim gol udwuk achẹrubim ochok k'ikpicho kw'ikwukwurkpa njọ. <verse eid="EXO 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 37:8" />Usi ochẹrub wạnọ ochok k'echo jạnẹ, ọbạra usi ọdwạkh-ọdwạk ochok k'echo njọkha; usi apyẹ ede ukhira gwạnọ ọttạra ikwukwurkpa ch'efokhu. <verse eid="EXO 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 37:9" />Wa achẹrubim mbọ ammaam abạbaang pabẹ k'ẹrạng abubha ma ikwukwurkpa njọ ch'efokhu. Acherubim mbọ aning akkeri ayok ititikha ma ikwukwurkpa njọ k'ẹrạng.<verse eid="EXO 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okpokkro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 37:10" />Abe atim mkpaakha s'akasiya asi okpokkro nwọ. Adum pẹ ade ntwạkhọ nttaan, ẹkpa chẹ ede, ebe chẹ ede ntwạkhọ nttaan. <verse eid="EXO 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 37:11" />Abe atim okpokhagọgọ ọkkọkka afhạrọ okpokro nwọ, abẹ abạra abạnga okpokhagọgọ afhạrọ ammakpa phyibh. <verse eid="EXO 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 37:12" />K'ọkhaan-ọkhaan abẹ age ammakpa akpira masẹ ẹbọhkpattem, abẹ abạnga okpokhagọgọ atim afhạrọ. <verse eid="EXO 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 37:13" />Abẹ arạbha gol atima asi ariringi annebung p'okpokkro nwọ, adạbh k'mfok nnebung s'okpokro nwọ uning. <verse eid="EXO 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 37:14" />Ariringi mbọma aning abaanga ammakpabem, ọfha abẹ avạkha nsemachi nnọ sabẹ m'atima m'atima adira okpokkro nwọ. <verse eid="EXO 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 37:15" />Wa abẹ atim mkpaakha s'akasiya asi nsemachi sabẹ m'atima adira okpokkro nwọ, abẹ atima adạkhẹ gol afhạrọ se.<verse eid="EXO 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 37:16" />Wa abẹ abạra atima gol ọkkọkka asi ekpo py'ining ma okpokro nwọ, masẹ agbangbang p'agbẹrẹ-ọgbẹrẹ, ọttạra p'edong-odong, ọttạra nsibin, ọttạra akpobhumbọhk py'abẹ n'atima abyenga atwuk p'ẹjafọhna.<verse eid="EXO 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utukkạng-nạnna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 37:17" />Abẹ adwuk okpokhagọgọ ọkkọkka atima asi ẹnạnna ch'uttukkạng, abẹ abạra asi ẹyạr ọttạra nchi sẹ; ọttạra akkọbh p'ayoyo, ọttạra agbạk, ọttạra ayoyo p'ade ukhira gwạnọ. <verse eid="EXO 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 37:18" />Etukkạng-chi njọ ẹkhaam abọkha asajạnẹ, k'akhaan-akhaan pẹ afa, attaan aning k'ukhubha gwạnọ, attaan aninga k'ukhubha ngwọkha.<verse eid="EXO 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 37:19" />Ma k'abọhkha mbọ, ẹbọkha chidede ẹkhaam nkọbh kw'okheri ayoyo p'ichi cha almọnd, attaan k'ebọkha jạnẹ, attaan k'ẹbọhkha njọkha. Abẹ ade ochegwạnọ ma abọkha mbọ asajạnẹ phyibh. <verse eid="EXO 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 37:20" />Itukkạng-chi njọ wa ẹkhaam akkọbh annebung p'ade masẹ agbo, ọtạra agbo p'kk'ammaama, ọttạra ayoyo p'almọnd. <verse eid="EXO 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 37:21" />Ogbo wạnọ uning k'isekhisek kw'abọhkha afa p'abin k'itukkạng-chi njọ. Ogbo nwọkha uninga k'isekhisek kw'abọhkha mbọkha afa. Ogbo kw'ottong attaan uning k'abọhkha p'attong attaan, p'asi abọhkha asajạnẹ phyi-phyibh. <verse eid="EXO 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 37:22" />Wa abẹ atim gol adwuk agbo ọttạra abọhkha p'ade ukhira gwạnọ ọttạra itukkạng-chi njọ ch'abẹ atim gol ọkkọkka adwuk.<verse eid="EXO 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 37:23" />Abẹ atim gol ọkkọkka asi attukkạng asenọfa, ọttạra afamgba p'atukkạng-dikhi kpạ-kpaara, ọttạra akoriya, ọttạra nsengakpa. <verse eid="EXO 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 37:24" />Abẹ atim talẹn wạnọ kw'gol ọkkọkka asi itukkạng-chi njọ, ọttạra ekpo pyẹ phyi-phyibh.<verse eid="EXO 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ijabyi s'insẹns</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 37:25" />Wa abẹ atim mkpaakha s'akasiya asi ijabyi s'insẹns. Ebe ọttạra ẹkpa chẹ ade obengana; adum pẹ ade ẹtwạkhọ jạnẹ ọmaana ibhaakha, ẹkpa chẹ ede ẹtwạkhọ jạnẹ ọmaana ibhaakha, ebe chẹ ede ntwạkhọ nttaan. Abẹ atima ichi njọ jạnẹ asi abhik pẹ.<verse eid="EXO 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 37:26" />Abẹ atim gol ọkkọkka afhạrọ eche-cho ọttạra k'ukhubha kwidede, abẹ atima adạkhẹ gol abạnga ammakpabem abaabha sẹ phyibh. <verse eid="EXO 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 37:27" />Wa abẹ atim gol asi ariringi afa ma ammakpabem, afa k'ukhubha gwạnọ, afa k'ukhubha ngwọkha, ọfha abẹ n'avạkha adira sẹ. <verse eid="EXO 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 37:28" />Abẹ atim ichi ch'akasiya asi nsemachi, abẹ atima gol afhạrọ sẹ.<verse eid="EXO 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 37:29" />Abẹ abạra asi ana p'awurada p'abẹ n'abyenga ọnạng k'echo, ọttạra insẹns ọkkakwẹ kw'orebhi iruk, kw'ode ọbọhktọhm f'ọnạng kw'n'usi ana.<verse eid="EXO 37:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EXO 38" />
  <para style="s">Ijabyi s'nnạnga ikkạmasẹ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 38:1" />Wa abẹ atim mkpaakha s'akasiya asi ijabyi s'ẹnạnga ẹkkạmachẹ. Adum pẹ ade ntwạkhọ nsenọfa ọmaana akhaana asajạnẹ, ẹkpa ede ntwạkhọ nsenọfa ọmaana akhaana asajạnẹ, ebe ede ntwạkhọ nnebung ọmaana akhaana asajạnẹ. Wa ijabyi nnọ ikhaam nnwyạnga nnebung. <verse eid="EXO 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 38:2" />Wa abẹ asi abhik k'nnwyạnga nnọ. Abẹ atima mkpaakha nnọ rạnẹ asi abhik mbọ annebung attạra ma ijabyi nnọ. Abẹ atim brons afhạrọ ijabyi nnọ phyi-phyibh. <verse eid="EXO 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 38:3" />Abẹ abạra atima brons asi ekpo pyẹ phyibh masẹ ọsọhkha, ọttạra asọvẹl, ọttạra agbangbaang, ọttạra agbumu p'akhaam asa attaan, ọttạra nsengakpa. <verse eid="EXO 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 38:4" />Abẹ ayok itegba s'ijabyi nnọ, abẹ atima brons ayok ibunu, achok k'isekhisek kw'itegba nnọ, ma ibhaang-ifa s'ijabyi nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 38:5" />Abẹ atim brons adwuk ariringi annebung py'avạk nsemachi s'nnwyạnga nnọ nnebung, s'itergba nnọ s'brons. <verse eid="EXO 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 38:6" />Abẹ atim mkpaakha s'akasiya agwa nsemachi, abẹ atima brons afhạrọ sẹ phyibh. <verse eid="EXO 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 38:7" />Wa abẹ anọhm nsemachi nnọ m'ariringi mbọ, ọfha asẹ ininga k'akhaan-ọkhaan p'ijabyi nnọ, ọfha abẹ n'avạkha ma adira. Abẹ asi ijabyi nnọ itto eje k'ottemkwẹ masẹ ikwukwur.<verse eid="EXO 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ọgbangbang kw'mbọhk ọttạra ntwạkhọ kpukpobhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 38:8" />Wa, abẹ atim abaakhubh p'ipanạng p'n'asi ọtọhm k'ẹchọhmma ch'ukkira kw'etobha, atima asi ẹgbangbangdim ch'opo, ọttạra ẹnạna chẹ.<verse eid="EXO 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eterttem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 38:9" />Wa, abẹ abạra asi eterttem. Ukhubha kw'ẹrạkh-ẹrạkha ode ntwạkhọ arạbh asenọfa ukuma jobh k'adum, ọbạra ọkhaama ọvạra f'ẹchọhmma f'abẹ atim ndikhi ikkasẹ ayok, <verse eid="EXO 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 38:10" />ọttạra ntumu ẹrạbh, ọttạra nnạna sabẹ atim brons asi, ẹrạbh, ọttạra ọbanna p'silva, ọttạra mvạrakpa s'mkpakha s'ẹtọhmma. <verse eid="EXO 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 38:11" />Ukhubha kw'ibir-ibira, ọbạra ode ntwạkhọ arạbh asenọfa ukuma jobh k'adum, ọbạra ọkhaama mkpọmmachi ẹrạbh, ọttạra nnạna sabẹ atim brons asi, ẹrạbh, ọttạra mkpạkha s'silva, ọttạra mvạrakpa s'mkpọmmachi. <verse eid="EXO 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 38:12" />Ukhubha kw'ẹchọkha-dudon, adum pẹ m'ede ntwạkhọ arạbh-attaan ukuma chi k'ẹkpa, ọkhaam ọvạra f'ẹchọhmma, ọttạra mkpọmmachi jobh, ọttạra nnạna jobh p'brons ọttạra mkpạkha s'silva, ọttạra mvạrakpa s'mkpakha s'ẹtọhmma. <verse eid="EXO 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 38:13" />Ukhubha kw'okpebhadudon n'uyin, adum pẹ ede ntwạkhọ arạbh-attaan ukuma chi k'ẹkpa. <verse eid="EXO 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 38:14" />Wa, ọvạra f'ẹchọhmma f'ode ntwạkhọ ẹrạbh ọmaana ibhaakha k'adum, ining k'ukhubha gwạnọ kw'ẹchọhmma, ọttạra mkpọmmachi nttaan, ọttạra nnạna attaan. <verse eid="EXO 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 38:15" />Ọvạra f'ẹchọhmma f'ode ntwạkhọ ẹrạbh ọmaana ibhaakha k'adum, igba ininga k'ukhubha ngwọkha kw'ẹchọhmma ch'eterttem, ibạra ẹkhama mkpọmmachi nttaan, ọttạra nnạna attaan.<verse eid="EXO 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 38:16" />Wa, abẹ atim ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok, asi ọvạra f'nchọhmma phyi-phyibh abaabha eterttem. <verse eid="EXO 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 38:17" />Wa abẹ atim brons asi nnạna p'mkpọmmachi nnọ. Abẹ abạra atima silva asi mkpạkha, ọttạra mvạrakpa s'mkpommachi. Abẹ atima silva asi afhạrọ pabẹ, ma wọ, mkpọmmachi nnọ phyibh s'eterttem n'ikhaam mvạrakpa s'silva. <verse eid="EXO 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 38:18" />Wa, ivạra s'ẹchọhmma s'eterttem njọ ide blu-blu, ọttạra okhor-ichicho, ọttạra okhor-isisẹ, ọttạra ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-ayok, f'ode ọbọhktọhm f'odokh-ọvạra. Wa, asẹ ide ntwạkhọ ẹrạbh ukuma jobh k'adum, masẹ ivạra s'ẹchọhmma s'eterttem s'ide ntwạkhọ nsenọfa ọmaana ibhakha k'ebe, <verse eid="EXO 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 38:19" />ọttạra mkpọmmachi nnebung, ọttạra nnạna annebung p'brons. Abẹ atim silva asi mkpạkha, ọttạra mvạrakpa sabẹ, abẹ atima silva afhạrọ acho pabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 38:20" />Wa abẹ atim brons asi abhing p'ukkira nnọ s'ibyirukhasẹ, ọttạra eterttem phyi-phyibh.<verse eid="EXO 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ẹtọhmkpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 38:21" />Ma wọ ode ubhik kw'ekpo py'abẹ atim asi ibyirukhasẹ, ikwukwur nnọ s'inyina ining, k'oche kw'uwa Mosẹs obeni anạng p'Lẹvi, p'uwa aning k'isekhisek kw'ẹfa ch'Itamar bẹ, abẹ akkẹr. Itamar wa, ode ujunungnwa kw'Aarọn, kw'ode ọfọhnẹja. <verse eid="EXO 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 38:22" />Bẹzalẹl kw'ode ujunungnwa kw'Uri, Uri kw'ode ujunungnwa kw'Hur, Hur kw'ubin k'ẹkhạma ch'Juda, usi oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs ọtọhna bẹ, usi. <verse eid="EXO 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 38:23" />Ọnạng ọdwak-ọdwạk kw'uwa ọttạr ma, ode Oholiyab, kw'ode nnwa kw'Ahisamak kw'ubin k'ẹkhạma ch'Dan. Oholiyab nwọ, wa ode ommenkkanạng, ọttạra odokh-ekpo, ọttạra odokh-ọvạra pf'abẹ atim ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok, ibạra ikkẹr ukhira kw'ode blu-blu, ọttạra ukhira kw'okhoru ichicho, ọttạra p'akhoru isisẹ. <verse eid="EXO 38:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 38:24" />Nnạnga s'gol s'uwa abẹ atim asi ọtọhm f'ibyirukhasẹ s'Ubinọkpaabyi, phyi-pyibh wa ide atalẹn arạbh sọnajobh, ọttạra ashẹkẹl ẹnọhna ukuma arạbh chi-kawạnọ ukuma jobh ator k'ibyirukhasẹ s'awurada. <verse eid="EXO 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 38:25" />Silva p'uwa abẹ atạk k'ofhon k'okpe kw'anạng bhibhạk, ade atalẹn arạbh asen, ọttạra ashẹkẹl nnọna nnebung ukuma arạbh asen ukuma arạbh asenọnttaan ukuma chi, otor k'ochọhm kw'awurada kw'Ubinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 38:26" />Wa ode bẹka wạnọ, kw'ode shẹkẹl ibhakha k'ọnạng-k'ọnạng, otor k'shẹkẹl kw'ọchọhm kw'awurada. Wa ọnạng kwidede kw'ọttạr k'ubhik f'anạng mbọ, kw'abẹ kk'abhikha phyibh, tạma k'icho ẹrạbh usukuma, wa anạng phyibh pa kk'abenga bẹ, abẹ age ache pabẹ k'nnwẹr ade ajunung nnọhna arạbh asenọfa usukuma. <verse eid="EXO 38:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 38:27" />Wa, abẹ atim atalen arạbh asen p'silva asi nnọna s'ibyirukhasẹ, abẹ arena ivạra s'ẹchọhmma, abẹ atim atalẹn arạbh asen asi nnạna arạbh asen, ẹnạna chidede ichi talen wạnọ. <verse eid="EXO 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 38:28" />Wa, abẹ atim ashẹkẹl nnọna arạbh jobh ukuma arạbh attaan ukuma asen atima asi ọbaana s'ntumu nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 38:29" />Brons p'uwa abẹ atạbhẹ ikpir atalẹn bhik arạbh attaan ukuma jobh ọmaana ashẹkẹl nnọhna nsajạnẹ. <verse eid="EXO 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 38:30" />Wa, abẹ atim apo mbọ asi nnạna s'ẹchọhmma kw'ukkira kw'etobha kw'Ubinọkpaabyi, abẹ abạra atima pyẹ asi ijabyi nnọ sabẹ atim apo afhạrọ, ọttạra achikhuma, ọttạra ẹtọhmkpo pyidede p'ijabyi, <verse eid="EXO 38:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 38:31" />ọttạra arin p'eterttem, ọttạra ẹchọhmma chẹ, ọttạra abhing p'ukkira k'ibyirukhasẹ, ọttạra p'eterttem.<verse eid="EXO 38:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EXO 39" />
  <para style="s">Nnya s'afọhn-nja</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 39:1" />Wa abẹ atim ndikhi s'ide blu-blu, ọttạra s'ikhoru ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhoru isisẹ, ayok nnya s'ọtọhm s'ọfọhn-ẹja k'ibyirukhasẹ s'awurada. Abẹ abạra ayok nnya s'awurada anạng Aarọn, ator k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs ọtọhna.<verse eid="EXO 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ẹphọd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 39:2" />Wa abẹ atim ndikhi s'gol, ọttạra s'ide blu-blu, ọttạra s'ikhoru ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhoru isisẹ, ọttạra ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok, asi ẹphọd. <verse eid="EXO 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 39:3" />Abẹ adwuk agol-kpa p'awer-oweri, abạra akpaara pyẹ k'anaanga-k'anaanga, atima asi ndikhi s'ide blu-blu, ọttạra s'ikhoru ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhoru isisẹ, ọttạra ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok, kw'ode ọtọhmbọhk f'omengkka-nạng. <verse eid="EXO 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 39:4" />Wa abẹ asi avạrakpa afa k'nkkang ọkhaan-ọkhaan kw'ephọd, ọfha asẹ ivạkha ẹphọd ẹkpọhkhọ. <verse eid="EXO 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 39:5" />Udikhikpa kw'abẹ atim ndikhi s'gol, s'ide blu, ọttạra s'ikhoru ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhoru isisẹ, ọttạra mvạradikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok ayok, wa ode ọtọhm f'ommengkka-nạng. Wa ọbạra ode ukhira ngwọ gwạnọ ọttạra k'ẹphọd, otor k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs ọtọhna.<verse eid="EXO 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 39:6" />Abẹ abẹ ata p'oniks k'ẹnạna ch'gol, abẹ akkẹr ache p'iva p'Israẹl m'ata mbọ, masẹ ẹkhọhkha.<verse eid="EXO 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 39:7" />Ma wọ, abẹ akpạna ata mbọ k'mvạrakpa nnọ k'nkkang s'ẹphọd, ede masẹ ata p'ijima enạng anạng p'Israẹl, otor k'oche kw'uwa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs ọtọhna. <verse eid="EXO 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 39:8" />Abẹ ayokhu ẹvạrakpa ch'ittemmạma, kw'ode ọbọhktọhm f'ommengkka-nạng. Abẹ atim ndikhi s'gol, ọttạra s'ide blu, ọttạra s'ikhor ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhoru isisẹ, ọttạra ndikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok, ayok sẹ ukhira ngwọ gwạnọ oche kw'abẹ ayokhu ẹphọd. <verse eid="EXO 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 39:9" />Ẹkpa chẹ ọttạra adum pẹ ade obengana, adum ọttạra ẹkpa ade ẹbọhkpattem jạnẹ, de annwyạng ibyi ifa. <verse eid="EXO 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 39:10" />Wa abẹ abạra atạkha ata p'ajibh-ujibh, atọhn k'akpakhaana annebung. K'ocheden-kpakhaana abẹ atọhnọ ata p'ruby, ọttạra p'topaz, ọttạra bẹryl, <verse eid="EXO 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 39:11" />k'ọkpakhaana kw'ottong afa, abẹ atọhn ata p'tọkwois, ọttạra p'saphiya, ọttạra p'ẹmẹral; <verse eid="EXO 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 39:12" />k'ọkpakhaana kw'ottong attaan, abẹ atọhn ata p'jasint, ọttạra p'agate, ọttạra p'amẹtist, <verse eid="EXO 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 39:13" />k'ọkpakhaana kw'ottong onnebung abẹ ọta kw'krisolita, ọttạra kw'oniks, ọttạra kw'jaspa. Abẹ atim gol afhạrọ amakpa pabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 39:14" />Ata mbọ wa ade jobh-kamfa, chidede ebe k'eche ch'ujunungnwa wạnọ kw'Israẹl, chidede ebe masẹ ẹkhọhkha, ọttạra eche ch'ẹnạmma jạnẹ ch'Israẹl. <verse eid="EXO 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 39:15" />Abẹ atim gol ọkkọkka asi mgbakkọhbhọ sabẹ ayokh-oyok, asẹ ide masẹ idikhi. <verse eid="EXO 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 39:16" />Abẹ abạra atima gol asi nnạna mfa, ọttạra ariringi afa, abẹ akpạna ariringi mbọ afa k'nnwyạnga mfa s'ẹvạrakpa njọ ch'ittemmạma. <verse eid="EXO 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 39:17" />Abẹ akpạna mgbakkọhbhọ mvọ ọfa f'gol ma k'ariringi mbọ afa k'nnwyạnga s'ẹvạrakpa ch'ittemmạma, <verse eid="EXO 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 39:18" />abẹ abạra akpạna acho mbọkha afa p'mgbakkọhbhọ mvọ ọfa k'ariringi p'aning k'nkkang, k'ititikha s'ẹphọd. <verse eid="EXO 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 39:19" />Abẹ atim gol asi ariringi afa, abẹ akpạna k'nnwyạnga mfa s'ẹvạrakpa ch'ittemmạma, k'ẹtaanga kw'ammakpa p'aning efora ẹphọd. <verse eid="EXO 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 39:20" />Abẹ abạra atima gol asi ariringi afa adwạkh-ọdwạk akpạna k'ititikha kw'ẹyạr-ẹyạr kw'ẹphọd, ọbaanga ibyi sabẹ atọhng udikhikpa kw'irin. <verse eid="EXO 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 39:21" />Abẹ atim idikhi ch'ede blu akpạna ariringi mbọ p'ẹvạrakpa ch'ittemmạma k'ariringi p'ẹphọd. Abẹ akpa chẹ k'udikhikpa kw'irin, ọfha ẹvạrakpa njọ ch'ittemmạma nạnge ẹchaarẹ ẹrengi k'ẹphọd, otor k'oche kw'Ovaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs ọtọhna. <verse eid="EXO 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 39:22" />Wa abẹ atim ivạra s'ide blu phyi-phyibh, ayok ọnọhma <char style="it">bẹ wuraam</char> kw'ẹphọd, kw'ode ọbọhktọhm f'ommenkka-nạng, <verse eid="EXO 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 39:23" />ọkhaam eje k'ottemkwẹ, masẹ ẹnọhma-dwạngọ, ch'abẹ afhạrọ amma, ọfha nạngẹ ẹyaakhẹ. <verse eid="EXO 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 39:24" />Abẹ atim ndikhi s'ide blu, ọttạra s'ikhoru ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhoru isisẹ, ọttạra mvạradikhi ikkasẹ sabẹ ayokh-oyok, ayok apomegrenet afhạrọ abem p'ọnọhma nwọ. <verse eid="EXO 39:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 39:25" />Abe abạra atima gol ọkkakwẹ asi nganyaang akpạna abaabha ammakpabem k'ottemkwẹ kw'apomegrenet. <verse eid="EXO 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 39:26" />Nganyaang nnọ ọttạra apomegrenet mbọ ajek ayok k'ottemkwẹ, abaabha abem p'ọnọhma nwọ kw'ọtọhm, otor k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs ọtọhna. <verse eid="EXO 39:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 39:27" />Abẹ atim mvạradikhi ikkasẹ ayok Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva pẹ anọhma <char style="it">bẹ wuraam</char>, kw'ode ọbọhktọhm f'ommenkka-nạng, <verse eid="EXO 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 39:28" />Abẹ abạra atima mvạradikhi ikkasẹ ayok ọvạra f'echo-dạdạbh, ọttạra adikhikpa p'echo, ọttạra ekpo-khuma py'ẹtaanga py'abẹ atim mvạradikhi ikkasẹ ayok. <verse eid="EXO 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 39:29" />Wa abẹ atim mvạradikhi ikkasẹ s'ide blu ọttạra s'ikhoru ichicho, ọttạra s'ikhoru isisẹ, ayok udikhikpa, kw'ode ọbọhktọhm f'odokhu-ọvạra, otor k'oche kw'uwa Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs ọtọhna.<verse eid="EXO 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 39:30" />Abẹ atim gol ọkkakwẹ asi ẹchaangkpa, ch'ede ivaarkpo s'awurada, abẹ akkẹr ma masẹ ẹkhọhkha bẹ́: AWURADA AKHAAM ỌVAAR UBINỌKPAABYI. <verse eid="EXO 39:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 39:31" />Ma wọ, abẹ atạkha idikhi ch'ede blu akpạna k'ivạra s'echo-dạdạbh, ator k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs ọtọhna.<verse eid="EXO 39:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mosẹs okker ọtọhm f'ibyirukhasẹ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 39:32" />Ma wọ, wa ọtọhm fidede k'ibyirukhasẹ s'Ubinọkpaabyi, ọttạra ukkira kw'etobha ukwu ọsa. Anạng p'Israẹl asi udik kwidede ator k'ukhira kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs ọtọhna. <verse eid="EXO 39:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 39:33" />Ma wọ, wa abẹ adir ibyirukhasẹ nnọ akkena Mosẹs: ukkira kwẹ, ọttạra ekpo pyẹ phyibh, ọttạra mkpạkha sẹ, ọttạra nchi s'ẹchọhmma, ọttạra nsemachi, ọttạra mkpọmmachi, ọttạra arin pẹ; <verse eid="EXO 39:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 39:34" />ọttạra ẹkpa ch'atenkpa p'arạkhạmaan-dim ch'abẹ afokhu asi-khora, ọttạra ẹkpa ch'atenkpa py'mvu, ọttạra ivạra s'ẹchọhmma s'ikpa ikwukwur imaana kha ẹtaanga, <verse eid="EXO 39:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 39:35" />ọttạra Ikwukwur s'Echekha ọttra nsemachi sẹ, ọttạra ikwukwurkpa ch'ephyokhu, <verse eid="EXO 39:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 39:36" />ọttạra okpokkro, ọttạra ekpo pyẹ phyibh, ọttạra brẹd kw'awurada, <verse eid="EXO 39:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 39:37" />ọttạra itukkạng-chi ch'gol ọkkakwẹ, ọttạra attukkạng pyẹ ọttạra ekpo pyẹ phyi-phyibh, ọttạra ana p'ekpon-yiyeni, <verse eid="EXO 39:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 39:38" />ọttạra ijabyi s'gol, ọttạra ana p'abẹ n'abyenga ọnạng k'echo, ọttạra insẹns kw'orebhi iruk, ọttạra ivạra s'ẹchọhmma s'ukkira nwọ; <verse eid="EXO 39:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 39:39" />ọttạra ijabyi s'brons, ọttạra itegba s'brons, ọttạra nsemachi sẹ, ọttạra ekpo pyẹ phyibh, ọttạra ọgbang-gbang, ọttạra ẹnạna chẹ; <verse eid="EXO 39:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 39:40" />ọttạra ọvạra f'ẹchọhmma ch'eterttem, ọttạra mkpọmmachi sẹ, ọttạra nnạna, ọttạra ivạra s'ẹchọhmma ch'eterttem; ọttạra ndikhi sẹ, ọttạra abhik p'ukkira kw'eterttem, ọttạra ekpo py'ẹnnya py'ibyirukhasẹ s'Ubinọkpaabyi, kw'ode ukkira kw'etobha <verse eid="EXO 39:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 39:41" />ọttạra nnya iyokhasẹ s'ọtọhm f'ibyirukhasẹ s'awurada, ọttạra nnya s'awurada s'Aarọn kw'ode ọfọhneja, ọttạra nnya s'ajunungva pẹ, k'okpe kw'abẹ m'asi ọtọhm f'afọhnẹja. <verse eid="EXO 39:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 39:42" />Wa anạng p'Israẹl kk'ọttọhm fidede asia ator k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs ọtọhna. <verse eid="EXO 39:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 39:43" />Mosẹs o n'ọbaan ọtọhm mvọ phyibh ose bẹ́ abẹ kk'asia ator k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'bẹ ọtọhna. Osenga ma odo bẹ.<verse eid="EXO 39:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EXO 40" />
  <para style="s">Ittima ch'ibyirukhasẹ s'Ubinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 40:1" />Ma wọ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 40:2" />“K'echedenwu ch'ocheden-phye, ttima ibyirukhasẹ s'Ubinọkpaabyi kw'ode ukkira kw'etobha. <verse eid="EXO 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 40:3" />Chok Ikwukwur nnọ s'Echekha ma ẹtaanga, abạra akpạna ivạra s'ẹchọhmma abubha sẹ. <verse eid="EXO 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 40:4" />Tima okpokkro nwọ nwa k'ẹtaanga, anạna ekpo py'ẹbaan bẹ́, anạna ma. Atima itukkạng-chi anwa ma, atạkha attukkạng anạna. <verse eid="EXO 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 40:5" />Chok ijabyi s'insẹns sabẹ atim gol asi, k'ititikha s'Ikwukwur nnọ s'Echekha, abạra akpạna ivạra s'ẹchọhmma abubha sẹ. <verse eid="EXO 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 40:6" />Chok ijabyi s'ẹnạnga ẹkkạmachẹ k'ititikha s'ẹchọhmma ch'ibyirukhasẹ s'Ubinọkpaabyi, k'ukkira kw'etobha; <verse eid="EXO 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 40:7" />abạra age asi k'okpobhu-mbọhk abera k'ottemkwẹ kw'ukkira kw'etobha ọttạra ijabyi. <verse eid="EXO 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 40:8" />Si eterttem baabha sẹ, abạra akpạna ivạra k'ẹchọhmma ch'eterttem njọ. <verse eid="EXO 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 40:9" />Tạkha ana p'abẹ n'abyenga anạng k'echo, byenga ma ibyirukhasẹ nnọ, ọttạra ọttọhk fidede f'uning ma ẹtaanga; si sẹ, ọttạra ekpo py'ẹnnya phyi-phyibh iwur, mạnna wọ asẹ m'iwur. <verse eid="EXO 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 40:10" />Gba byenga ana p'abẹ n'abyenga ọnạng k'echo ma ijabyi s'ẹnạnga ẹkkạmachẹ, ọttạra k'ekpo pyẹ phyibh, asi asẹ iwur, ọfha asẹ ide ibyi s'awurada p'ayọhng awurada. <verse eid="EXO 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 40:11" />Gba byenga ana mbọ k'ọgbangbang ọttạra k'ẹnạna chẹ, abạra asi apyẹ iwur. <verse eid="EXO 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 40:12" />Tima Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva pẹ akwu ma ẹchọhmma ch'ukkira kw'etobha, atima asi akpobhu bẹ. <verse eid="EXO 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 40:13" />Ge Aarọn nnya nnọ s'awurada, abạra abyeng-ẹ ana k'echo, abạra asi-ẹ uwur, ọfha usi ọtọhm f'ọfọhnẹja. <verse eid="EXO 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 40:14" />Gba tima ajunungva pẹ kwu, age bẹ nnya s'afọhn-nja. <verse eid="EXO 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 40:15" />Byenga bẹ ana k'ẹcho, k'oche kw'uwa abyeng otte kwabẹ, ọfha abẹ agba asi ọtọhm masẹ afọhn-nja paam. Ẹna-byenga njọ m'isi abẹ ade afọhnọ-ẹja tạrr ipimmanitor.” <verse eid="EXO 40:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 40:16" />Wa Mosẹs usi udik kwidede otor k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi oben-ẹ bẹ́, usi. <verse eid="EXO 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 40:17" />Ma wọ, wa abẹ attim ibyirukhasẹ nnọ k'echedenwu ch'ocheden-phye, k'cho kw'ottong afa. <verse eid="EXO 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 40:18" />Masẹ Mosẹs utim ibyirukhasẹ nnọ, wa abẹ achi eden asi arin pẹ, abẹ afo mkpọmmachi, abẹ age nsemachi, abạra abina ntùmú sẹ abe. <verse eid="EXO 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 40:19" />Mosẹs ukwu ọmmaama ukkirakpa ububha kẹrạng-ẹrạng kw'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ, ọbạra ububha ẹrạng-ẹrạng kw'ukkira nwọ otor k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhn-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 40:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 40:20" />Ọtạkha ata p'nnyina oge k'Ikwukwur s'Echekha, ọtạkha nsemachi ọnọhma ma Ikwukwur s'Echekha, ọbạra ọtạkha ikwukwurkpa ch'epfokhu ububha sẹ. <verse eid="EXO 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 40:21" />Ma wọ Mosẹs, utim Ikwukwur nnọ s'Echekha ọnwa k'ibyirukhasẹ ẹtaanga, ọkpạna ivạra s'ẹchọhmma ọkpa sẹ ọmaana ma ẹtaanga, ọbạra ọkpa Ikwukwur s'Echekha ọmaana ma, otor k'oche kw'Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhn-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 40:22" />Wa Mosẹs ober okpokkro k'ẹtaanga kw'ukkira kw'etobha k'ukhubha kw'okkeri ibir-ibira, k'iyaan-iyaan s'ivạra s'echọhmma nnọ, <verse eid="EXO 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 40:23" />Mosẹs ọtạkha brẹd ọnạna ma okpokkro k'ẹrạng k'ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, otor k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhn-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 40:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 40:24" />Ochok itukkạng-chi k'ibyirukhasẹ ininga ekkeri okpokkro ititikha k'ẹrạkh-ẹrạkha kw'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ, <verse eid="EXO 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 40:25" />Mosẹs ọbạra udira attukkạng mbọ obera ma ititikha s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi, otor k'oche kw'Ovaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhn-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 40:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 40:26" />Mosẹs utim ijabyi s'gol k'ibyirukhasẹ ẹtaanga k'ititikha s'ivạra s'ẹchọhmma, <verse eid="EXO 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 40:27" />Mosẹs ọbạra ọkkạmọ insẹns kw'orebhi iruk ma, otor k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhn-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 40:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 40:28" />Ma wọ, n'ọtạk ivạra s'ẹchọhmma ọkpạna k'ẹchọhmma ch'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ. <verse eid="EXO 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 40:29" />Mosẹs Utim ijabyi s'ẹnạnga ẹkkạmachẹ ọbaanga ẹchọhmma ch'ibyirukhasẹ, s'ide ibyirukhasẹ s'Ubinọkpaabyi, ọttạra ẹnạnga ch'agwu ma, otor k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtọhn-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 40:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 40:30" />Obera ọgbangbang nwọ k'ottemkwẹ kw'ibyirukhasẹ s'etobha, ọttạra ijabyi nnọ, oge asi p'mbọhk ọttạra mfhok-kpukpobhu ma ọgbangbang nwọ, <verse eid="EXO 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 40:31" />ma wọ Mosẹs ọttạra Aarọn ọttạra ajunungva p'Aarọn akpobhu mbọhk ọttạra mfhok sabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 40:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 40:32" />Wa abẹ n'akpobhu mbọhk ọttạra mfhok sabẹ k'okpe kwidede kw'abẹ m'anwa k'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ, ọttạra k'okpe kw'abẹ kk'afora k'ijabyi, ator k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi obeni Mosẹs. <verse eid="EXO 40:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 40:33" />Ma wọ Mosẹs utim eterttem ọbaabha ibyirukhasẹ nnọ, ọttạra ijabyi, ọtạkha ivạra s'ẹchọhmma ọkpạna k'ẹchọhmma ch'eterttem njọ. Wa Mosẹs okke ọtọhm mvọ phyibh.<verse eid="EXO 40:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abạrada p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 40:34" />Ma wọ, ebona ibubh ibyirukhasẹ nnọ, abạrada p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi abạra asạkha afu ibyirukhasẹ nnọ <char style="it">bẹ́ byẹr.</char> <verse eid="EXO 40:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 40:35" />Wa Mosẹs k'ibyirukhasẹ nnọ ẹtaanga dạk nókke ọnwa, ukwuru s'ebona njọ kk'ẹsạkha ininga ma, ọttạra s'uwa abạrada p'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ifu ma ibyirukhasẹ nnọ ẹtaanga.<verse eid="EXO 40:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 40:36" />K'osenga kw'anạng p'Israẹl asi phyi-phyibh, okpe kwidede kw'abẹ ase s'ebona eyebhi k'ibyirukhasẹ, abẹ abina osenga; <verse eid="EXO 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 40:37" />okhenka, de ebona nạn néyebha, abẹ osenga mábina, tạrr iwu ch'achẹ eyebhi. <verse eid="EXO 40:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 40:38" />Ma wọ, wa ebona njọ ch'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi n'ibuhba ibyirukhasẹ nnọ k'ẹya, k'irungu, m'ase ekpon ch'n'ẹyạma ma. Wa anạng p'Israẹl phyi-phyibh n'asẹ idik nnọ k'osenga kwabẹ phyi-phyibh.<verse eid="EXO 40:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 40" />
</usx>